,"name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:06:24Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"chore: add the mcprush listing claim token\n\nmcprush verifies ownership of the firecms-cloud-mcp listing by reading\nthis file from the default branch. Remove it once they send the decision.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba75febb7ac0047c67107c65a1bce211c882ba64","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/ba75febb7ac0047c67107c65a1bce211c882ba64"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/71d29b89b2b5cd22c7c250de1a18fb992de86fe5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/71d29b89b2b5cd22c7c250de1a18fb992de86fe5","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDcxZDI5Yjg5YjJiNWNkMjJjN2MyNTBkZTFhMThmYjk5MmRlODZmZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/31787049933a80ec93568dc363455360fb6101eb","sha":"31787049933a80ec93568dc363455360fb6101eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/31787049933a80ec93568dc363455360fb6101eb"}],"sha":"71d29b89b2b5cd22c7c250de1a18fb992de86fe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/71d29b89b2b5cd22c7c250de1a18fb992de86fe5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/31787049933a80ec93568dc363455360fb6101eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:45:48Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:45:48Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"ci(release): publish to the MCP Registry from a workflow of its own\n\nThe registry step failed its first real run, for 3.5.1: npm had accepted\nthe package, but still didn''t show it after the step''s five minutes of\nretries, and the registry refuses a version npm doesn''t show. As a step of\nthe npm publish job it couldn''t be re-run either: re-running the job\npublishes to npm again, which fails first.\n\nIt is now its own workflow. It runs after every successful \"Publish NPM\nPackages\" run, or by hand for a version already on npm; it waits up to 30\nminutes for npm to show the version before publishing, and it can be\nre-run alone. Stable versions only, a version already listed is skipped.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"46184bf826a09ac87210955b587e864e9278bb5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/46184bf826a09ac87210955b587e864e9278bb5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/31787049933a80ec93568dc363455360fb6101eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/31787049933a80ec93568dc363455360fb6101eb","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDMxNzg3MDQ5OTMzYTgwZWM5MzU2OGRjMzYzNDU1MzYwZmI2MTAxZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/09b2e7b344990061b3cbe8a91470f2f360e886e9","sha":"09b2e7b344990061b3cbe8a91470f2f360e886e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/09b2e7b344990061b3cbe8a91470f2f360e886e9"}],"sha":"31787049933a80ec93568dc363455360fb6101eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/31787049933a80ec93568dc363455360fb6101eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/09b2e7b344990061b3cbe8a91470f2f360e886e9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:24:54Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T13:24:54Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(mcp_server): tool descriptions that meet the Connectors Directory policy\n\nThe Claude Connectors Directory asks that tool descriptions carry no\ninstructions about model behavior or other tools. Sixteen of ours did (\"Use\nthis first\", \"use infer_collections_from_data or setup_all_collections\",\n\"confirm the choice with the user\"). Each now says what its tool does, with\nthe facts kept: what it changes, what it requires, what is permanent.\n\nIts portal also reads a tool''s title from annotations.title, and flagged\nmodify_collection''s untyped existingCollection. Every tool now repeats its\ntitle there, and the collection arguments are typed as objects.\n\nTests keep it so: every tool''s annotations.title matches its title, and no\ndescription or parameter description names another tool or says \"use this\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"edbc19c7090ef3203e30f9ea45890612c2798762","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/edbc19c7090ef3203e30f9ea45890612c2798762"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/09b2e7b344990061b3cbe8a91470f2f360e886e9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/09b2e7b344990061b3cbe8a91470f2f360e886e9","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDA5YjJlN2IzNDQ5OTAwNjFi