 code 401\" where the backend had said \"You can''t\nadd yourself to the users\". One helper, describeError, now takes the\nbackend''s message (or error) and falls back to the HTTP status, in every\ntool file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12cad4025a0cd7d9961937a3e6836414a2857656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/12cad4025a0cd7d9961937a3e6836414a2857656"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/74bd4a22ade935303ed65040a2827c23393c5fc9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/74bd4a22ade935303ed65040a2827c23393c5fc9","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDc0YmQ0YTIyYWRlOTM1MzAzZWQ2NTA0MGEyODI3YzIzMzkzYzVmYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/100138b1984569af3b4bfa00024badadeeda2e23","sha":"100138b1984569af3b4bfa00024badadeeda2e23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/100138b1984569af3b4bfa00024badadeeda2e23"}],"sha":"74bd4a22ade935303ed65040a2827c23393c5fc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/74bd4a22ade935303ed65040a2827c23393c5fc9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/100138b1984569af3b4bfa00024badadeeda2e23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:12:12Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:12:12Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"docs(website): say in the privacy policy how AI assistants connect\n\nThe hosted MCP server lets an assistant such as Claude act for a FireCMS\nCloud user, and the Connectors Directory reviews the privacy policy of what\nit lists. New section 17 says what a connection can do (what the account can\ndo, never Google Cloud), that what it reads goes to the assistant''s\nprovider, how its tokens are stored and when they expire, and how to end\none. \"Last updated\" moves to today.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c252dc6541c62efeae67c0b947ab34a2e4a13ef1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/c252dc6541c62efeae67c0b947ab34a2e4a13ef1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/100138b1984569af3b4bfa00024badadeeda2e23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/100138b1984569af3b4bfa00024badadeeda2e23","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDEwMDEzOGIxOTg0NTY5YWYzYjRiZmEwMDAyNGJhZGFkZWVkYTJlMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/6a6f0fdcfffa87b89e94eecb992e2bc2e79a1bfa","sha":"6a6f0fdcfffa87b89e94eecb992e2bc2e79a1bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/6a6f0fdcfffa87b89e94eecb992e2bc2e79a1bfa"}],"sha":"100138b1984569af3b4bfa00024badadeeda2e23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/100138b1984569af3b4bfa00024badadeeda2e23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/6a6f0fdcfffa87b89e94eecb992e2bc2e79a1bfa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:22:49Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:22:49Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"ci(release): publish every stable release to the MCP Registry\n\nThe MCP server is listed in the official MCP Registry as co.firecms/mcp, and a\nversion only gets there if someone runs mcp-publisher by hand after the npm\npublish. Now the publish job does it, for stable releases only (registry\nversions are permanent; canaries would crowd the listing):\n\n- server.json is set to the version just published;\n- mcp-publisher v1.8.1 is downloaded and checked against its SHA-256;\n- it signs in with the firecms.co DNS key, the MCP_REGISTRY_PRIVATE_KEY\n  secret, and publishes, retrying for up to five minutes while npm catches\n  up with the new version;\n- a version already in the registry is left alone, and a missing secret\n  fails the step saying so.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d9db5d807a202ef367876ce8737e47e957ce561f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/d9db5d807a202ef367876ce8737e47e957ce561f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/6a6f0fdcfffa87b89e94eecb992e2bc2e79a1bfa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/6a6f0fdcfffa87b89e94eecb992e2bc2e79a1bfa","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDZhNmYwZmRjZmZmYTg3Yjg5ZTk0ZWVjYjk5MmUyYmMyZTc5YTFiZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/52e953d9be2c0482048fcc00010970c5e8df8103","sha":"52e953d9be2c0482048fcc00010970c5e8df8103","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/52e953d9be2c0482048fcc00010970c5e8df8103"}],"sha":"6a6f0fdcfffa87b89e94eecb992e2bc2e79a1bfa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/6a6f0fdcfffa8