nts","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/0221154481f8041982f06e951e777e05d5f3b5a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:40:45Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:40:45Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"docs(website): lead the MCP server page with the hosted server\n\nThe page taught only the npx setup. It now starts with the one address for\neveryone, https://api.firecms.co/mcp, and how to add it to Claude, Claude\nCode and any client that takes a URL, with sign-in in the browser. The npx\nserver moves to \"Run the server locally\", as the way to connect a Firebase\nproject end to end from the agent; tools only it offers are marked 💻, and\nthe two repair tools are marked admin-only. Translated into de, es, fr, it\nand pt, and carried into the plain-text copy and llms.txt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"277657acedc545f775ca64dae3b1ecb77495377d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/277657acedc545f775ca64dae3b1ecb77495377d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/0221154481f8041982f06e951e777e05d5f3b5a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/0221154481f8041982f06e951e777e05d5f3b5a5","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDAyMjExNTQ0ODFmODA0MTk4MmYwNmU5NTFlNzc3ZTA1ZDVmM2I1YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/9ca9d673f17b19a589da7e50a81c882d989f435e","sha":"9ca9d673f17b19a589da7e50a81c882d989f435e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/9ca9d673f17b19a589da7e50a81c882d989f435e"}],"sha":"0221154481f8041982f06e951e777e05d5f3b5a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/0221154481f8041982f06e951e777e05d5f3b5a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/9ca9d673f17b19a589da7e50a81c882d989f435e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:40:30Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:40:30Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"feat(mcp_server): serve the MCP server hosted, at one URL for everyone\n\nFireCMS Cloud''s MCP server only ran locally: `npx @firecms/mcp-server`, signed\nin with `firecms_login`, tokens in ~/.firecms/tokens.json. Claude, Claude\nDesktop and every client that takes a server URL need a remote server with\nOAuth, and the Connectors Directory only lists those.\n\nThe new `@firecms/mcp-server/hosted` entry point serves the same tools over\nStreamable HTTP for a session the caller supplies; the FireCMS backend mounts\nit at https://api.firecms.co/mcp behind its OAuth. Each request gets its own\nserver and transport, so nothing of one person''s session outlives their\nrequest, and the entry point never loads the CLI''s login flow (a test walks\nits imports).\n\n- Every call goes through a `FireCMSSession` instead of process-wide token\n  state. The local server keeps its behaviour through `localSession`, and\n  `createFireCMSMcpServer()` with no arguments is still the local server.\n- The hosted server holds no Google Cloud credentials, so it offers no Google\n  Cloud tools: `connect_project_to_firecms` answers with the web app''s link.\n  The repair tools now require admin, since without the user''s Google token\n  they act as the project''s service account.\n- Every tool declares a title and readOnlyHint/destructiveHint. create_document\n  (with an ID), add_user (for an existing member) and connecting a project can\n  overwrite, and say so.\n- `list_projects` keeps listing with the Google token wherever the session has\n  one, exactly as 3.4, and uses the Firebase token otherwise.\n- `exports` adds `./hosted` and keeps `./dist/*` deep imports working;\n  `typesVersions` resolves `hosted` under `moduleResolution: node`.\n- The SDK floor is 1.29 and zod''s 3.25 — the versions the hosted code needs.\n- server.json and `mcpName` describe it for the MCP Registry as co.firecms/mcp.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"109682ff99c8840a34d7d29d051a5d0b666f7022","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/109682ff99c8840a34d7d29d051a5d0b666f7022"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/9ca9d673f17b19a589da7e50a81c882d989f435e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/9ca9d673f17b19a589da7e50a81c882d989f435e","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDljYTlkNjczZjE3YjE5YTU4OWRhN2U1MG