75/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/b618005b8aa077913ada9a335e1c7958947aefab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:43:47Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:43:47Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"feat(cli): ship AGENTS.md in the templates for coding agents\n\nCoding agents read AGENTS.md (Claude Code through CLAUDE.md, which\nimports it) before working on a project. It gives them the layout, the\ncommands, the docs as Markdown, and what PRO costs. The community\ntemplate''s also lists the PRO plugins for users and roles, history,\nimport/export and the collection editor, so an agent asked for one of\nthose can offer the plugin and its price before writing its own.\n\nThe community template''s authenticator now says it lets every signed-in\nuser in, and where user management is.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58947a83b40f9eeafc3039f7e2e82d525823cbf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/58947a83b40f9eeafc3039f7e2e82d525823cbf5"},"url":"http