d":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/9aaf009b0ea4a2368463821607582812978e1e15","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDlhYWYwMDliMGVhNGEyMzY4NDYzODIxNjA3NTgyODEyOTc4ZTFlMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/878908e7c9df961f896f15231511c778f3c83731","sha":"878908e7c9df961f896f15231511c778f3c83731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/878908e7c9df961f896f15231511c778f3c83731"}],"sha":"9aaf009b0ea4a2368463821607582812978e1e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/9aaf009b0ea4a2368463821607582812978e1e15"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/878908e7c9df961f896f15231511c778f3c83731/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:23:53Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:23:53Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cloud): stop listening again to a project five minutes after Firestore denies it\n\nThe retry added in 8c5bd3435 exists for the ~12s (a minute at worst) before\na new project''s members are written. For a user who never gets access, such\nas one removed from the project, both listeners kept retrying every 10s for\nas long as the tab stayed open, and each retry stored a new error object that\nre-rendered the whole client.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9ad08d7b21270025e71c2a8c599ce0fffe0bec1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/b9ad08d7b21270025e71c2a8c599ce0fffe0bec1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/878908e7c9df961f896f15231511c778f3c83731","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/878908e7c9df961f896f15231511c778f3c83731","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDg3ODkwOGU3YzlkZjk2MWY4OTZmMTUyMzE1MTFjNzc4ZjNjODM3MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/8cc2acc20a5d151c874488ccadd3d5d89be98e43","sha":"8cc2acc20a5d151c874488ccadd3d5d89be98e43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8cc2acc20a5d151c874488ccadd3d5d89be98e43"}],"sha":"878908e7c9df961f896f15231511c778f3c83731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/878908e7c9df961f896f15231511c778f3c83731"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8cc2acc20a5d151c874488ccadd3d5d89be98e43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:19:41Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T20:19:41Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cloud): ask for a stalled project''s web app, and keep listening for its logo\n\n- POST /projects creates the project''s web app in the background and leaves\n  firebase_config \"loading\". If that never finished, the new-project flow''s\n  \"FireCMS is being created\" screen and /p/{id} waited for the config\n  forever: the client only asked again when the field was missing. After 90s\n  of \"loading\" (or \"error\") it now calls POST /firebase_webapp once. The\n  wait stays well past the backend''s own polling of Google, so it can''t\n  create a second web app.\n- That endpoint answered 304 when the web app already existed; the client\n  read it as a failure and retried five times.\n- The logo listener gave up on permission-denied while the project was being\n  created, like the project listener did before 8c5bd3435.\n- The collection setup dialog no longer resets the user''s selection each\n  time its parent re-renders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c18ce0d93af45c18663f63b7b524f5deb32f702","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/3c18ce0d93af45c18663f63b7b524f5deb32f702"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/8cc2acc20a5d151c874488ccadd3d5d89be98e43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/8cc2acc20a5d151c874488ccadd3d5d89be98e43","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDhjYzJhY2MyMGE1ZDE1MWM4NzQ0ODhjY2FkZDNkNWQ4OWJlOThlNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/a92f54c41df351efdceb11bd88cc9ea30cdca5d7","sha":"a92f54c41df351efdceb11bd88cc9ea30cdca5d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/a92f54c41df351efdceb11bd88cc9ea30cdca5d7"}],"sha":"8cc2acc20a5d151c874488ccadd3d5d89be98e43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8cc2acc20a5d151c874488ccadd3d5d89be98e43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/a92f54c41df351efdceb11bd88cc9ea30cdca5d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:56:33Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T14:56:33Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"Changelog update","tree":{"sha":"02c7c537665c4a0c29d74803b870abf8d7bbeaa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/02c7c537665c4a0c29d74803b870abf8d7bbeaa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/a92f54c41df351efdceb11bd88cc9ea30cdca5d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/a92f54c41df351efdceb11bd88cc9ea30cdca5d7","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGE5MmY1NGM0MWRmMzUxZWZkY2ViMTFiZDg4Y2M5ZWEzMGNkY2E1ZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/d40ccae5cc030debdf4434386639691c6e2df634","sha":"d40ccae5cc030debdf4434386639691c6e2df634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/d40ccae5cc030debdf4434386639691c6e2df634"}],"sha":"a92f54c41df351efdceb11bd88cc9ea30cdca5d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/a92f54c41df351efdceb11bd88cc9ea30cdca5d7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/d40ccae5cc030debdf4434386639691c6e2df634/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:35:31Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:35:31Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cloud): explain failed collection setups, and stop spinning on dead ones\n\nEvery collection setup entry point (the setup button, the selection dialog,\nthe suggestion chips) showed the same \"Error setting up collections\" toast\nwhatever went wrong. A service account that was deleted, revoked or disabled\nnow opens CloudErrorView in a dialog, which offers \"Recreate service account\"\nwhere that helps and runs the setup again once it is fixed. A setup asked for\nbefore the project finished being created says so; anything else shows its\nmessage. Pairs with saas_backend 9f9b692.\n\nAn \"ongoing\" setup status also no longer spins forever. The backend writes it\nwhen a setup starts, so a setup whose process dies never clears it, and every\nsetup button on the project stayed loading: eight projects were stuck like that\nin production in Sep 2026, all without a timestamp. A status with no timestamp,\nor older than 10 minutes (the backend function is killed after 300s), now\ncounts as over.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b232b2d70d48a78ee151ea32106be54b2fc206ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/b232b2d70d48a78ee151ea32106be54b2fc206ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/d40ccae5cc030debdf4434386639691c6e2df634","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/d40ccae5cc030debdf4434386639691c6e2df634","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGQ0MGNjYWU1Y2MwMzBkZWJkZjQ0MzQzODY2Mzk2OTFjNmUyZGY2MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/1f9a70934873de2e2a16e944410faa996e7a6922","sha":"1f9a70934873de2e2a16e944410faa996e7a6922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1f9a70934873de2e2a16e944410faa996e7a6922"}],"sha":"d40ccae5cc030debdf4434386639691c6e2df634","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/d40ccae5cc030debdf4434386639691c6e2df634"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1f9a70934873de2e2a16e944410faa996e7a6922/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:49:04Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:49:04Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cloud): set up at most three suggested collections at once\n\nOn 2026-08-23 a user clicked 30 collection suggestion chips in 30 seconds. Each\nclick is its own setup_collections request, and each request lists the project''s\nroot collections before asking the model to describe its collection. Thirty at once\nused up the project''s Firestore admin quota (DatabaseOperationsPerMinutePerProject,\n60), every request spent about a minute in 429 retries, and three failed.\n\nThese weren''t duplicates (every chip was a different path), so the chips now share\na queue: three setups run at a time and later clicks wait their turn. A waiting\nchip already shows its spinner, so the UI is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ab570f4aeb703377f76eddd082938caad0579185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/ab570f4aeb703377f76eddd082938caad0579185"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/1f9a70934873de2e2a16e944410faa996e7a6922","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/1f9a70934873de2e2a16e944410faa996e7a6922","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDFmOWE3MDkzNDg3M2RlMmUyYTE2ZTk0NDQxMGZhYTk5NmU3YTY5MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/8c5bd3435d2f418cbe579e2534033a183358da5d","sha":"8c5bd3435d2f418cbe579e2534033a183358da5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8c5bd3435d2f418cbe579e2534033a183358da5d"}],"sha":"1f9a70934873de2e2a16e944410faa996e7a6922","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1f9a70934873de2e2a16e944410faa996e7a6922"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8c5bd3435d2f418cbe579e2534033a183358da5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:34:33Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:34:33Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cloud): listen to a project again after Firestore denies the read\n\nA project that is still being created denies reads to its creator: the Firestore\nrules only allow users listed under projects/{id}/users, and that list is written\nat the end of provisioning. Firestore ends a listener for good once it is denied,\nso useBuildProjectConfig never saw the project arrive. Accounts outside @firecms.co\n(everyone the isAdmin rule doesn''t cover) were affected:\n\n- the new-project survey never learned the service account existed, so collection\n  setup could start before it did (see the matching saas fix)\n- after the survey, \"FireCMS is being created, hang on\" never cleared. Of the 67\n  users who finished the survey between 2026-08-01 and 2026-09-14, about 9 went\n  straight to their project. The rest reloaded after 1 to 60+ minutes, or left.\n\nOn permission-denied the hook now subscribes again with backoff (1s, doubling,\ncapped at 10s) until it is unmounted. Checked against the Firestore emulator\nrunning the deployed rules with a non-admin user: the old hook still reported\nserviceAccountMissing undefined 15s after the project was written; this one\nreceived the service account and Firebase config.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4d0d568b3787f540786952baebdf6eb46563798e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/4d0d568b3787f540786952baebdf6eb46563798e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/8c5bd3435d2f418cbe579e2534033a183358da5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/8c5bd3435d2f418cbe579e2534033a183358da5d","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDhjNWJkMzQzNWQyZjQxOGNiZTU3OWUyNTM0MDMzYTE4MzM1OGRhNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/00f9be59942de263266f696d76fbf3386139bff7","sha":"00f9be59942de263266f696d76fbf3386139bff7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/00f9be59942de263266f696d76fbf3386139bff7"}],"sha":"8c5bd3435d2f418cbe579e2534033a183358da5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8c5bd3435d2f418cbe579e2534033a183358da5d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/00f9be59942de263266f696d76fbf3386139bff7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:57:08Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:57:08Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cloud): say graduated PRO prices exclude VAT in the subscriptions list\n\nThe graduated PRO prices in Stripe are tax-exclusive, and firecms.co now says\n\"+ VAT\"; the subscriptions list showed the bare amounts.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fe9f81308bbd9a23e011db95766110a1127a057","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/1fe9f81308bbd9a23e011db95766110a1127a057"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/00f9be59942de263266f696d76fbf3386139bff7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/00f9be59942de263266f696d76fbf3386139bff7","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDAwZjliZTU5OTQyZGUyNjMyNjZmNjk2ZDc2ZmJmMzM4NjEzOWJmZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/54968979633ae6dd17c502518577d3de95915af6","sha":"54968979633ae6dd17c502518577d3de95915af6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/54968979633ae6dd17c502518577d3de95915af6"}],"sha":"00f9be59942de263266f696d76fbf3386139bff7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/00f9be59942de263266f696d76fbf3386139bff7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/54968979633ae6dd17c502518577d3de95915af6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:54:18Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:54:18Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"feat(core): pause PRO on a project its license doesn''t pay for in production\n\nThe backend now answers over_quota with blocked: true for a project beyond the\nproduction places a license pays for (saas_backend 4073771, in production since\n2026-09-16). The over-quota banner was a dismissible note saying nothing was\npaused; it is now a warning that stays, saying this project is not one the\nlicense pays for in production, in all eight locales. The license type docs\nmatch, the pausing tests cover over_quota, and User Management''s paused notice\nlinks \"Update your license\" instead of \"Get a license\" for this state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d34aa6c69d56e8d5d6d29c4c29af3cb526901fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/9d34aa6c69d56e8d5d6d29c4c29af3cb526901fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/54968979633ae6dd17c502518577d3de95915af6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/54968979633ae6dd17c502518577d3de95915af6","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDU0OTY4OTc5NjMzYWU2ZGQxN2M1MDI1MTg1NzdkM2RlOTU5MTVhZjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/1cd866dffe990e9ce46febef8df17a15514f513b","sha":"1cd866dffe990e9ce46febef8df17a15514f513b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1cd866dffe990e9ce46febef8df17a15514f513b"}],"sha":"54968979633ae6dd17c502518577d3de95915af6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/54968979633ae6dd17c502518577d3de95915af6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1cd866dffe990e9ce46febef8df17a15514f513b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:11:03Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T09:11:03Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(website): say PRO prices exclude VAT\n\nThe graduated PRO prices in Stripe are tax-exclusive: €99 / $119 is the net\namount and Stripe Tax adds VAT or sales tax at checkout. /pro, /pricing, the\nself-hosting overview and the licensing page showed the bare amount, so a\nconsumer in Spain expecting €99 would be charged €119.79. Every PRO price now\ncarries the tax note, in all six locales: \"+ VAT\", \"zzgl. MwSt.\", \"+ IVA\",\n\"HT\", \"+ impostos\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"248916b9933b12d4d1d82b9f951d164e98211fb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/248916b9933b12d4d1d82b9f951d164e98211fb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/1cd866dffe990e9ce46febef8df17a15514f513b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/1cd866dffe990e9ce46febef8df17a15514f513b","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDFjZDg2NmRmZmU5OTBlOWNlNDZmZWJlZjhkZjE3YTE1NTE0ZjUxM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/eb1a07782b0bff8802be87b373784821dc35fdaf","sha":"eb1a07782b0bff8802be87b373784821dc35fdaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/eb1a07782b0bff8802be87b373784821dc35fdaf"}],"sha":"1cd866dffe990e9ce46febef8df17a15514f513b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1cd866dffe990e9ce46febef8df17a15514f513b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/eb1a07782b0bff8802be87b373784821dc35fdaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:42:30Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:42:30Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"docs(pro): a license covers as many production projects as it pays for\n\nThe licensing page promised \"Nothing is ever blocked because a license has more\nprojects linked than it pays for.\" Over-quota projects now pause PRO in\nproduction: the ones that went live first keep it, the others pause until the\nlicense pays for them, and local development never counts. Updated in all six\nlocales, the public page mirror and llms.txt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24f17fce57e3eb754b44c07cb0501448ab1cbee0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/24f17fce57e3eb754b44c07cb0501448ab1cbee0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/eb1a07782b0bff8802be87b373784821dc35fdaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/eb1a07782b0bff8802be87b373784821dc35fdaf","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGViMWEwNzc4MmIwYmZmODgwMmJlODdiMzczNzg0ODIxZGMzNWZkYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/83dcb378b3a9d15b8af2f82b336430283185a7cf","sha":"83dcb378b3a9d15b8af2f82b336430283185a7cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/83dcb378b3a9d15b8af2f82b336430283185a7cf"}],"sha":"eb1a07782b0bff8802be87b373784821dc35fdaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/eb1a07782b0bff8802be87b373784821dc35fdaf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/83dcb378b3a9d15b8af2f82b336430283185a7cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:39:51Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:39:51Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"docs: remove the retired MongoDB Atlas guide and make the self-hosting docs database-neutral\n\nThe MongoDB guide documented @firecms/mongodb, which is no longer in the\nmonorepo (last published as 3.2.0), on top of Atlas App Services and the Data\nAPI, which MongoDB has retired. The page is deleted in all six locales, its\nsidebar entry is gone, and firebase.json redirects /docs/self/mongodb (and each\nlocale''s copy, with or without a trailing slash) to the self-hosting overview.\n\nThe rest of the docs stop naming MongoDB:\n- the docs home, the self-hosting overview, telemetry (including \"Firestore or\n  Atlas content\"), useAuthController, useDataSource and the controllers page,\n  which listed the removed @firecms/mongodb delegate and auth controller;\n- the security best practices guide now speaks of \"your database\": the injection\n  section whitelists collections, fields and FireCMS''s own filter operators\n  instead of relying on mongo-sanitize, and the MongoDB-specific section and\n  checklist rows are general database security.\n\npublic/llms.txt and the public page mirror are regenerated, and the generator''s\nheader no longer calls FireCMS a CMS for Firebase/MongoDB. The CHANGELOG and old\nblog posts keep their MongoDB entries as history.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"936ce64bc0a41163fdf48f4367ef6deb2b63a3f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/936ce64bc0a41163fdf48f4367ef6deb2b63a3f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/83dcb378b3a9d15b8af2f82b336430283185a7cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/83dcb378b3a9d15b8af2f82b336430283185a7cf","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDgzZGNiMzc4YjNhOWQxNWI4YWYyZjgyYjMzNjQzMDI4MzE4NWE3Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/604ada500c110b284c521d0976595102db986547","sha":"604ada500c110b284c521d0976595102db986547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/604ada500c110b284c521d0976595102db986547"}],"sha":"83dcb378b3a9d15b8af2f82b336430283185a7cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/83dcb378b3a9d15b8af2f82b336430283185a7cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/604ada500c110b284c521d0976595102db986547/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:39:25Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:39:25Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(website): stop advertising MongoDB on the marketing pages\n\nMongoDB support has been removed, but the landing, startups, security, why and\n/pro pages still said FireCMS connects to \"Firebase or MongoDB\", including the\nsite-wide default title and description and the web app manifest. Every mention\nis gone in all six locales. The Firestore GUI page keeps \"MongoDB has Compass\",\nwhich compares database tools rather than claiming support.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bd8ca56b9735256d424349da1502f70ebb8828a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/bd8ca56b9735256d424349da1502f70ebb8828a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/604ada500c110b284c521d0976595102db986547","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/604ada500c110b284c521d0976595102db986547","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDYwNGFkYTUwMGMxMTBiMjg0YzUyMWQwOTc2NTk1MTAyZGI5ODY1NDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/519780fec9b1fa259377d4fae85591f8abce8818"