/api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/334156a25f5972a441e783132e9dafd2e2a48b3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:00:31Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T08:00:31Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(website): address the /pro features heading to any app team, not only agencies\n\n\"The admin screens your clients ask for\" spoke only to agencies. Nearly all\nlicensed PRO deployments are companies running their own app (a wellness app,\na made-to-measure clothing app, a trail association, a sports-safety nonprofit,\na construction data product), with agencies mostly appearing as the builder\nbehind one of them. The heading now reads \"The admin screens every app ends up\nneeding, already built\", in all six locales.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f750c17333bb493693b1a75488d5c9aece8683e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/1f750c17333bb493693b1a75488d5c9aece8683e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/334156a25f5972a441e783132e9dafd2e2a48b3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/334156a25f5972a441e783132e9dafd2e2a48b3d","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDMzNDE1NmEyNWY1OTcyYTQ0MWU3ODMxMzJlOWRhZmQyZTJhNDhiM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/db6f12660f6727d5b953e7a8aeb1d508ddf29686","sha":"db6f12660f6727d5b953e7a8aeb1d508ddf29686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/db6f12660f6727d5b953e7a8aeb1d508ddf29686"}],"sha":"334156a25f5972a441e783132e9dafd2e2a48b3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/334156a25f5972a441e783132e9dafd2e2a48b3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/db6f12660f6727d5b953e7a8aeb1d508ddf29686/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:57:43Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:57:43Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(ui): keep a side gutter on full-width dialogs on narrow screens\n\nA dialog with a maxWidth got both `w-11/12` and a Tailwind v4 container\nwidth such as `w-xl`. tailwind-merge 2.x doesn''t treat `w-xl` as a width,\nso both classes stayed and the CSS order decided the winner: `w-lg` and\n`w-xl` come after `w-11/12`, so export, delete and confirmation dialogs\nfilled a 400px screen edge to edge, while `7xl` dialogs kept their gutter.\n\nThe `max-w-*` cap now always applies and the fixed `w-*` width only when\nthe dialog isn''t fullWidth, which restores the Tailwind v3 behaviour:\n11/12 of the screen, up to the max width. Desktop sizes are unchanged\n(measured 576/512/1280px before and after at 1440px).\n\nThe import dialog''s first step passed fullWidth={false}, which today\nonly meant \"no gutter on phones\" (it is 512px on desktop either way),\nso it now uses the default.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e6b9ae86fbdf3bffbe8591f5ff5187acb611282","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/3e6b9ae86fbdf3bffbe8591f5ff5187acb611282"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/db6f12660f6727d5b953e7a8aeb1d508ddf29686","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/db6f12660f6727d5b953e7a8aeb1d508ddf29686","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGRiNmYxMjY2MGY2NzI3ZDViOTUzZTdhOGFlYjFkNTA4ZGRmMjk2ODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/791f587d9c98bbd2e677cfeb18f6ab5cf018b462","sha":"791f587d9c98bbd2e677cfeb18f6ab5cf018b462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/791f587d9c98bbd2e677cfeb18f6ab5cf018b462"}],"sha":"db6f12660f6727d5b953e7a8aeb1d508ddf29686","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/db6f12660f6727d5b953e7a8aeb1d508ddf29686"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/791f587d9c98bbd2e677cfeb18f6ab5cf018b462/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:52:55Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:52:55Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(website): replace the broken feature icons on /pro and load the demo icon font from the bundle\n\nTwo of the five feature icons on /pro were garbled hand-written SVG paths that\nrendered as scribbles (schema editor, users and roles), and entity history used\nan open book. All five now use the site''s own Lucide set; arrow-down-up and\ntable-properties are added to icons.ts from the pinned lucide-static 1.34.0.\n\nThe \"Buy a license\" arrow carried both text-white and text-black, and white won:\na white arrow on the yellow button. It is black now.\n\nThe product demos each fetched Material Icons from Google Fonts after hydrating,\na second copy of the self-hosted font @firecms/ui already puts in the page head.\nThey import @material-design-icons/font/filled.css instead, and the\nuseMaterialIcons hook and the two inline loaders are gone. DataTalkDemo loaded\nno font at all and relied on another demo on the page; it imports it too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08b7ff708769affc65c40fb40469d1b71ba955b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/08b7ff708769affc65c40fb40469d1b71ba955b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/791f587d9c98bbd2e677cfeb18f6ab5cf018b462","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/791f587d9c98bbd2e677cfeb18f6ab5cf018b462","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDc5MWY1ODdkOWM5OGJiZDJlNjc3Y2ZlYjE4ZjZhYjVjZjAxOGI0NjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/1dedf0e225d4a01dea24e2925cecd250401554f3","sha":"1dedf0e225d4a01dea24e2925cecd250401554f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1dedf0e225d4a01dea24e2925cecd250401554f3"}],"sha":"791f587d9c98bbd2e677cfeb18f6ab5cf018b462","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/791f587d9c98bbd2e677cfeb18f6ab5cf018b462"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1dedf0e225d4a01dea24e2925cecd250401554f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:48:22Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:48:22Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(data_export): keep the export dialog open until the file downloads, and show why it failed\n\nDownload closed the dialog as soon as it was clicked, before the data was fetched, so\nthe spinner shown while loading was never visible. A failure was stored in\n`dataLoadingError` but never rendered: an export refused for permissions, a dropped\nconnection or a large collection timing out only logged \"Error loading export data\" to\nthe console, and to the user clicking Download did nothing.\n\nThe dialog now waits for the export. Download shows its progress (LoadingButton) and the\ndialog closes once the file has been downloaded. On failure it stays open with an error\nalert carrying the message (\"Could not export the data: Missing or insufficient\npermissions.\"), cleared when the dialog is reopened or a new download starts. The full\nexport and the selected-rows export behave the same way.\n\nClosing the dialog while an export runs (Cancel, Escape, clicking outside) abandons it:\nno file downloads seconds later and no error appears on reopening.\n\nAdds the `export_error` translation key to all eight locales.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5bd76fa281b5f57a56aa25ecc1f3117b2850773","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/e5bd76fa281b5f57a56aa25ecc1f3117b2850773"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/1dedf0e225d4a01dea24e2925cecd250401554f3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/1dedf0e225d4a01dea24e2925cecd250401554f3","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDFkZWRmMGUyMjVkNGEwMWRlYTI0ZTI5MjVjZWNkMjUwNDAxNTU0ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/519fadc943db69bee93d724ebeec509ee84a9262","sha":"519fadc943db69bee93d724ebeec509ee84a9262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/519fadc943db69bee93d724ebeec509ee84a9262"}],"sha":"1dedf0e225d4a01dea24e2925cecd250401554f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1dedf0e225d4a01dea24e2925cecd250401554f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/519fadc943db69bee93d724ebeec509ee84a9262/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:46:33Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T07:46:33Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"style(data_export): regroup the export dialog around segmented choices\n\nThe dialog stacked unlabelled, indented radio groups between compounding gaps\n(gap-4 + p-4 + label p-2), put the filter switch and the large-collection warning far\nfrom the \"All entities\" choice they qualify, and opened with \"Download the content of\nthis table as a CSV\", which is wrong once JSON is picked.\n\nIt is now one column of three groups, 24px apart and flush with the switch rows:\n- Which entities: All / Selected (n), with the filter switch and the warning beneath\n  it, since both only apply to \"All\".\n- The format: CSV / JSON, with \"Flatten arrays\" beneath it, shown only for CSV. It\n  used to stay switched on but disabled for JSON, which read as if arrays would be\n  flattened.\n- How values are written: the date format, with a caption showing how a date will\n  read in the file in place of the long examples inside the labels, and \"Include\n  undefined values\".\n\nThe choices use ToggleButtonGroup, which FireCMS already uses for its view-mode\nswitches. Its new optional `fullWidth` prop splits the width evenly and balances\nlabels that wrap on narrow screens. `notAllowedView` moves to the top, before the\noptions it makes unusable, and Download is the primary action, as in the import\ndialog. With a selection the dialog goes from 513px to 416px tall at desktop width.\n\nAlso fixes \"This collections has a large number of documents\" in English.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a802b0b63ef18b5e3f926ebde34fbc00a624d05d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/a802b0b63ef18b5e3f926ebde34fbc00a624d05d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/519fadc943db69bee93d724ebeec509ee84a9262","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/519fadc943db69bee93d724ebeec509ee84a9262","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDUxOWZhZGM5NDNkYjY5YmVlOTNkNzI0ZWJlZWM1MDllZTg0YTkyNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/9408c4180d1384e47360d0cacef63d9fbdfa0d08","sha":"9408c4180d1384e47360d0cacef63d9fbdfa0d08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/9408c4180d1384e47360d0cacef63d9fbdfa0d08"}],"sha":"519fadc943db69bee93d724ebeec509ee84a9262","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/519fadc943db69bee93d724ebeec509ee84a9262"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/9408c4180d1384e47360d0cacef63d9fbdfa0d08/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T01:18:06Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T01:18:06Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(core): stop shipping a build-time Vite plugin as a runtime dependency\n\n`vite-plugin-static-copy` was a dependency of @firecms/core and a devDependency of\n@firecms/ui, and neither imports it: ui replaced it with a five-line copy step when\nits v4 moved the output, and core never used it at all. Its peer range let npm\ninstall **Vite 8** into the root of every FireCMS app, which is the version\nmismatch Astro warns about on every start (astro 6 wants Vite 7).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bbc76974575e83cb22a12b01c5f1b9c8d71c2a76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/bbc76974575e83cb22a12b01c5f1b9c8d71c2a76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/9408c4180d1384e47360d0cacef63d9fbdfa0d08","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/9408c4180d1384e47360d0cacef63d9fbdfa0d08","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDk0MDhjNDE4MGQxMzg0ZTQ3MzYwZDBjYWNlZjYzZDlmYmRmYTBkMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/97abfa5270f7fd1b135368cac3a0a1dc72df6ec1","sha":"97abfa5270f7fd1b135368cac3a0a1dc72df6ec1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/97abfa5270f7fd1b135368cac3a0a1dc72df6ec1"}],"sha":"9408c4180d1384e47360d0cacef63d9fbdfa0d08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/9408c4180d1384e47360d0cacef63d9fbdfa0d08"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/97abfa5270f7fd1b135368cac3a0a1dc72df6ec1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T01:17:55Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T01:17:55Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): make a scaffolded project work with pnpm, yarn and older Node\n\nFound running every template through each package manager and Node version.\n\n- **pnpm 11 could not install a template, or even start one.** It refuses until\n  the dependencies that run install scripts are approved, and it re-runs that\n  check before `pnpm run`, so `install`, `dev` and `build` all failed with\n  ERR_PNPM_IGNORED_BUILDS: every pnpm 11 user, all five templates. Each template\n  now approves exactly what it needs, in the spellings pnpm 10 (`onlyBuiltDependencies`)\n  and pnpm 11 (`allowBuilds`) read. Verified with real pnpm 11: install and build\n  clean for all five.\n  The template check had been hiding this by passing `strictDepBuilds: false`;\n  that crutch is gone, so it now fails the way a user would.\n- **yarn 2+ defaults to Plug''n''Play**, which neither Astro''s config loader nor\n  Next''s Turbopack can load: next-pro and astro shipped no `.yarnrc.yml` while the\n  other three did. Both now install and build under yarn 3.8.\n- Each template declares the Node it needs (Tailwind''s native binding 20, Next\n  20.9, Astro 22.12). On Node 18 the failure used to arrive as \"Cannot find native\n  binding\" at dev time, long after install said nothing was wrong.\n- A logged-out scaffold showed a **blank page** on first `npm run dev`: the app\n  threw while rendering, so the browser showed nothing and the reason was only in\n  the console. It now names the file to fill in, and recognises the placeholders\n  the template ships rather than only an absent project id.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fa5ccd809120928ee36e47bae7439145cb596431","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/fa5ccd809120928ee36e47bae7439145cb596431"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/97abfa5270f7fd1b135368cac3a0a1dc72df6ec1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/97abfa5270f7fd1b135368cac3a0a1dc72df6ec1","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDk3YWJmYTUyNzBmN2ZkMWIxMzUzNjhjYWMzYTBhMWRjNzJkZjZlYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/ce97da7433ec65335e89c3bf62fb6f90f2706ded","sha":"ce97da7433ec65335e89c3bf62fb6f90f2706ded","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/ce97da7433ec65335e89c3bf62fb6f90f2706ded"}],"sha":"97abfa5270f7fd1b135368cac3a0a1dc72df6ec1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/97abfa5270f7fd1b135368cac3a0a1dc72df6ec1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/ce97da7433ec65335e89c3bf62fb6f90f2706ded/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:54:28Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:54:28Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): let an unavailable product be saved, and give the PRO template its History tab\n\nIn the template''s own schema `price` was required and also cleared-and-disabled\nwhile a product is unavailable, so the form could never validate: editing or\nduplicating any unavailable product was impossible, which is the first thing a\nnew PRO user meets with their own data. It is required only while available, and\nno longer cleared — an existing or imported product keeps the price it has.\n\nDropping `clearOnDisabled` matters beyond the form: with it, importing a\nspreadsheet wrote `price: null` for every row. Property builders are resolved\nwithout the entity''s own values when saving, so every imported row looks\n\"unavailable\" and the value is cleared. The importer keeps its values now; the\nunderlying behaviour is reported separately.\n\n@firecms/entity_history was a dependency nothing mounted, while a lapsed licence\npauses \"history\" in the banner, so the template now mounts it and the signed-in\ncheck asserts the licence request carries all six PRO plugin keys.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"57def3266ea57382cd4cd899a4de738f7b228ac0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/57def3266ea57382cd4cd899a4de738f7b228ac0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/ce97da7433ec65335e89c3bf62fb6f90f2706ded","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/ce97da7433ec65335e89c3bf62fb6f90f2706ded","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGNlOTdkYTc0MzNlYzY1MzM1ZTg5YzNiZjYyZmI2ZjkwZjI3MDZkZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/92d5ecd238e5807bccdad095bfdc682e9a46dde2","sha":"92d5ecd238e5807bccdad095bfdc682e9a46dde2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/92d5ecd238e5807bccdad095bfdc682e9a46dde2"}],"sha":"ce97da7433ec65335e89c3bf62fb6f90f2706ded","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/ce97da7433ec65335e89c3bf62fb6f90f2706ded"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/92d5ecd238e5807bccdad095bfdc682e9a46dde2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:42:56Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:42:56Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(core): match a collection path only at a segment boundary\n\nFound testing the canary as a user would, in a browser.\n\nA collection matched any path that merely started with its own, so the PRO\ntemplate''s own \"open a custom entity\" example (path `/products-test`) resolved to\nthe `products` collection with an entity called `-test`, and the browser showed\n\"Invalid document reference … products/-test/B003WT1622 has 3 segments\". A user\ncollection called `products_archive` — what the collection editor generates from\n\"Products archive\" — resolved to `products` the same way, with warnings on every\nrender. The new test fails on the old rule; core''s 709 tests still pass.\n\nIn the PRO template, from the same session:\n- `price` was required and also cleared-and-disabled while a product is\n  unavailable, so the form could never validate: editing or duplicating any\n  unavailable product was impossible. It is required only while available.\n- The products collection asks for text search, which needs a search controller\n  or the local-search flag, or the box stays permanently dead. Local search is on.\n- @firecms/entity_history was a dependency nothing mounted, while a lapsed\n  licence pauses \"history\" in the banner. It is mounted, so there is a History tab.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13ae4ab1504ce2ed4a361fc4e51a1c4539316ef4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/13ae4ab1504ce2ed4a361fc4e51a1c4539316ef4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/92d5ecd238e5807bccdad095bfdc682e9a46dde2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/92d5ecd238e5807bccdad095bfdc682e9a46dde2","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDkyZDVlY2QyMzhlNTgwN2JjY2RhZDA5NWJmZGM2ODJlOWE0NmRkZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/a2d0d8b484631cd9599097aedf42ce41d9c8e635","sha":"a2d0d8b484631cd9599097aedf42ce41d9c8e635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/a2d0d8b484631cd9599097aedf42ce41d9c8e635"}],"sha":"92d5ecd238e5807bccdad095bfdc682e9a46dde2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/92d5ecd238e5807bccdad095bfdc682e9a46dde2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/a2d0d8b484631cd9599097aedf42ce41d9c8e635/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:32:39Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:32:39Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): keep the astro template''s .env in the repository, like next-pro''s\n\nIt holds PUBLIC_FIRECMS_API_KEY, which Astro puts in the client bundle anyway, so\nignoring it meant a clone of the project had no licence key and its PRO features\npaused once the trial ended. Private values belong in .env.local, which is\nignored. next-pro already ships this reasoning in its own ignore file.\n\nAlso: the signed-in check said \"TypeError: fetch failed\" when the emulators had\nexited under it (another process on the machine sending SIGTERM, which leaves a\n143 in emulators.log). It now says so and where to look.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"993ae8948ba9d4b1618a52d867f866f01d7d2552","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/993ae8948ba9d4b1618a52d867f866f01d7d2552"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/a2d0d8b484631cd9599097aedf42ce41d9c8e635","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/a2d0d8b484631cd9599097aedf42ce41d9c8e635","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGEyZDBkOGI0ODQ2MzFjZDk1OTkwOTdhZWRmNDJjZTQxZDljOGU2MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/338fa85252c14b597d27894c6a4c237da5dc1834","sha":"338fa85252c14b597d27894c6a4c237da5dc1834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/338fa85252c14b597d27894c6a4c237da5dc1834"}],"sha":"a2d0d8b484631cd9599097aedf42ce41d9c8e635","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/a2d0d8b484631cd9599097aedf42ce41d9c8e635"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/338fa85252c14b597d27894c6a4c237da5dc1834/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:17:48Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:17:48Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): make the templates work as scaffolded, in dev as well as built\n\nFound testing the 3.4.0 canary as a user would.\n\nastro\n- `astro dev` rendered every page blank: no island hydrated, because the React\n  renderer is served unbundled while react-dom is pre-bundled, so its\n  `react-dom/client` import resolved to the untransformed CommonJS file\n  (\"does not provide an export named ''createRoot''\"). Pre-bundling it fixes dev;\n  the built server was never affected. Reproduced with a plain React counter and\n  no FireCMS, and on 3.4.0, so it is upstream and version-driven.\n- Vite is a direct dependency, pinned to the 7.x astro asks for. Installing left\n  astro''s 7 beside the 8 that @tailwindcss/vite''s peer range allows, and astro\n  warned about the mismatch on every start.\n- The public blog listed drafts: it queried the collection the CMS writes to with\n  no status filter, unlike the Next.js template.\n\ncommunity\n- The demo collection referenced `users` and `products`, and only the demo\n  collection was mounted, so every row and form showed an error where a reference\n  should be. The products collection it ships is mounted now, and the reference to\n  a `users` collection this template does not have is gone.\n- The price property said `title:` where a property takes `name:`, so the field\n  had no label; the collection has a singular name, so deleting an entry no\n  longer asks to \"delete this Demo collection?\".\n\nnext-pro\n- `npm run lint` could only fail: `next lint` was removed in Next 16 and the\n  template carries no eslint config.\n- /products and /blog were built once and never changed in production, so content\n  edited in the CMS never appeared. They revalidate once a minute.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ccdfef55018e1c4b624ae13007c105dd9b76505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/6ccdfef55018e1c4b624ae13007c105dd9b76505"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/338fa85252c14b597d27894c6a4c237da5dc1834","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/338fa85252c14b597d27894c6a4c237da5dc1834","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDMzOGZhODUyNTJjMTRiNTk3ZDI3ODk0YzZhNGMyMzdkYTVkYzE4MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/c78fe1595e15ba9e969fed4284e6ff059147740e","sha":"c78fe1595e15ba9e969fed4284e6ff059147740e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/c78fe1595e15ba9e969fed4284e6ff059147740e"}],"sha":"338fa85252c14b597d27894c6a4c237da5dc1834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/338fa85252c14b597d27894c6a4c237da5dc1834"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/c78fe1595e15ba9e969fed4284e6ff059147740e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:12:57Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:12:57Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"feat(cli): scaffold a prerelease CLI''s own version, and refuse two templates at once\n\nA canary CLI handed out a project pinned to `^3.0.0`, which resolves to the\nnewest stable release: `npx @firecms/cli@canary init --pro` scaffolded a stable\nproject, so a canary could not be tried end to end, and it installed the stable\npackages whose SheetJS URL dependency npm 12 and pnpm 11 refuse. A prerelease\nCLI now pins every @firecms package in the new project to its own version; a\nstable CLI keeps the template''s range.\n\nAlso from testing the canary as a user would:\n- `--pro --community` silently scaffolded pro. Two template flags is an error.\n- Extra positional arguments were ignored in silence; they are called out.\n- `create-firecms-app --version` was an unknown-option error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"110564263c390c6d1002612e80bf1abdee4dc25f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/110564263c390c6d1002612e80bf1abdee4dc25f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/c78fe1595e15ba9e969fed4284e6ff059147740e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/c78fe1595e15ba9e969fed4284e6ff059147740e","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGM3OGZlMTU5NWUxNWJhOWU5NjlmZWQ0Mjg0ZTZmZjA1OTE0Nzc0MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/aa0be1ae1286f6530b27086df82846931a59fe14","sha":"aa0be1ae1286f6530b27086df82846931a59fe14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/aa0be1ae1286f6530b27086df82846931a59fe14"}],"sha":"c78fe1595e15ba9e969fed4284e6ff059147740e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/c78fe1595e15ba9e969fed4284e6ff059147740e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/aa0be1ae1286f6530b27086df82846931a59fe14/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:07:46Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T00:07:46Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): stop shipping FireCMS''s demo Firebase project in the Next.js template\n\nFound testing the 3.4.0 canary as a user would.\n\n- template_next_pro shipped our own demo project''s config (firecms-demo-27150,\n  its API key and demo.firecms.co), and `--projectId` did not touch it, while\n  init printed \"make sure you have a valid Firebase config\". A user who followed\n  those steps ran their CMS against FireCMS''s demo database. It ships the same\n  placeholders as the other templates now, and `--projectId` fills them in.\n- So that the website still builds before a project is configured, the data\n  functions answer empty and the pages pre-render empty, with one warning in the\n  build log saying why; the CMS keeps refusing to start, now recognising the\n  placeholders too. The release gate no longer pre-renders next-pro from a live\n  Firebase project either.\n- The community, pro and cloud ignore files listed `./src/firebase_config.ts`,\n  which git never matches. The file is imported by App.tsx and holds a public web\n  config, so it belongs in the repository: the dead rules are gone rather than\n  fixed, and `appcheck_config.ts` never existed.\n- The cloud template depends on @firecms/cli, which its own deploy script runs.\n  It worked only because npm hoists the copy that comes with @firecms/cloud; pnpm\n  links no transitive bins, so `pnpm run deploy` could not find it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e612d344e2c04067631539c9f15a680579999a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/3e612d344e2c04067631539c9f15a680579999a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/aa0be1ae1286f6530b27086df82846931a59fe14","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/aa0be1ae1286f6530b27086df82846931a59fe14","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGFhMGJlMWFlMTI4NmY2NTMwYjI3MDg2ZGY4Mjg0NjkzMWE1OWZlMTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/0d44ae21dcf8263d513ca4e3f1a9e8404680ad54","sha":"0d44ae21dcf8263d513ca4e3f1a9e8404680ad54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/0d44ae21dcf8263d513ca4e3f1a9e8404680ad54"}],"sha":"aa0be1ae1286f6530b27086df82846931a59fe14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/aa0be1ae1286f6530b27086df82846931a59fe14"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/0d44ae21dcf8263d513ca4e3f1a9e8404680ad54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T23:58:19Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T23:58:19Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): say what login is waiting for, and stop hiding failures behind a tick\n\nFound testing the 3.4.0 canary as a user would.\n\n- `login` printed the sign-in URL from its own request handler, so a run whose\n  browser never opens (a server, a container, a CI job) printed nothing at all\n  and waited for ever. It now says where to sign in before opening the browser,\n  and gives up after 5 minutes.\n- `deploy` while logged out started that silent login. It only offers to log in\n  where someone can answer; otherwise it says you are not logged in and exits 1.\n- `deploy` before a build uploaded an empty zip over the live deployment:\n  `archive.directory` on a missing folder adds nothing and raises nothing. It\n  refuses when dist/assets is missing or empty.\n- Choosing \"FireCMS Cloud\" from the template list scaffolded a cloud project\n  logged out, which `--cloud` refuses: the gate ran before the question.\n- A tokens.json the CLI cannot parse made every command die with a SyntaxError,\n  `logout` included. It now reads as logged out, once, with what to run.\n- A login that has expired came back with an empty config, which was written\n  over the template''s placeholders with no warning and a ✔ on the step.\n- Ctrl-C printed an ExitPromptError stack; with no terminal to ask in, the run\n  exited 0 having created nothing, which a script reads as success.\n- `--projectId` went into .firebaserc, the deploy script and the Firebase config\n  unchecked: a quote made package.json invalid JSON, and `$&` mangled the\n  substitution. It is validated, and substituted literally.\n- The printed next steps name the package manager that ran the scaffolder, and\n  `create-firecms-app` no longer tells users to run a `firecms` they don''t have.\n- A folder holding only .git or .DS_Store counts as empty.\n\nThe e2e harness answers each prompt by name: bare newlines on a timer raced the\nlogin question, whose default is yes. 59 tests pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a501bc9cc6116ee0c200a272199c90be1298a12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/8a501bc9cc6116ee0c200a272199c90be1298a12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/0d44ae21dcf8263d513ca4e3f1a9e8404680ad54","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/0d44ae21dcf8263d513ca4e3f1a9e8404680ad54","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDBkNDRhZTIxZGNmODI2M2Q1MTNjYTRlM2YxYTllODQwNDY4MGFkNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/4fa1c496d52ccd8560e3899d82231fd5b6e8d71d","sha":"4fa1c496d52ccd8560e3899d82231fd5b6e8d71d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/4fa1c496d52ccd8560e3899d82231fd5b6e8d71d"}],"sha":"0d44ae21dcf8263d513ca4e3f1a9e8404680ad54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/0d44ae21dcf8263d513ca4e3f1a9e8404680ad54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/4fa1c496d52ccd8560e3899d82231fd5b6e8d71d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T23:15:11Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T23:15:11Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): answer --help, and stop crashing on the paths and flags users type\n\nFound testing the 3.4.0 canary as a user would.\n\n- `firecms --help`, `-h` and `help` printed \"Unknown command --help\"; they print\n  the usage now, and `firecms init --help` lists init''s options. An unknown\n  command exits 1 instead of 0.\n- `init` into an absolute path crashed (the folder was prefixed with \"./\"), and\n  so did a folder whose parent didn''t exist yet; both scaffold now. A path that\n  is a file is refused by name.\n- `--env` with anything but prod/dev printed its message, then crashed; a flag\n  missing its value (`--projectId` at the end) gave a stack trace. Both are\n  usage errors with exit 1 now, for login, logout and deploy too; `deploy`\n  without `--project` exits 1.\n- Without a project ID, the templates got the string \"undefined\" in\n  .firebaserc, firebase.json and the deploy script. The placeholder stays, and\n  init lists the files it is in.\n- Logged-out users were never asked whether to initialize git: the question\n  was gated on the logged-in project list.\n- The printed `cd` is quoted when the folder name needs it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b03728603fe1ce3e003a8554f3523b55ccb1e8b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/b03728603fe1ce3e003a8554f3523b55ccb1e8b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/4fa1c496d52ccd8560e3899d82231fd5b6e8d71d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/4fa1c496d52ccd8560e3899d82231fd5b6e8d71d","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDRmYTFjNDk2ZDUyY2NkODU2MGUzODk5ZDgyMjMxZmQ1YjZlOGQ3MWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/725fbe6f02da7886a5d8a856cdee6f9d89711714","sha":"725fbe6f02da7886a5d8a856cdee6f9d89711714","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/725fbe6f02da7886a5d8a856cdee6f9d89711714"}],"sha":"4fa1c496d52ccd8560e3899d82231fd5b6e8d71d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/4fa1c496d52ccd8560e3899d82231fd5b6e8d71d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/725fbe6f02da7886a5d8a856cdee6f9d89711714/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T23:08:34Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T23:08:34Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): drop the unused googleapis dependency, 200 MB of every first run\n\nNothing in the CLI imports googleapis (the only matches are the Google Fonts\nURL and the OAuth host name), yet `npx @firecms/cli` and\n`npx create-firecms-app` downloaded it on first run: 202 MB of the 259 MB\ninstall. It also brought a deprecated glob and node-domexception, whose\nwarnings are the first thing a new user sees.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7975025933fb8ea0d8cb5c6e78b652e7435cf52e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/7975025933fb8ea0d8cb5c6e78b652e7435cf52e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/725fbe6f02da7886a5d8a856cdee6f9d89711714","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/725fbe6f02da7886a5d8a856cdee6f9d89711714","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDcyNWZiZTZmMDJkYTc4ODZhNWQ4YTg1NmNkZWU2ZjlkODk3MTE3MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/59b49c42513e2f2ed530e07d0c7ecab137ad10f4","sha":"59b49c42513e2f2ed530e07d0c7ecab137ad10f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/59b49c42513e2f2ed530e07d0c7ecab137ad10f4"}],"sha":"725fbe6f02da7886a5d8a856cdee6f9d89711714","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/725fbe6f02da7886a5d8a856cdee6f9d89711714"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/59b49c42513e2f2ed530e07d0c7ecab137ad10f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T22:57:25Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T22:57:25Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(release): spell the repository URL the way npm provenance checks it\n\nEvery published package.json said github.com/FireCMSco/firecms, and npm''s\nprovenance check compares it with the repository the workflow ran in,\ngithub.com/firecmsco/firecms, including case. Every publish since August\nsigned a provenance statement, had it refused with E422, and fell back to a\nplain token publish. The URL is also written in npm''s canonical git+https\nform, which npm was auto-correcting at publish time.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"21b2a58f65d41ac2fe16d46f85e088316e9a61d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/21b2a58f65d41ac2fe16d46f85e088316e9a61d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/59b49c42513e2f2ed530e07d0c7ecab137ad10f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/59b49c42513e2f2ed530e07d0c7ecab137ad10f4","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDU5YjQ5YzQyNTEzZTJmMmVkNTMwZTA3ZDBjN2VjYWIxMzdhZDEwZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/400d89ada72a12fc4fffb88d265b9ad9a05686d6","sha":"400d89ada72a12fc4fffb88d265b9ad9a05686d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/400d89ada72a12fc4fffb88d265b9ad9a05686d6"}],"sha":"59b49c42513e2f2ed530e07d0c7ecab137ad10f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/59b49c42513e2f2ed530e07d0c7ecab137ad10f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/400d89ada72a12fc4fffb88d265b9ad9a05686d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:34:17Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:34:17Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"feat(data_export): export only the selected rows\n\nWhen rows are selected in the collection view, the export dialog offers \"All\nentities\" or \"Selected entities (N)\", with the selection as the default: rows ticked\nbefore opening the dialog are the likelier intent. With nothing selected the dialog is\nunchanged.\n\nThe selection keeps each entity as it was when it was ticked, so an edit made since\nwould be missing from the file. The selected entities are fetched again instead, as\nthe full export fetches the collection, and come out in the order the table shows\nthem rather than the order they were ticked. Entities the table has not loaded follow\nin selection order, and entities deleted since are left out. The filter/sort toggle\nand the large-collection warning only apply to \"All\", so they are hidden for a\nselection.\n\nexportAllowed still receives the collection''s count, so a size limit set there applies\nto selected exports too. The export_collection analytics event gains a `scope` param\n(\"all\" | \"selected\"). Also fixes \"Download the the content\" in the English dialog text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cdaca384ac06609254422b77591eeb1194c2359e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/cdaca384ac06609254422b77591eeb1194c2359e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/400d89ada72a12fc4fffb88d265b9ad9a05686d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/400d89ada72a12fc4fffb88d265b9ad9a05686d6","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDQwMGQ4OWFkYTcyYTEyZmM0ZmZmYjg4ZDI2NWI5YWQ5YTA1Njg2ZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/c24da8524794d783574da097813192e596058e5d","sha":"c24da8524794d783574da097813192e596058e5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/c24da8524794d783574da097813192e596058e5d"}],"sha":"400d89ada72a12fc4fffb88d265b9ad9a05686d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/400d89ada72a12fc4fffb88d265b9ad9a05686d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/c24da8524794d783574da097813192e596058e5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:03:27Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:03:27Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(ui): open tooltips on keyboard focus only, so one can''t float over a dialog\n\nRadix opens a tooltip on any focus of its trigger. FireCMS dialogs don''t move focus\nwhen they open (disableInitialFocus), so a button that opens one keeps focus behind it,\nand the browser focuses it again when the window is re-activated, e.g. after dragging\na file in from Finder. Its tooltip then opened on top of the dialog and stayed there:\nscrolling the dialog doesn''t close it.\n\nThe trigger now skips Radix''s focus handler unless the focus is :focus-visible. Hover\nis unchanged, and tabbing to a trigger still shows its tooltip. Where :focus-visible\nisn''t supported, Radix''s behavior is kept.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69614172e1ea5833359af63899d8c6d2b0314cc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/69614172e1ea5833359af63899d8c6d2b0314cc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/c24da8524794d783574da097813192e596058e5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/c24da8524794d783574da097813192e596058e5d","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGMyNGRhODUyNDc5NGQ3ODM1NzRkYTA5NzgxMzE5MmU1OTYwNThlNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/5c9e676866637ff0ecd4353c21bd67c289483921","sha":"5c9e676866637ff0ecd4353c21bd67c289483921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5c9e676866637ff0ecd4353c21bd67c289483921"}],"sha":"c24da8524794d783574da097813192e596058e5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/c24da8524794d783574da097813192e596058e5d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5c9e676866637ff0ecd4353c21bd67c289483921/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:03:27Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T21:03:27Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(data_import): pin the import dialog''s actions to the bottom, and center the saving step\n\nThe dialog content was sized to the dialog''s height (h-full). A long mapping list\noverflowed it, so the sticky actions stopped where the box ended, partway down the\nlist, and scrolled away with it. A full-height box under the title and above the\nactions also made every step scroll a little, and left the saving progress at the top.\n\nThe dialog is now a column: the content fills the space between the title and the\nactions and grows past it when the list is long, so the actions stay at the bottom and\nshort steps don''t scroll. The title drops its bottom gutter, since flex margins don''t\ncollapse, which keeps its spacing as it was. The saving progress centers itself in the\nspace it''s given.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2721eb027e70a5e698dce50b8ff67d6e067a579c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/2721eb027e70a5e698dce50b8ff67d6e067a579c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/5c9e676866637ff0ecd4353c21bd67c289483921","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/5c9e676866637ff0ecd4353c21bd67c289483921","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDVjOWU2NzY4NjY2MzdmZjBlY2Q0MzUzYzIxYmQ2N2MyODk0ODM5MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/1faa2a997978decc206b146c04fc7892bd117f9e","sha":"1faa2a997978decc206b146c04fc7892bd117f9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1faa2a997978decc206b146c04fc7892bd117f9e"}],"sha":"5c9e676866637ff0ecd4353c21bd67c289483921","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5c9e676866637ff0ecd4353c21bd67c289483921"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1faa2a997978decc206b146c04fc7892bd117f9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T20:49:37Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T20:49:37Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): make the template checks reliable on CI, and keep them away from the npm token\n\nFound in the pre-release sweep of 7de7c726c, 3733479d0 and 19663a921.\n\n- Three cold `npx --yes pnpm@11` runs started together race in npx''s cache,\n  and CI''s npm 10 fails some with ENOTEMPTY: the release gate failed at\n  random (3 of 6 runs lost a build). Each pinned package manager is now\n  fetched once, and parallel callers wait on that.\n- publish.yml ran the template check, which resolves every template''s caret\n  ranges fresh from npm and runs their build tools, in the job holding the\n  npm token and id-token. It is now its own read-only job; `publish` needs it\n  and builds its own copy from the lockfile.\n- template_cloud''s pnpm-workspace.yaml had no `packages` field, so pnpm before\n  10.5 refused to run in the project at all. It now lists \".\".\n- Commands run in their own process groups: a timeout or Ctrl-C/SIGTERM stops\n  the whole tree (npx -> pnpm -> node) and the run cleans up after itself.\n  signed-in.mjs''s setup moved inside its try/finally.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bb4859a0ae01c6891d2173327b60de60ff2f59e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/bb4859a0ae01c6891d2173327b60de60ff2f59e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/1faa2a997978decc206b146c04fc7892bd117f9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/1faa2a997978decc206b146c04fc7892bd117f9e","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDFmYWEyYTk5Nzk3OGRlY2MyMDZiMTQ2YzA0ZmM3ODkyYmQxMTdmOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/8eb966a13bdca78863c57c1ea952d3aaf191f0a3","sha":"8eb966a13bdca78863c57c1ea952d3aaf191f0a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8eb966a13bdca78863c57c1ea952d3aaf191f0a3"}],"sha":"1faa2a997978decc206b146c04fc7892bd117f9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/1faa2a997978decc206b146c04fc7892bd117f9e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8eb966a13bdca78863c57c1ea952d3aaf191f0a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T20:49:26Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T20:49:26Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(data_import): read blank CSV cells as absent and .xlsx dates as local time\n\nFound in the pre-release sweep of the read-excel-file port (56f969e96).\n\n- A blank CSV cell arrived as \"\": once mapped it became 0, false, an\n  Invalid Date or a reference to \"\" (which fails the whole save), and it\n  replaced the collection''s defaults. Blank cells are left out of the row\n  again, as SheetJS did; FireCMS''s own export writes every null as one.\n- read-excel-file hands a date over as its UTC reading, so a cell showing\n  2024-01-15 imported as Jan 14 west of UTC. It is rebuilt in local time.\n- CSV values are typed when the target property is known: TRUE/FALSE in any\n  case, formatted numbers (1,234.5, 12,5, $5.00, 50%), ISO dates as local\n  wall-clock time. Unreadable numbers and dates become null, never NaN or an\n  Invalid Date. Text like 00123 stays text.\n- Repeated headers get a suffix (name, name_1) instead of overwriting a\n  column; a table may start below blank rows; a lone CR ends a line (Excel\n  for Mac); a header row with nothing under it is refused with a message.\n- Only __proto__ is refused as a key, and unflattening never walks into an\n  inherited value: a real \"constructor\" column is kept, and a header like\n  toString.call can no longer modify a built-in.\n- A comma-separated list mapped into an array property now maps each item\n  (the navigation argument was missing).\n\nTests run in America/New_York via a jest globalSetup: a test file''s\nprocess.env is a copy, and under CI''s UTC the date bug was invisible.\n137 tests; the 38 new assertions fail on the previous code.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0113c9d6e1a1d97905016c1b0376f1789572c824","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/0113c9d6e1a1d97905016c1b0376f1789572c824"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/8eb966a13bdca78863c57c1ea952d3aaf191f0a3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/8eb966a13bdca78863c57c1ea952d3aaf191f0a3","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDhlYjk2NmExM2JkY2E3ODg2M2M1N2MxZWE5NTJkM2FhZjE5MWYwYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/e8232c6a777a1bfbd9f7f4bde851b4cd6400b2a4","sha":"e8232c6a777a1bfbd9f7f4bde851b4cd6400b2a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/e8232c6a777a1bfbd9f7f4bde851b4cd6400b2a4"}],"sha":"8eb966a13bdca78863c57c1ea952d3aaf191f0a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8eb966a13bdca78863c57c1ea952d3aaf191f0a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/o