nt_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T19:05:08Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"test(data_enhancement): cover AdvancedTextField under a burst of input\n\nTypes 80 back-to-back input events into the field bound through formex, as\nFireCMS binds it, and checks React never throws \"Maximum update depth\nexceeded\"; against the previous effect-based sync it throws around the\n53rd event. A second case checks the field still follows a value changed\nfrom outside, as autofill does.\n\nThe package''s jest config gains the CSS stub firecms_core already uses:\n@firecms/ui''s bundle requires a stylesheet, which kept component tests\nfrom running here at all.\n\nRefs FIRECMS-SASS-12M\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b134c2f1ddc56a43adf9c3ade7034bfa70aad7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/8b134c2f1ddc56a43adf9c3ade7034bfa70aad7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/04049e2095a10893540e2143a17a79c63fb551b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fg