message":"chore: share the preview servers in .claude/launch.json, and ignore .claude/settings.local.json\n\nlaunch.json collects the dev and preview servers the Claude Code sessions in this repo use. settings.local.json holds one developer''s own permission rules, so it stays local.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8f66c2eccea52fce3434bb324e818ec8e5fee5f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/8f66c2eccea52fce3434bb324e818ec8e5fee5f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/fc26f86260e9e5f422e6a4d3e139a0f478cfe749","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/fc26f86260e9e5f422e6a4d3e139a0f478cfe749","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGZjMjZmODYyNjBlOWU1ZjQyMmU2YTRkM2UxMzlhMGY0NzhjZmU3NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/af763a5f92722430278d51cc46f9c0903e853b3f","sha":"af763a5f92722430278d51cc46f9c0903e853b3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/af763a5f92722430278d51cc46f9c0903e853b3f"}],"sha":"fc26f86260e9e5f422e6a4d3e139a0f478cfe749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/fc26f86260e9e5f422e6a4d3e139a0f478cfe749"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/af763a5f92722430278d51cc46f9c0903e853b3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:59:13Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:59:13Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"feat(website): PRO price on /pro and /pricing, a 30-day trial, and the license and telemetry docs\n\n- /pro is aimed at agencies and product teams (\"One license, every\n  client project\"), shows the price (EUR 99 / month for the first\n  project, EUR 49 for each additional; USD 119 / 59) with the EUR/USD\n  switch, \"Unlimited seats\" and \"30 days free in production, no card\",\n  and its CTAs go to app.firecms.co/subscriptions?intent=pro. All of its\n  copy moved to pro.* keys in the six languages. The Next.js snippet\n  used APIs that don''t exist and is fixed.\n- /pricing: the new PRO price and second price line, a feature list that\n  matches what PRO ships, \"Start free trial\", and the FAQ explains the\n  unit and the trial. Roadmap Prioritization is removed. The currency\n  switch is shared and remembered across pages.\n- Compare page checked against the packages: Community gets custom\n  auth and secondary databases, loses \"basic data export\" (export is the\n  BSL data_export plugin), export no longer claims Excel, DataTalk is\n  available in PRO, and PRO is \"MIT core, BSL plugins\".\n- A PRO entry in the header navigation.\n- licensing.md in six languages: the price, every linked project\n  counting the same, why one license is cheaper, the per-project 30-day\n  trial, exactly what pauses and what keeps working, and the key setup.\n- New self/telemetry docs in six languages: what the access log sends,\n  what we store, the PRO emails it triggers, retention as it is today,\n  and `telemetry={false}` for apps with no key and no PRO plugin.\n- data-track clicks also reach GA4 as `cta_click` (with cta_id), so\n  pro-start-trial, pro-buy and pricing-pro-license are measurable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"152e5455ca900c135fc51c2836ee311f140089a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/152e5455ca900c135fc51c2836ee311f140089a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/af763a5f92722430278d51cc46f9c0903e853b3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti67