"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/b32c3edf33c6bb6d4ecfb7c4d5c4dae22e2aa2ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:46Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:46Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cloud): open Stripe billing portal links on click, and say why one fails\n\nThe project settings page and the past-due alert created Stripe portal\nsessions for the cancel and payment-method links on every view, without a\ncatch, so each failure was an unhandled rejection. useOpenStripePortal\nfetches the link when the button is clicked, shows it working, navigates\nthe same tab, and reports a failure in the snackbar (stripe_portal_error).\n\nFixes FIRECMS-SASS-12H, FIRECMS-SASS-11M, FIRECMS-SASS-12F\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed079a06db8804a81411adfc013f851c88189fea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/ed079a06db8804a81411adfc013f851c88189fea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/b32c3edf33c6bb6d4ecfb7c4d5c4dae22e2aa2ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/b32c3edf33c6bb6d4ecfb7c4d5c4dae22e2aa2ab","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGIzMmMzZWRmMzNjNmJiNmQ0ZWNmYjdjNGQ1YzRkYWUyMmUyYWEyYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/412d766a8ce3149dab2d77920d8191a60d69a41c","sha":"412d766a8ce3149dab2d77920d8191a60d69a41c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/412d766a8ce3149dab2d77920d8191a60d69a41c"}],"sha":"b32c3edf33c6bb6d4ecfb7c4d5c4dae22e2aa2ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/b32c3edf33c6bb6d4ecfb7c4d5c4dae22e2aa2ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/412d766a8ce3149dab2d77920d8191a60d69a41c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:45Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:45Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(datatalk): keep failed background requests from rejecting unhandled\n\nEvery Cloud page asks for DataTalk''s sample prompts in the background, and\na failure there was an unhandled rejection reported from whatever page the\nuser was on. The provider now logs it and keeps the built-in examples. A\nfailed read of the command stream rejects instead of leaving the promise\npending, a missing auth token shows the usual chat error instead of an\nendless spinner, and failed session saves are logged.\n\nFixes FIRECMS-SASS-12C, FIRECMS-SASS-11A\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d7af5f4b3d858fb10352e47a49ad49259c08e93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/9d7af5f4b3d858fb10352e47a49ad49259c08e93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/412d766a8ce3149dab2d77920d8191a60d69a41c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/412d766a8ce3149dab2d77920d8191a60d69a41c","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDQxMmQ3NjZhOGNlMzE0OWRhYjJkNzc5MjBkODE5MWE2MGQ2OWE0MWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/ffbee424282a68a0bdf335f1e4372bc758c13fdf","sha":"ffbee424282a68a0bdf335f1e4372bc758c13fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/ffbee424282a68a0bdf335f1e4372bc758c13fdf"}],"sha":"412d766a8ce3149dab2d77920d8191a60d69a41c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/412d766a8ce3149dab2d77920d8191a60d69a41c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/ffbee424282a68a0bdf335f1e4372bc758c13fdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:45Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:45Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(editor): don''t dispatch into an editor that has been destroyed\n\nThe image upload placeholder dispatches from an Image onload/onerror\ncallback. When the entity was closed while the image was still loading,\nthe EditorView was already destroyed and ProseMirror threw \"Cannot read\nproperties of null (reading ''matchesNode'')\". dispatchTransaction now\nreturns early on a destroyed view, and the image and AI autocomplete paths\ncheck before dispatching after an await.\n\nFixes FIRECMS-SASS-12J\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf67b1ea8772762d7405b59cffe31dd425757743","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/bf67b1ea8772762d7405b59cffe31dd425757743"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/ffbee424282a68a0bdf335f1e4372bc758c13fdf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/ffbee424282a68a0bdf335f1e4372bc758c13fdf","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGZmYmVlNDI0MjgyYTY4YTBiZGYzMzVmMWU0MzcyYmM3NThjMTNmZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/cc00c50d18a3bd80d159572cc976bf2981b02faa","sha":"cc00c50d18a3bd80d159572cc976bf2981b02faa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/cc00c50d18a3bd80d159572cc976bf2981b02faa"}],"sha":"ffbee424282a68a0bdf335f1e4372bc758c13fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/ffbee424282a68a0bdf335f1e4372bc758c13fdf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/cc00c50d18a3bd80d159572cc976bf2981b02faa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:44Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:44Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(data_enhancement): stop AdvancedTextField re-setting its value after every keystroke\n\nAn effect copied `value` into internal state after each commit, although\nonChange had just set the same string. On React 19 that leaves an update\npending after every keystroke commit, and a fast burst of input events\npiles them up until React throws \"Maximum update depth exceeded\". Outside\nchanges to `value` are now followed during render instead.\n\nFixes FIRECMS-SASS-12M\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8dcc0555f08426e0dd21b24a12d335c90f856c7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/8dcc0555f08426e0dd21b24a12d335c90f856c7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/cc00c50d18a3bd80d159572cc976bf2981b02faa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/cc00c50d18a3bd80d159572cc976bf2981b02faa","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGNjMDBjNTBkMThhM2JkODBkMTU5NTcyY2M5NzZiZjI5ODFiMDJmYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/27e48225d1115b3169efa8453ff2bcb5bd797ae2","sha":"27e48225d1115b3169efa8453ff2bcb5bd797ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/27e48225d1115b3169efa8453ff2bcb5bd797ae2"}],"sha":"cc00c50d18a3bd80d159572cc976bf2981b02faa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/cc00c50d18a3bd80d159572cc976bf2981b02faa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/27e48225d1115b3169efa8453ff2bcb5bd797ae2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:44Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:38:44Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(data_enhancement): read streamed records across chunk boundaries, and surface failures\n\nThe enhance stream split each network chunk on the record separator and\nJSON.parsed every piece, so a record longer than one chunk was cut in two\nand threw \"Unterminated string in JSON\". Partial records are now buffered\nuntil the next separator or the end of the stream, with one TextDecoder\nfor the whole response, and the outcome is reported exactly once.\n\nEvery caller starts enhance() from a click handler and only chains\n.finally(), so any failure was an unhandled rejection the user never saw.\nenhance() now resolves null and reports through the snackbar: a 402 shows\nthe existing \"valid subscription needed\" warning (it never fired, because\nthe thrown Error carried no code), anything else \"Autofill failed\". Sample\nprompts for a new entity fall back to the local ones when the request fails.\n\nFixes FIRECMS-SASS-12P, FIRECMS-SASS-12N, FIRECMS-SASS-12Q\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"58ec5f8b71a65941919a6e1da8fc8a756c9c7554","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/58ec5f8b71a65941919a6e1da8fc8a756c9c7554"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/27e48225d1115b3169efa8453ff2bcb5bd797ae2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/27e48225d1115b3169efa8453ff2bcb5bd797ae2","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDI3ZTQ4MjI1ZDExMTViMzE2OWVmYTg0NTNmZjJiY2I1YmQ3OTdhZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/5522cfec880d348be26ab29a249e0a2c61898b61","sha":"5522cfec880d348be26ab29a249e0a2c61898b61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5522cfec880d348be26ab29a249e0a2c61898b61"}],"sha":"27e48225d1115b3169efa8453ff2bcb5bd797ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/27e48225d1115b3169efa8453ff2bcb5bd797ae2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5522cfec880d348be26ab29a249e0a2c61898b61/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:35:56Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:35:56Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): say why a deploy failed instead of crashing, and exit non-zero\n\nWith an expired staging login, `firecms deploy --env=dev` printed \"There was an error\nuploading the build\" and then crashed with \"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading\n''data'')\". Two bugs stacked: when the refresh fails, refreshCredentials logs out and\nreturns null, and uploadZip went on to read `tokens[\"access_token\"]` inside its try. The\ncatch then read `err.response.data`, which only exists when the server answered.\n\n- uploadZip stops before uploading when the login could not be refreshed, and says to\n  run `firecms login` (with --env=dev for dev). A failed upload prints the status and\n  body when the server answered, and the error message otherwise. On a 401 it says to\n  log out first: the rejected tokens are still saved, and `firecms login` refuses to\n  run while they are. Every failure sets exit code 1.\n- The login and zip checks run before the spinner starts, so their output is not drawn\n  over and an early return does not leave it spinning.\n- src/util/request_error.ts holds describeRequestError, isLoginRejected and\n  authCommand. refreshCredentials and init''s project lookups use describeRequestError\n  too: without a response they printed \"undefined\".\n- The login and logout hints name the environment. `firecms login`''s \"run firecms\n  logout\" hint would log a dev user out of prod.\n\ntest/deploy.test.ts drives uploadZip with ora, axios and the auth module mocked (ora and\nopen are ESM-only). Against the old deploy.ts, five of its six cases fail with the\nreported TypeError. test/request_error.test.ts covers the helper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"275cd6fe37754c37c2dc2e7551ffb5bf796f248f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/275cd6fe37754c37c2dc2e7551ffb5bf796f248f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/5522cfec880d348be26ab29a249e0a2c61898b61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/5522cfec880d348be26ab29a249e0a2c61898b61","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDU1MjJjZmVjODgwZDM0OGJlMjZhYjI5YTI0OWUwYTJjNjE4OThiNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/3733479d06e1fcc646d20211015fac65115dc077","sha":"3733479d06e1fcc646d20211015fac65115dc077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/3733479d06e1fcc646d20211015fac65115dc077"}],"sha":"5522cfec880d348be26ab29a249e0a2c61898b61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5522cfec880d348be26ab29a249e0a2c61898b61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/3733479d06e1fcc646d20211015fac65115dc077/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:40Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:40Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"ci: run the template checks on every change, before release and after each canary\n\n- cli-templates.yml, on changes to packages/**: the CLI''s jest suite, data_import''s\n  tests, the template check and the signed-in browser check.\n- publish.yml: nothing is published unless the template check passes against the\n  packages just built.\n- publish-canary.yml: once the canary is published, smoke-test it from npm.\n\nThe `cli` job needs the init e2e suite to run logged out. The version at this commit\nstill expects a logged-in machine, so that job fails on CI until the sandboxed\nversion lands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"249e6f4ad6b65fad05ac3105776da7d00aa3062b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/249e6f4ad6b65fad05ac3105776da7d00aa3062b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/3733479d06e1fcc646d20211015fac65115dc077","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/3733479d06e1fcc646d20211015fac65115dc077","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDM3MzM0NzlkMDZlMWZjYzY0NmQyMDIxMTAxNWZhYzY1MTE1ZGMwNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/7de7c726c5de8f09a8ccfd9d69b7d47e1ce01206","sha":"7de7c726c5de8f09a8ccfd9d69b7d47e1ce01206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/7de7c726c5de8f09a8ccfd9d69b7d47e1ce01206"}],"sha":"3733479d06e1fcc646d20211015fac65115dc077","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/3733479d06e1fcc646d20211015fac65115dc077"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/7de7c726c5de8f09a8ccfd9d69b7d47e1ce01206/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:30Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:30Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"test(cli): check that every template installs, builds and signs in\n\nThe jest suite checks that `firecms init` scaffolds; nothing checked that what it\nscaffolds works. Three scripts in packages/cli/scripts/templates (see the README\nthere), none of which touches the monorepo or its lockfile:\n\n- check.mjs: every template, scaffolded from the CLI as packed and installed with\n  pnpm 11 against the local packages, is built, checked for FireCMS''s styles,\n  type-checked, linted for @deprecated APIs, and checked to pass its license key.\n- signed-in.mjs: each PRO template, built against the Firebase emulators, is signed\n  in to in headless Chromium: the license check carries the key, the PRO plugins are\n  mounted, Firestore data shows, drag-and-drop works where the collection editor is\n  mounted, and an .xlsx imports.\n- smoke-published.mjs --version <v>: a published version, scaffolded with the CLI\n  from npm and installed with npm 12 pinned to it.\n\nRun against the templates as they were before today''s fixes they fail where those\nwere broken (the deprecated plugins prop, undeclared @firebase imports, the cloud\nbuild under pnpm, missing license keys, Astro''s styles, the xlsx URL), and they pass\non the fixed ones. The CLI always runs logged out, and a failed run keeps only its\nlogs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7d148b73ad37cc0021d35562656e6accc5e3fa24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/7d148b73ad37cc0021d35562656e6accc5e3fa24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/7de7c726c5de8f09a8ccfd9d69b7d47e1ce01206","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/7de7c726c5de8f09a8ccfd9d69b7d47e1ce01206","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDdkZTdjNzI2YzVkZThmMDlhOGNjZmQ5ZDY5YjdkNDdlMWNlMDEyMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/19663a92156f5bc02ba0e2476824cae8fb553944","sha":"19663a92156f5bc02ba0e2476824cae8fb553944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/19663a92156f5bc02ba0e2476824cae8fb553944"}],"sha":"7de7c726c5de8f09a8ccfd9d69b7d47e1ce01206","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/7de7c726c5de8f09a8ccfd9d69b7d47e1ce01206"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/19663a92156f5bc02ba0e2476824cae8fb553944/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:22Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:22Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(cli): make the Astro and cloud templates work as scaffolded\n\ntemplate_astro:\n\n- Its Tailwind @source pointed at src/node_modules, which does not exist (the\n  stylesheet is one level deeper than in the other templates), so none of FireCMS''s\n  component classes were generated and the CMS rendered half-unstyled.\n- It passed its PRO plugins to the deprecated `plugins` prop of <FireCMS>, where\n  navigation-level plugin features never apply. They go to\n  useBuildNavigationController now.\n- It mounted PRO plugins but never passed a license key. It reads\n  PUBLIC_FIRECMS_API_KEY now, documented in the README and .env, and src/env.d.ts\n  types import.meta.env.\n- Its login screen asked the customer''s users to accept FireCMS''s own terms, and had\n  a newsletter switch that posted their email to api.firecms.co. It is the standard\n  FirebaseLoginView now, as in the other templates.\n- The README told users to install from \"the monorepo root\" and cd into\n  examples/example_astro.\n\ntemplate_cloud did not build under pnpm: its federation config shares @firecms/* and\n@firebase/* with the Cloud host, and the plugin resolves each one from the project\nfolder, where only npm''s hoisting put them. A pnpm-workspace.yaml hoists those two\nscopes; npm and yarn ignore it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e8667087446411678173ce36ce818dd54c2f2d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/4e8667087446411678173ce36ce818dd54c2f2d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/19663a92156f5bc02ba0e2476824cae8fb553944","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/19663a92156f5bc02ba0e2476824cae8fb553944","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDE5NjYzYTkyMTU2ZjViYzAyYmEwZTI0NzY4MjRjYWU4ZmI1NTM5NDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/56f969e96f8d19c05309b0fd201cd7e13e2e617b","sha":"56f969e96f8d19c05309b0fd201cd7e13e2e617b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/56f969e96f8d19c05309b0fd201cd7e13e2e617b"}],"sha":"19663a92156f5bc02ba0e2476824cae8fb553944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/19663a92156f5bc02ba0e2476824cae8fb553944"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/56f969e96f8d19c05309b0fd201cd7e13e2e617b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:12Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T17:56:12Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(data_import): read spreadsheets with read-excel-file, so projects install again\n\n@firecms/data_import depended on SheetJS as a URL\n(https://cdn.sheetjs.com/xlsx-0.20.2/xlsx-0.20.2.tgz), and @firecms/firebase depends\non data_import, so every FireCMS project pulled it in. npm 12 (allow-remote=none) and\npnpm 11 (blockExoticSubdeps) refuse URL-resolved packages by default: with 3.4.0, no\ntemplate installs on a current package manager without changing its settings.\n\n.xlsx files are now read with read-excel-file, still loaded only when a spreadsheet\nis imported, and CSV with a parser of its own, the inverse of the CSV export (quoted\ncells, doubled quotes, CRLF), which also reads ; and tab delimiters. Ported from\nrebase, which made the same move. Along the way:\n\n- A blank header column no longer shifts the columns after it into the wrong fields.\n- Header keys from an uploaded file can no longer reach the prototype chain\n  (`__proto__.x`, `constructor.prototype.x`) in unflattenObject, mapJsonParse or\n  flattenEntry.\n- read-excel-file floors Excel''s date serials, so 12:30:00 read as 12:29:59.999 and\n  displayed as 12:29; a date within a millisecond of a whole second is put back on it.\n- A legacy .xls, or a CSV renamed .xlsx, is refused by name, with what to do instead.\n\nThe tests read real workbooks written by exceljs (a devDependency), not by the\nreader under test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3487e75150188c32394d4f959595db0c0a4a5ac4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/3487e75150188c32394d4f959595db0c0a4a5ac4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fi