cy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/fadb4198fcae9c37e8039db29ff5bf55a356c792/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:35:45Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:35:45Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(website): stop redirecting Googlebot off every localised marketing page\n\nThe localised marketing pages convert as well as the English homepage —\n197.6 app click-throughs per 1,000 pageviews against 198.5 — and hold\nthe best average position on the site (5.1) when they surface. Only 14\nof them are indexed, against 1,115 localised *docs* URLs.\n\nCause: the client-side language auto-detect in Layout.astro ran on every\npage, including explicitly localised ones. Googlebot renders with an\nempty document.referrer, navigator.languages === [''en-US'',''en''] and no\nstored preference, so every /es/, /de/, /fr/, /it/ and /pt/ marketing\nURL called location.replace() to the English equivalent while Google was\nrendering it. Google filed them as \"Page with redirect\" and dropped them.\n\nThe localised docs are unaffected because Starlight pages do not use this\nlayout — which is exactly why 1,115 of those are indexed and 14 of these\nare. Canonical and hreflang were already correct; the redirect was the\nsole cause.\n\nAuto-detection now runs only on default-locale URLs: redirect from the\ngeneric version towards a language, never away from a language-specific\nURL a user or crawler deliberately asked for.\n\nAlso:\n- Drop the 2,335 translated copies of the English-only TypeDoc API\n  reference from the sitemap (62% of its URLs, 0.40% CTR). The English\n  originals stay; nothing is blocked, only de-prioritised.\n- Serve raw .md files with X-Robots-Tag: noindex, matching the rule\n  llms.txt already had.\n- Give /features/ real calls to action. It had none: 91 landing\n  sessions, 7.6s average engagement, zero app clicks, zero sign-ups.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d37a9eb5bcf1b3f0a0e501f38d92238c0f7c0a45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/d37a9eb5bcf1b3f0a0e501f38d92238c0f7c0a45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/fadb4198fcae9c37e8039db29ff5bf55a356c792","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/fadb4198fcae9c37e8039db29ff5bf55a356c792","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKGZhZGI0MTk4ZmNhZTljMzdlODAzOWRiMjlmZjViZjU1YTM1NmM3OTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d","sha":"5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d"}],"sha":"fadb4198fcae9c37e8039db29ff5bf55a356c792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/fadb4198fcae9c37e8039db29ff5bf55a356c792"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5c18602cfdc69d06055d6d31c30c8e4170fec9fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:24:11Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:24:11Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"feat(website): put a Cloud CTA on every docs page, not 10\n\nDocs carry 23,177 pageviews (62% of the site) and the highest scroll\nrates on it — 37-40% against 15.6% on the homepage — yet produced only\n62 clicks through to the app in May-Aug 2026. That is 2.6 per 1,000\npageviews on desktop, where 98% of docs traffic sits, against 160 on\nmarketing pages.\n\nThe only path out of the docs was a small \"Start Building\" button in\nthe Starlight header. The in-content DocsCloudCTA that actually reads\nas an invitation existed on 10 of 1,271 pages.\n\nRender a localised end-of-page CTA from the Starlight page frame so it\nlands on all 3,618 docs pages in all six locales. It links to\napp.firecms.co/?ref=docs_cta, so its clicks can be told apart from the\nheader button in GA4, and enhance-app-links.js picks it up\nautomatically — no new tracking code.\n\nZero-JS Astro component built on Starlight''s own surface tokens, so it\nsits correctly on the docs'' forced-dark theme and would still resolve\nif light mode were restored.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"023d659aa9c8e29d7b8b7e0d9dc4502827f04ec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/023d659aa9c8e29d7b8b7e0d9dc4502827f04ec7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/5c18602cfdc69d06055d6d31c30c8e4170fec9fa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/5c18602cfdc69d06055d6d31c30c8e4170fec9fa","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDVjMTg2MDJjZmRjNjlkMDYwNTVkNmQzMWMzMGM4ZTQxNzBmZWM5ZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d","sha":"5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d"}],"sha":"5c18602cfdc69d06055d6d31c30c8e4170fec9fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5c18602cfdc69d06055d6d31c30c8e4170fec9fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:11:09Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T15:11:09Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(build): declare the cross-package deps that broke the 3.4.0 publish\n\n`pnpm install` links a workspace package only where it is declared, so an\nundeclared @firecms/* import resolves to whatever is hoisted -- the previously\npublished copy. The v3.4.0 build failed on exactly that:\n\n    Module ''\"@firecms/schema_inference\"'' has no exported member\n    ''buildInferredCollectionFromData''\n\n@firecms/collection_editor_firebase imports that symbol in\nsrc/schema_inference/index.ts but never declared the package, so TypeScript\ntype-checked it against the published 3.3.0, which predates the symbol.\n\n@firecms/cloud has the same omission for @firecms/ui: it re-exports the whole\npackage from src/index.ts and imports components in several files. That one\nbuilt by luck -- @firecms/ui is already earlier in the graph via @firecms/core\n-- but it shipped a package that resolves @firecms/ui only if the consumer\nhappens to install it.\n\nBoth are now declared as `workspace:^3.4.0`, matching how every other package\nin the repo declares them. Verified: `pnpm run build` succeeds for all 27\nprojects, and no undeclared cross-package import remains.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"48f89bb740368477cb477cbe5b96d2f053670da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/48f89bb740368477cb477cbe5b96d2f053670da0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDVjNzVjNGQzYWM1NWJkYmQ0MTMwMDEwMDVmYzQ0ZmQ0ZmFjNDRiNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/8ab3ae3d10f1a787e33282048ce3938032dead3d","sha":"8ab3ae3d10f1a787e33282048ce3938032dead3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8ab3ae3d10f1a787e33282048ce3938032dead3d"}],"sha":"5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/5c75c4d3ac55bdbd413001005fc44fd4fac44b5d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8ab3ae3d10f1a787e33282048ce3938032dead3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T14:59:07Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T14:59:07Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"fix(website): unescape the aside icons on every MDX docs page\n\nStarlight 0.41.1 rendered aside icons as escaped SVG source when the MDX\nintegration has optimization disabled — so every :::note/:::caution on a\n.mdx page printed a wall of markup above its text, while .md pages were\nfine. 90 pages were affected. Upstream fixed it in 0.41.2; this bumps to\n0.41.9.\n\nMoving mdx() ahead of starlight() does not work as an alternative:\nastro-expressive-code requires the opposite order and fails the build.\n\nAlso refreshes the hosting deploy cache from the deploy of both changes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b48c2c9f3bfb4f47eecadf560b3025578d943e1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/b48c2c9f3bfb4f47eecadf560b3025578d943e1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/8ab3ae3d10f1a787e33282048ce3938032dead3d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/8ab3ae3d10f1a787e33282048ce3938032dead3d","node_id":"C_kwDOD08vEtoAKDhhYjNhZTNkMTBmMWE3ODdlMzMyODIwNDhjZTM5MzgwMzJkZWFkM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/commit/67a794fe739f9f8537d37a70fc19f8716f83198d","sha":"67a794fe739f9f8537d37a70fc19f8716f83198d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/67a794fe739f9f8537d37a70fc19f8716f83198d"}],"sha":"8ab3ae3d10f1a787e33282048ce3938032dead3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/8ab3ae3d10f1a787e33282048ce3938032dead3d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fgatti675","id":5120271,"login":"fgatti675","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMjAyNzE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/commits/67a794fe739f9f8537d37a70fc19f8716f83198d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T14:58:58Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T14:58:58Z","email":"francesco@firecms.co","name":"francesco"},"message":"docs(website): the MCP server page the AI agent dialog links to\n\nThe \"Connect an AI agent\" dialog in the SaaS console links to\n/docs/cloud/mcp_server, which never existed and 404''d. Adds it, in\nEnglish plus the five translated locales, and a sidebar entry under\nFireCMS Cloud.\n\nContent is checked against packages/mcp_server: the install commands\nmatch the dialog''s steps, and the tool tables, the admin-only marks and\nthe connect-an-existing-project sequence follow the server''s own README\nand tools.\n\nAlso adds a website-astro-dev launch entry, since the existing one runs\nastro preview and needs a build first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e07f406e76ba8fe2b9c3f5289b2a52c0098939b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/trees/8e07f406e76ba8fe2b9c3f5289b2a52c0098939b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/firecmsco/firecms/git/commits/67a794fe739f9f8537d37a70fc19f8716f83198d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5120271?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fgatti675/events{/privacy}","follower