ers/ljharb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/4f65f671e0e84dd96646ef99c01975cb52d74fc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T22:25:47Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T22:25:47Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[actions] add delegating `tests-only` and `npmignore` to the published packages for the pack matrix\n\nThe per-package `pack` matrix runs each package’s `tests-only`\n(delegating `cd ../.. && npm run tests-only` to the monorepo root).\nAdd that script to `list-exports` and `ls-exports`,\nand declare `npmignore` on `list-exports` so its `prepack` is self-contained.","tree":{"sha":"32a04a3eab7ac139ba953746b10c03b88f7d8216","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/32a04a3eab7ac139ba953746b10c03b88f7d8216"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/4f65f671e0e84dd96646ef99c01975cb52d74fc9","verification":{"payload":"tree 32a04a3eab7ac139ba953746b10c03b88f7d8216\nparent ed4f04bb89fb2203afa5812290a8fd0a5bcd30b7\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785191147 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785191147 -0700\n\n[actions] add delegating `tests-only` and `npmignore` to the published packages for the pack matrix\n\nThe per-package `pack` matrix runs each package’s `tests-only`\n(delegating `cd ../.. && npm run tests-only` to the monorepo root).\nAdd that script to `list-exports` and `ls-exports`,\nand declare `npmignore` on `list-exports` so its `prepack` is self-contained.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR