rb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/ef60d937d2bf88641da70e887e7ee4a741a3035e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:31:08Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T18:31:08Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[meta] set `audit-level=critical` so `npm audit --production` passes\n\nKeeping `@npmcli/arborist@^8` / `npm-packlist@^9` for node 18/20 support pulls an older npm-CLI subtree carrying `brace-expansion` (high) and `@sigstore/core` (moderate) advisories whose only upstream fix is `@npmcli/arborist@10` (node 22+).\nCap the `posttest` audit at critical (there are none) so it passes while node-18 support is retained.","tree":{"sha":"0800f57d47ee3cf525ab8e1d3849386a222bfb44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/0800f57d47ee3cf525ab8e1d3849386a222bfb44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/ef60d937d2bf88641da70e887e7ee4a741a3035e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0800f57d47ee3cf525ab8e1d3849386a222bfb44\nparent 0ad043ea4c4a3a73b0fc3ba0c1aaef460bdd1855\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785177068 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785177068 -0700\n\n[meta] set `audit-level=critical` so `npm audit --production` passes\n\nKeeping `@npmcli/arborist@^8` / `npm-packlist@^9` for node 18/20 support pulls an older npm-CLI subtree carrying `brace-expansion` (high) and `@sigstore/core` (moderate) advisories whose only upstream fix is `@npmcli/arborist@10` (node 22+).\nCap the `posttest` audit at critical (there are none) so it passes while node-18 support is retained.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpn2u8ACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1bxQBAAojxZ9AKoX5J3Y+ij69N9YfN6hYPpilc3iQAsqYDy6/JKrv3AICFCgzku\niwt6KJOjCgnIwtw1LrxdQw78KkKUxbU2JbybCZL28VoYATjZBTFCKF6s1ZLK3qpD\nkBOCLb4ZUPGbdVDd0AQGjogrG8j+u4dU3Vj6Ic3HLr5ZfdxXdUkqG/ZK7T7weNRY\nGUYlcjrmxXAdpDO06fSpMV8GdJ0OrkxbZ8ml+VkYyHAA4OLSdW12wrmwt1Q1MscW\nsEy746pfy5J2YZJTyTgk+VqfUhW+MGwzvq7AJQb6hy/M6Qgh7zlKVzHlZ0eSDn4u\nhdq/hd1CpTK+6wlrZnInFdviCA3+0iYJAUQPkMSdM3qUvaNkIHfEVdH6rzfNFWVC\nk5H8G42ahegtDuBygaW3VE6FNf9m8xlMGEe3/A8QlPoL9iM85Q33LyFBbtKP1HsJ\nvJHhqCNh9J36YaqOze+e8YRNFejr2oZA061g+N997g8ixmPdmHFVwGeLnjEuU3hq\nb2oIVae32WcM5jE1A3vNmgvOg24KiKnrdswOwc4ISk6qbJT5IUmnU84ckfPgaZJf\n9qhP3hhcnu1JUZ5pis4By3GGTlAw3wNnoz6qYsoKaKRoXKTrcIrl372i3DLHbx2f\n7VQAI2yQgbOTYxAXG1wvz+nuE5idx0tA3XS7opQZr7PrSQ9gS84=\n=OU7J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-27T22:25:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb","id":45469,"login":"ljharb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb/list-exports/commit/ef60d937d2bf88641