he workspace fixtures don''t exist (`realpathSync` ENOENT).\nDisable it (`skip-pack: true`, next to `skip-engines`)\nand instead pack each publishable package (`list-exports`, `ls-exports`)\nin its own matrix leg, mirroring `find-primordials`.","tree":{"sha":"9de1b9ac0678b00e84a68d065c747e680382e447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/9de1b9ac0678b00e84a68d065c747e680382e447"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/0ad043ea4c4a3a73b0fc3ba0c1aaef460bdd1855","verification":{"payload":"tree 9de1b9ac0678b00e84a68d065c747e680382e447\nparent fcaa67cccd7646e35f3ba0b13f5b51cf7181a88e\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785046460 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785046460 -0700\n\n[actions] run the `pack` check as a per-published-package matrix\n\nThe shared `pretest` `pack` check packs the whole repo and runs the `@fixtures`-dependent test suite against the extracted tarball,\nwhere the workspace fixtures don''t exist (`realpathSync` ENOENT).\nDisable it (`skip-pack: true`, next to `skip-engines`)\nand instead pack each publishable package (`list-exports`, `ls-exports`)\nin its own matrix leg, mirroring `find-primordials`.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1ZBVA//TIzbtJQz60cBCYv6XuTn2/ACLpxEcMSBYEsWh9AIHG8pCbmwCIySuJeJ\nZex9ZI9FimGuAl1MTmpVuC1nrUOZdL5J7iR7gX1XN/Np1t2or4YolM/zHHmE+ejC\nCN/Ya7KrLSYbb0LigX3mGQZSS78eLLPHuh/4EqhZ2eIJ/3aGKTX8dfWW5AnZNgQa\nj7jv5PuLmawm7b7+gk6YsAMXI6VCXVtZ0KEjVElpEaK0yryGgvo4TrYSoP4oTPXr\ng+4ZqFgoTA1OgvSkgvJu9y41gp0shi9U5f4sFyvQeLUL6jh8kZWa4+USTSqBHobH\n0Q5yKwZDIdDkdGQH3H9OHUR/M8r04Uis0d9bevnb/t4j35daPVSs0f0ZtiqVugDj\nRRHJwED0UjbrvuUeyJedoMtazNiZgYVQ7MUV2emGF6wR6nfyO3Ak2EW3zIG7QZM+\nmOr/psvGgMTxLdsTSW/JeVLK/Gebyz4z+8CKqMDX3BWtniAnhvu9T2XlKOf2HaIC\n2lbERUnOYursaeLnB54bz9f+6thVfFwZHWUXoJ4+N3Y6DA3eTtRGC5b9VOzzrNX8\nj8S2VS/43m0c1