","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb","id":45469,"login":"ljharb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/fcaa67cccd7646e35f3ba0b13f5b51cf7181a88e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:11:07Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:11:07Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[list-exports] [fix] migrate from deprecated `read-package-json` to `@npmcli/package-json`\n\n`read-package-json@7` is deprecated and bundles an old `glob`/`brace-expansion` chain that trips `npm audit`.\nReplace it with `@npmcli/package-json` (pinned to `^6` for node 18/20 support),\nreading via `PackageJson.normalize`.\n`read-package-json` rejected a truthy non-string `main` (while allowing `false`/`null`);\n`@npmcli/package-json` does not,\nso `readPackage` restores that check to keep the \"invalid package.json\" detection intact.","tree":{"sha":"e0a8a9f643f16a7afec27b08e4554c9ad5f254fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/e0a8a9f643f16a7afec27b08e4554c9ad5f254fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/fcaa67cccd7646e35f3ba0b13f5b51cf7181a88e","verification":{"payload":"tree e0a8a9f643f16a7afec27b08e4554c9ad5f254fe\nparent 6baf0a158a385c881d1371d9685230a382bafb6e\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785046267 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785046267 -0700\n\n[list-exports] [fix] migrate from deprecated `read-package-json` to `@npmcli/package-json`\n\n`read-package-json@7` is deprecated and bundles an old `glob`/`brace-expansion` chain that trips `npm audit`.\nReplace it with `@npmcli/package-json` (pinned to `^6` for node 18/20 support),\nreading via `PackageJson.normalize`.\n`read-package-json` rejected a truthy non-string `main` (while allowing `false`/`null`);\n`@npmcli/package-json` does not,\nso `readPackage` restores that check to keep the \"invalid package.json\" detection intact.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1bWRg/+IoWn6O3vqu3neFNJwnSg9bWag1i7SLEdzzFC9tTmTBcJ3LOhG5Lwya4P\nYUtdBiwfMrNMiYzzQClIyTHbEWQVGZg2iLnkcQqjnvICrNBwIs+iTayuXYwf08a1\nDN6C1KYfQKhbWtKUw7GuAX30cLAIxxKQ5FUqlFW4Vr8hJYqUeZ3Hz/oUgeCmGd3F\nzV3mArixfLF/yiV+mVGq6Yl3rm5lBdH2lh552eDfs8Q7G4uTC4p9pvYSl7Rk3DFv\nsWa9cbzleXOQVwiQ+1Zf9HDoTeRRHrmhlmSjTr0lPdyElzzXzeJg9qKz7gFIz2ZZ\nGbGObwYSR2vBPFsDtw2i25NcwsK+kp713lreI2WdL/d4T6g8xPR8tgtZIdXn50v2\nd0HFHG6IrIlwn+3XIvJHIVqkjI2jm4hgAtUBiOIKauhUCF37Ad6m9C83nJaQ1sqP\nZxPbSXKfVtfK6jwhEDd5wqGTVNDbp24dkYeRzPtLHBerJ10PlHOzrtzMnwkcESGF\nnKgWO2iq16Mh9V1kz8op4Amh6Sa813BBoDlurzRUKmFRDNjxEyWCsPHuJoVbL+IB\nIss2sShCylvzbdlado0F+M2MYwN6ptjFbbzFOAyQBFcl6HIIILgY98tzISpHKCGR\nhIXy9VQELT1YsoMdoNCzsd4mhDMPr1jhlpA+J82BGkotQa2E9nk=\n=Tq1F\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-27T17:46:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb","id":45469,"login":"ljharb","nod