l":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/6baf0a158a385c881d1371d9685230a382bafb6e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:10:10Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T06:10:10Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[list-exports] [deps] pin `@npmcli/arborist` and `npm-packlist` for node 18/20 support\n\n`npm-packlist@11` requires node `^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26.0.0` and `@npmcli/arborist@9` requires `^20.17.0 || >=22.9.0`,\nboth stricter than the package''s declared `^18.17.0 || >=20.5.0`,\nso `ls-engines` failed.\nPin them back to the last majors that still support node 18.17/20.5 (`npm-packlist@9`, `@npmcli/arborist@8`).","tree":{"sha":"d2d33ad2ba218a05fada21e6e61bbd9c3a7a357a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/d2d33ad2ba218a05fada21e6e61bbd9c3a7a357a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/6baf0a158a385c881d1371d9685230a382bafb6e","verification":{"payload":"tree d2d33ad2ba218a05fada21e6e61bbd9c3a7a357a\nparent 9ebe65f015102112117731dcea375328aeff3bf5\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785046210 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1785046210 -0700\n\n[list-exports] [deps] pin `@npmcli/arborist` and `npm-packlist` for node 18/20 support\n\n`npm-packlist@11` requires node `^22.22.2 || ^24.15.0 || >=26.0.0` and `@npmcli/arborist@9` requires `^20.17.0 || >=22.9.0`,\nboth stricter than the package''s declared `^18.17.0 || >=20.5.0`,\nso `ls-engines` failed.\nPin them back to the last majors that still support node 18.17/20.5 (`npm-packlist@9`, `@npmcli/arborist@8`).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1aq4Q//e4xHk6nPG258svc8Stb83GUvlJrNtvL+qyiKgP4poG0oFDTJD+JH8W1j\nEdlVzD9YeEQ4XPK/iNM9oTSUAsmBMkrEOlY+TtjwP8tzkomlusslRbLPxMSvk