ex.d.ts` on native-TypeScript node versions.\n`no-extra-parens` is disabled where JSDoc casts require parentheses.","tree":{"sha":"85c9f787f768a92fa70e902c2b018b53f93f680a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/85c9f787f768a92fa70e902c2b018b53f93f680a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/9ebe65f015102112117731dcea375328aeff3bf5","verification":{"payload":"tree 85c9f787f768a92fa70e902c2b018b53f93f680a\nparent 9c046499ac5ac01eed894517096411d3a3814c2f\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784916446 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784916446 -0700\n\n[*] [new] add types\n\nAdd handwritten TypeScript declarations and JSDoc type annotations across the monorepo,\nchecked with `tsc` (via `@ljharb/tsconfig`) and `attw`:\n - `list-exports`: a handwritten `index.d.ts` for the async default export, plus JSDoc throughout `index.js`; wires up `types`, `postlint`, and `attw`.\n - `ls-exports` and `tests`: JSDoc annotations and per-package tsconfigs.\n - root `tsconfig.json` and `types/` stubs for dependencies lacking usable types.\nRegenerates the `list-exports` fixture,\nwhich now exposes `index.d.ts` on native-TypeScript node versions.\n`no-extra-parens` is disabled where JSDoc casts require parentheses.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1Yuzw//esDhXo+PIJxTR4s9AoO+spZH0vWvdmLhicR2P+N4OReX9NN3iWdWDWKd\nsHaW3Q0TT49FLWpEW94x2JgaEgHra2Wp+e67gVs6YVFCTsyAMeUtpbPYITfjbOa9\nzdWdy6zaP+CmZgjrsv+UTtvf1Ie0N7TAjT38MNLL/k1MC9/nxQjsx4m0144bOdMf\nAsQ3f1fLOxvCVXeXFTLmK0OOgicqWimEtl3Ykey+7q2LJaR/ARJ2/nfy5dHFODnA\njJ9Y4TOSM459HqMqCxKdjPDyOKrceWoiLOMmYneMsZSaJeH3JABDk+OV9M0c1U6W\nmK2f+EViLHVSKCqVUYHvRjyUssAeU5ubj0PLMBKn1I/tyPk83eriStMKz3t4hyIP\n03JF8BPWT7JWnFoXhFbPfasM92Xq0Ha6ZcegfHATnoBU4ruPCRELdwJ3RpJB2LxO\nSM6lCTrPnWdfGz/ouyRKj7aEYpzK6LpjZdVC8f2SzfQsMI+SeFBRJVvzLRWiA0MC\noW