","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb","id":45469,"login":"ljharb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/9c046499ac5ac01eed894517096411d3a3814c2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:58:46Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:58:46Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[ls-exports] [fix] clean up extracted package temp directories\n\nEach `ls-exports package <spec>` run extracted a full package into a `tmp.dir()` directory that was never removed\n(`util.promisify` discards tmp''s cleanup callback, and tmp does not auto-remove non-empty dirs by default),\nleaking a copy into the OS temp dir on every invocation.\nRegister `setGracefulCleanup()` and create the dir with `unsafeCleanup` so it is removed on process exit.","tree":{"sha":"3b4963200e92eaa1ef2df44f6541e6d2213c6c37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/3b4963200e92eaa1ef2df44f6541e6d2213c6c37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/9c046499ac5ac01eed894517096411d3a3814c2f","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b4963200e92eaa1ef2df44f6541e6d2213c6c37\nparent 46e507e145cdf6f41d4fd6943e9144ba767492b0\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784959126 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784959126 -0700\n\n[ls-exports] [fix] clean up extracted package temp directories\n\nEach `ls-exports package <spec>` run extracted a full package into a `tmp.dir()` directory that was never removed\n(`util.promisify` discards tmp''s cleanup callback, and tmp does not auto-remove non-empty dirs by default),\nleaking a copy into the OS temp dir on every invocation.\nRegister `setGracefulCleanup()` and create the dir with `unsafeCleanup` so it is removed on process exit.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1bWGRAAjdRjAKwg2HZKRwpwREWFaSAD1sQs0s4RHEDTHn8yA1k/UV46LknkIvuq\nP1/qu7SpqonYNfTOHqjXQC9FWOm4Od4pzvGIeUk+keuW6VxqDCV1sAMPZi4OWrqk\nt9w/veoLIJnL4eQn5n1JZCQtVNsw+VwpluYQej9isrPdoVvFI81sI1jZUvgn6My9\n5d46teqXL5V9NGI2iq75t86fKvDEssu7Thbg56CouD/gWG2Zktt9oFEMfXkSEa47\nEmiCrQXd3uPjd6msr7/xRmZg+GsZCSvjTZYvMMhc2lcnQ5tZexrvkIbIAGanAiqN\nW9V3qyM7dKincVJKdxVND67dZhEOnDGnuR/WRnwQbb5z3ikxHfVXe3ZEeRRpXoas\nQu2IJtd8L1MCeHT+PVKUBPUaXdn6wo5WE347enkAIuhE4kyo2hyEV6AxVF1XpIiS\n+b/+81o5IMY+ZUPKyqQG50/iYFY1ox/ZClMdcTuvhPVmX0FtphmD0muIlYFSLZ14\np8ObfPTEOBCR7e0PhezxtgKPyukSB3Np0Vufw0XukZbEIZKM16ClrWdb909k8i4M\nXpWjYILic1h+pnSQM8rG80zqBS5g9s2ZBhdHopKP+jqeKeye7kEL4tavvHuzA8/U\nPIyx4tfhH4mzP/jGaWJa21LGUyBM3nOxI0sygbinTsoQuihxP90=\n=9G+o\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-27T17:46:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb","id":45469,"login":"ljharb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/orgs","rece