767492b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:58:12Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:58:12Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[tests] [fix] don''t crash `add-fixture` after writing a new fixture\n\nThe final `WRITE=1` run exits non-zero by design\n(it diffs against the not-yet-written expectations before writing them, and `found` is 0 before any file exists),\nso the unguarded `execSync` threw `Command failed`\nand the tool exited with a stack trace even though it had written the fixtures correctly.\nWrap it and print the review reminder on completion.","tree":{"sha":"b063f405d25682a8f6ba61222e3b6bf79efa5c7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/b063f405d25682a8f6ba61222e3b6bf79efa5c7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/46e507e145cdf6f41d4fd6943e9144ba767492b0","verification":{"payload":"tree b063f405d25682a8f6ba61222e3b6bf79efa5c7c\nparent 35a508b7cdcebd64208f481e935ac7ab0f946e5f\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784959092 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784959092 -0700\n\n[tests] [fix] don''t crash `add-fixture` after writing a new fixture\n\nThe final `WRITE=1` run exits non-zero by design\n(it diffs against the not-yet-written expectations before writing them, and `found` is 0 before any file exists),\nso the unguarded `execSync` threw `Command failed`\nand the tool exited with a stack trace even though it had written the fixtures correctly.\nWrap it and print the review reminder on completion.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1bryQ/+K+sU9w8qipyr2qcdJpkjZ9YOIYADgftdjSWHvwGQXHbprPz6DrZJTAOB\nfr7GrY/5QNTSXvPXRK7sD89PZUCMgB9Z0Uj/A58+4D7XkNRIr1jAfFa+01oDVIDY\n4S+ZktGSzi+4ZUgfNmhd+0E0oenmQ7Mc0eQRqHUrI7BbFlA0Iduui0WYS7fp