ype":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/a146a10ceb92487d66b41e5c89daeaf0efc56a27/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:56:32Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:56:32Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[ls-exports] [fix] show a blank cell instead of `undefined` for one-sided tree files\n\nThe tree rows are the union of the latest and pre-ESM sums,\nbut each row indexed both maps unconditionally,\nso a file that contributes specifiers in only one of them rendered the literal string `undefined`\n(the summary rows above already guard their cells).\nCoalesce the missing side to an empty string.","tree":{"sha":"f9926582071622e1c277e00ee55a666d84a4bb8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/f9926582071622e1c277e00ee55a666d84a4bb8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/a146a10ceb92487d66b41e5c89daeaf0efc56a27","verification":{"payload":"tree f9926582071622e1c277e00ee55a666d84a4bb8f\nparent 4140eceaec569bee9ee9215d9a4dcdd8e01664db\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784958992 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784958992 -0700\n\n[ls-exports] [fix] show a blank cell instead of `undefined` for one-sided tree files\n\nThe tree rows are the union of the latest and pre-ESM sums,\nbut each row indexed both maps unconditionally,\nso a file that contributes specifiers in only one of them rendered the literal string `undefined`\n(the summary rows above already guard their cells).\nCoalesce the missing side to an empty string.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1YZIxAAozGupml+HxgH2owNMIUlMje31Fh4aO/OUJq+KwIMslz0esaMaJAhMqz7\nIAwLBU2T7yWyYcyDizpn/KUdzC2hCpKwjjYYjnqy1n3MSNMRnyIVamRjnIbl+j9D\neMDMaP+12ZMemm