DQ6VXNlcjQ1NDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/e679aac52bed88e6cb74631542c5934f229481fa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:53:09Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:53:09Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[list-exports] [fix] handle `null` `engines` in package.json\n\nA destructuring default only substitutes for `undefined`,\nso `\"engines\": null`\n(which read-package-json passes through unchanged)\nleft `engines` null and the later\n`engines.node` / `({ node } = engines })`\ndereferences threw an opaque `TypeError`\ninstead of the library''s normal graceful handling.\nFall back to `{ node: ''*'' }` for null too.\nAdds the `ex-null-engines` fixture.","tree":{"sha":"b8152e862403fe8ae7a09105e7d773ddf05d90aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/b8152e862403fe8ae7a09105e7d773ddf05d90aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/e679aac52bed88e6cb74631542c5934f229481fa","verification":{"payload":"tree b8152e862403fe8ae7a09105e7d773ddf05d90aa\nparent 151f11e90f093840ac4ba583bb4852ac03b7fbbc\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784958789 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784958789 -0700\n\n[list-exports] [fix] handle `null` `engines` in package.json\n\nA destructuring default only substitutes for `undefined`,\nso `\"engines\": null`\n(which read-package-json passes through unchanged)\nleft `engines` null and the later\n`engines.node` / `({ node } = engines })`\ndereferences threw an opaque `TypeError`\ninstead of the library''s normal graceful handling.\nFall back to `{ node: ''*'' }` for null too.\nAdds the `ex-null-engines` fixture.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1apWg//QLe+6wUY2NPiSj1QBT7NG9p1u1yaW55i1s/r87hIaLV0rX+DP4NASLeN\nzL8FqdlqjpsTM68Oygzv6H7KXBBipdXGKHHWzDW8D3nVZIqFv4U1ZF8vUSBhIIJi\niCf6PyeBM2j5y8bY/1s/AdwlnA4iNRtYG/gIk+8oFi9nhGHZZ/HGc+pA8ZNdq3Gp\nqhVbjTzAdlagigIzfTbRr0kZwBmzzghyLryni4neq6VW7fjlLIkr/Lf0NYj3rop1\niVr81ivrk5x7cZKMLLl2hBldu2xMCJvSUhBY7WyT5K8tEvsEhgS2CAuxJOJ2JZ6q\nYhpBjZQtjvOnK5QotEApgyHuBrEF2QZXywN0xovBAmDLNo9RV0FsmE8P2f2o0EaG\nLkmAQcY9JbT+Exi115mcNg3Yp2RndcpzoCo8mA7nG5M8atGu4FEUvz2VHmomiWSV\nNp8OPlpquL9Hxpvmps2/wksuY99vNuJer4Uj7SB8/PmO5GGZijU+YJUE4cI4gMzM\niBjdgR01Hegdkt6uEA/p6+pBWK0BLJIQqDI2iEau82k9KbPQFGpm8QmqAGpJP8IJ\nNwQaoJjqV2ulmkfc1NaKM1NHg10fQDELDdUZKN8jktcWyUt50tf4FEUdsp+WGJEO\ndhgmNaftXnWZzAcC37vZmmKh5vjINApNMKG2iXeDPdU5bu9iK40=\n=fwCB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-27T17:46:37Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb","id":45469,"login":"ljharb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb/list-exports/commit/e679aac52bed88e6cb74631542c5934f229481fa","node_id":"C_kwDOD24BatoAKGU2NzlhYWM1MmJlZDg4ZTZjYjc0NjMxNTQyYzU5MzRmMjI5NDgxZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb/list-exports/commit/151f11e90f093840ac4ba583bb4852ac03b7fbbc","sha":"151f11e90f093840ac4ba583bb4852ac03b7fbbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/151f11e90f093840ac4ba583bb4852ac03b7fbbc"}],"sha":"e679aac52bed88e6cb74631542c5934f229481fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/e679aac52bed88e6cb74631542c5934f229481fa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45469?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ljharb","id":45469,"login":"ljharb","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDY5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ljharb","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/commits/151f11e90f093840ac4ba583bb4852ac03b7fbbc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:52:29Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:52:29Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[list-exports] [fix] classify `.cjs` files as CommonJS\n\n`getExtensions` builds its extension sets from `require.extensions`,\nwhose keys never include `.cjs` (node handles it natively),\nso `isCJS` returned false for every `.cjs` file.\nAs a result a string/array `exports` target ending in `.cjs`\n(e.g. `\"exports\": \"./main.cjs\"`)\nwas added to neither `import` nor `require` and the root export vanished from every exports category.\nRecognize `.cjs` directly in `isCJS`.\nAdds the `ex-exports-cjs` fixture.","tree":{"sha":"6fcd73e32a4d5e219b5e8043faf863cfb54cbe02","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/6fcd73e32a4d5e219b5e8043faf863cfb54cbe02"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/151f11e90f093840ac4ba583bb4852ac03b7fbbc","verification":{"payload":"tree 6fcd73e32a4d5e219b5e8043faf863cfb54cbe02\nparent 8f3f50203f913229d8c674658aa12ea499f62c2e\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784958749 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784958749 -0700\n\n[list-exports] [fix] classify `.cjs` files as CommonJS\n\n`getExtensions` builds its extension sets from `require.extensions`,\nwhose keys never include `.cjs` (node handles it natively),\nso `isCJS` returned false for every `.cjs` file.\nAs a result a string/array `exports` target ending in `.cjs`\n(e.g. `\"exports\": \"./main.cjs\"`)\nwas added to neither `import` nor `require` and the root export vanished from every exports category.\nRecognize `.cjs` directly in `isCJS`.\nAdds the `ex-exports-cjs` fixture.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1YR0hAAh4/K5M8qOzO3wD5RBANus/9JweRhRij4JpKmI7QYtToJyTqmU2HPmaze\nJDZm11Eg4svPM8SglstiB/DVb2i8+NC7X5ClWPM6od4N/Wlj6mZCQSBbEafYkExp\nNfqFMNvMj6vdGUp21ZFYFPng5TZH0JSgpMAm9H/X4RGlyW3jsT094dxuSVVqb4Vh\n/4WKseDnW+fDROown9PX1XhNDksuBJvSMDd9cEfq+FkRUVMj0r7msPnJpJodh1ur\n+hweN