rband"},"message":"[list-exports] [deps] update `node-exports-info` to `^2.0.0`, and regenerate fixtures\n\n`node-exports-info@2` drops the `subpath-imports-slash` category and adds\n`pattern-trailers-no-node-addons`.\nThe tests package was already bumped to v2 (3cbd9d0);\nalign list-exports so its emitted taxonomy matches, then regenerate:\nadd the 43 `pattern-trailers-no-node-addons` fixtures and remove the 43 orphaned `subpath-imports-slash` ones.\nEngines are unaffected (v2 requires only node >= 0.4).","tree":{"sha":"9539fa15767194bf69d1257aec42fc7334ccc5ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/9539fa15767194bf69d1257aec42fc7334ccc5ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/033fa6bb9521a20a6bb58c51592ae3bc1d321e02","verification":{"payload":"tree 9539fa15767194bf69d1257aec42fc7334ccc5ef\nparent ec65a082f807e201a7cdc52f840cac07a464eb4d\nauthor Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784911091 -0700\ncommitter Jordan Harband <ljharb@gmail.com> 1784911091 -0700\n\n[list-exports] [deps] update `node-exports-info` to `^2.0.0`, and regenerate fixtures\n\n`node-exports-info@2` drops the `subpath-imports-slash` category and adds\n`pattern-trailers-no-node-addons`.\nThe tests package was already bumped to v2 (3cbd9d0);\nalign list-exports so its emitted taxonomy matches, then regenerate:\nadd the 43 `pattern-trailers-no-node-addons` fixtures and remove the 43 orphaned `subpath-imports-slash` ones.\nEngines are unaffected (v2 requires only node >= 0.4).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\nComment: GPGTools - https://gpgtools.org\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEElR4kAgmd3ro+Aievn2poHjXvi1YFAmpnmDQACgkQn2poHjXv\ni1Y73Q//VICjP8TdQSIWa2mpraeToB6wIGxca+8OocFjlMfT9R2VnGHKVcsO98IS\nxLOqIgGV5aE6TJtYiselZboMJA71IGe4qnVJM/2C+s2dVPvouUCer2EYHAmVaRJ0\nvLlpUfZRxHdJHhXpTv284fRyJbEhIzCEgI33yXqzwyyqyOTMTrRwINLX/tW8+aPg\njBLMKj7PjejUjrkDrNorL44JGgK5JGRJdOJJI42V7XDS7kD1tk4URYQl1fzA/bWO\n5u71H2gVlqFzWfO2Uc+CMuTgGgLDOJil9Rga