arband"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-14T20:21:31Z","email":"ljharb@gmail.com","name":"Jordan Harband"},"message":"[list-exports] v2.0.0\n\n - [breaking] complete overhaul\n - [breaking] remove useless `index.mjs`\n - [breaking] bump engines.node requirement to match npm 10\n - [new] include TS extensions when nodeRange supports native TypeScript\n - [fix] only list implicit paths when package has no exports field\n - [fix] properly sort tree output\n - [fix] omit RHS inside node_modules\n - [fix] properly reject `node_modules` in the RHS (not the LHS) even if URL-encoded\n - [fix] `node_modules` is apparently allowed in `exports` objects\n - [robustness] use `for-each`\n - [refactor] use `safeSet`\n - [refactor] use `call-bound` directly\n - [refactor] use `safe-array-concat`\n - [refactor] remove redundant async helper\n - [readme] replace runkit CI badge with shields.io check-runs badge\n - [readme] update badges\n - [meta] specify `directories.test`\n - [meta] add `sideEffects` flag\n - [meta] use npm workspaces instead of `lerna`\n - [deps] update `@npmcli/arborist`, `array-includes`, `array.from`, `array.prototype.filter`, `array.prototype.flat`, `array.prototype.flatmap`, `array.prototype.map`, `array.prototype.reduce`, `array.prototype.some`, `call-bind`, `get-intrinsic`, `hasown`, `node-exports-info`, `npm-packlist`, `object.entries`, `object.fromentries`, `object-inspect`, `read-package-json`, `resolve`, `semver`, `string.prototype.endswith`, `string.prototype.startswith`, `validate-exports-object`\n - [dev deps] update `@ljharb/eslint-config`, `aud`, `ls-engines`, `tape`\n - [tests] replace `aud` with `npm audit`\n - [tests] add fixture with remapped folder (#81)","tree":{"sha":"6b332549cf131b07cdc4ca12842050e5f22211a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/trees/6b332549cf131b07cdc4ca12842050e5f22211a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljharb/list-exports/git/commits/0f7cd76da046946619a714d9498359b59fe2d5be","v