0Z","email":"volodymyr.malyhin@namecheap.com","name":"Volodymyr Malyhin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T12:17:30Z","email":"volodymyr.malyhin@namecheap.com","name":"Volodymyr Malyhin"},"message":"feat: add GlobalBrowserApi.getExperiments() for page experiment assignments\n\nILC exposes the A/B experiment assignments it resolved for the page as\nwindow.ILC.getExperiments(): the same map it passes to route apps as\nappProps.experiments. Apps that ILC does not mount for a route (embedded\napps, parcels, wrapper apps) have no appProps, so this is how they read\nthe same variant as the rest of the page.\n\nGlobalBrowserApi.getExperiments() is the typed wrapper. Unlike the other\nwrappers it returns undefined instead of throwing when ILC is absent or\nthe running ILC does not provide the getter yet, so callers can fall back\nto another source.","tree":{"sha":"40d94270c72acce1daf10b96c28107c1389a45d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namecheap/ilc-sdk/git/trees/40d94270c72acce1daf10b96c28107c1389a45d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namecheap/ilc-sdk/git/commits/45aba4cae4616a6b9b356f56b4c6f5db5d0794f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/namecheap/ilc-sdk/commit/45aba4cae4616a6b9b356f56b4c6f5db5d0794f9","node_id":"C_kwDOD5DqPNoAKDQ1YWJhNGNhZTQ2MTZhNmI5YjM1NmY1NmI0YzZmNWRiNWQwNzk0Zjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namecheap/ilc-sdk/commit/d4beafb432c77ee723f9d4df4233d6f3bc2ef294","sha":"d4beafb432c77ee723f9d4df4233d6f3bc2ef294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namecheap/ilc-sdk/commits/d4beafb432c77ee723f9d4df4233d6f3bc2ef294"}],"sha":"45aba4cae4616a6b9b356f56b4c6f5db5d0794f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namecheap/ilc-sdk/commits/45aba4cae4616a6b9b356f56b4c6f5db5d0794f9"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/namecheap/ilc-sdk/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=0fd6f9e5abf60e79ab907e412e9dbe19872d118b&