"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/commits/136be0853c04a8c3957a46f8f0bcb1d7be22312c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-04T00:51:00Z","email":"tomp@netp.org","name":"Tom Pacheco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-04T00:51:00Z","email":"tomp@netp.org","name":"Tom Pacheco"},"message":"(fix) recognise keyword line labels in formatter to prevent wrong indentation\n\n- ebo-formatter-utils: rename test_is_line_util → is_line_label (exported)\n  and add default branch: keyword token + ColonSymbol → is a line label\n  (matches parser behaviour added for DST: etc.)\n- ebo-formatter-utils: fix LineStatement case to skip optional whitespace\n  token between ''Line'' and the label name\n- ebo-formatter: import is_line_label and simplify test_is_line to a\n  one-line delegate so the detection logic lives in one place\n- formatter.test.ts: add 8 is_line_label tests covering identifier labels,\n  Line-keyword labels, keyword labels (DST:, ON:), and negative cases\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c15ad0369feb881ed8115e68967d661438c8730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/trees/3c15ad0369feb881ed8115e68967d661438c8730"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/commits/136be0853c04a8c3957a46f8f0bcb1d7be22312c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5196169?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/followers","followi