ymbols (single and two-char), comments,\n  whitespace/line tokens, range tracking, system variables, error tokens,\n  and multi-token expressions via ebo_scan_text\n- signatures.test.ts (42 tests): validates Signatures map structure\n  (description, syntaxes, return type validity, argument type validity,\n  uppercase keys), spot-checks known function return types, verifies all\n  19 function aliases reference the correct parent entry, and tests the\n  get() helper for case-insensitive lookup and alias resolution\n- types.test.ts (64 tests): isFunctionKind, isValueKind, isVariableKind,\n  isSymbolKind, isOperatorKind, isKeyword, and isUnaryOperator boundary\n  tests plus TokenKind range-marker non-overlap assertions\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"320f596bfc2a0b99d9d21cffcace07953f5ce430","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/trees/320f596bfc2a0b99d9d21cffcace07953f5ce430"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/commits/cf0778b9f880ab20b78d9328f26967d7ca31a5e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5196169?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pachecot","id":5196169,"login":"pachecot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTYxNjk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user