(feat) add DateTime arithmetic type checking and TypeMismatch warnings\n\n- Add expr_type() to resolve SymbolType of any ExpressionStatement\n- Validate DateTime arithmetic rules in parse_binary_operation:\n  - DateTime + DateTime → error (DateTimeArithmeticInvalid)\n  - Numeric - DateTime → error (DateTimeArithmeticInvalid)\n  - DateTime ± Numeric → DateTime (valid)\n  - DateTime - DateTime → Numeric (valid)\n  - Numeric + DateTime → DateTime (valid)\n- Add check_assignment_types() called from parse_assignment,\n  emitting TypeMismatch Warning when LHS declared type conflicts\n  with RHS expression type\n- Add ForIdentifierInvalid check for non-Numeric for-loop variables\n- Add EboErrors: DateTimeArithmeticInvalid, TypeMismatch\n- Add 28 unit tests covering expr_type, arithmetic errors, type\n  mismatch warnings, and for-loop type validation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbecf234591d801c4c5e854e12ffd41eb290ed8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/trees/cbecf234591d801c4c5e854e12ffd41eb290ed8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/commits/c4dcce624851774bbed3d089484e4fae3c1743fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5196169?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pachecot","id":5196169,"login":"pachecot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTYxNjk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/repos","site_admin":f