"message":"(test) expand formatter unit tests\n\nAdd 17 additional tests covering detect_assign_line, compute_lhs_end,\nand group_assign_blocks behaviour:\n\n- detect_assign_line: expression/string RHS, WHILE/CHANGE/LET keywords,\n  continuation line follow-up, = inside brackets finds outer =\n- compute_lhs_end: multiple targets, extra spaces before =\n- group_assign_blocks: single stays as AssignStatement, 2/3 consecutive\n  become AssignBlock, names/values preserved, non-assignment breaks\n  grouping, block/non-assignment/block produces correct structure\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7dc9a91c0d9ce35b654c0a700b98f7f40cc4797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/trees/a7dc9a91c0d9ce35b654c0a700b98f7f40cc4797"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/commits/45b99f4ee6db37c24a30b8b09c12b7618c15c434","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5196169?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pachecot","id":5196169,"login":"pachecot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTYxNjk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/pachecot/ebo-script/commit/45b99f4ee6db37c24a30b8b09c12b7618c15c434","node_id":"C_kwDOD5fctNoAKDQ1Yjk5ZjRlZTZkYjM3YzI0YTMwYjhiMDljMTJiNzYxOGMxNWM0MzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/pachecot/ebo-script/commit/ac7721c80b4cffa5264a7a74d6277d36e70781bc","sha":"ac7721c80b4cffa5264a7a74d6277d36e70781bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/commits/ac7721c80b4cffa5264a7a74d6277d36e70781bc"}],"sha":"45b99f4ee6db37c24a30b8b09c12b7618c15c434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/commits/45b99f4ee6db37c24a30b8b09c12b7618c15c434"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5196169?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pachecot","id":5196169,"login":"pachecot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTYxNjk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/commits/ac7721c80b4cffa5264a7a74d6277d36e70781bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-02T23:35:47Z","email":"tomp@netp.org","name":"Tom Pacheco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T23:35:47Z","email":"tomp@netp.org","name":"Tom Pacheco"},"message":"(feat) add Go-style aligned assignment formatting\n\nConsecutive assignment statements now have their ''='' signs aligned to\nthe same column by the formatter (enabled by default). The old\nsingle-space normalization behaviour is available via the new\n''ebo-script.alignAssignments'' setting (set to false to opt out).\n\n- Add ebo-formatter-utils.ts with pure helpers detect_assign_line and\n  compute_lhs_end, testable outside the VSCode runtime\n- Add ebo-formatter-utils.ts import/re-export to ebo-formatter.ts\n- Add two-pass alignment in getReformatEdits: first pass collects\n  assignment ''='' positions and indentation deltas; second pass emits\n  padding edits to align each block\n- Add AssignBlock to the Statement union type in ebo-check.ts\n- Add group_assign_blocks post-processing in parse_statements to wrap\n  runs of consecutive AssignStatements into AssignBlocks\n- Add ebo-script.alignAssignments configuration property to package.json\n- Add formatter unit tests (detect_assign_line, compute_lhs_end, block\n  detection edge cases) and update check.test.ts for AssignBlock AST shape\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9e636ee4bdfdfcb993e49f4475ec54017678bca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/trees/b9e636ee4bdfdfcb993e49f4475ec54017678bca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pachecot/ebo-script/git/commits/ac7721c80b4cffa5264a7a74d6277d36e70781bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5196169?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pachecot","id":5196169,"login":"pachecot","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTYxNjk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pachecot/