y}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bradenmacdonald","id":945577,"login":"bradenmacdonald","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0NTU3Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/49082683986c395eb343378235cc7e4aa8f6430b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:51:15Z","email":"braden@opencraft.com","name":"Braden MacDonald"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T16:51:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: upgrade TinyMCE to v7 and remove the premium plugin stub package (#3245)\n\n* fix(deps): update dependency tinymce to v7 [security]\n* fix: adapt to TinyMCE 7 and drop the premium plugin stub package\n\nTinyMCE 5 -> 7 removed several APIs and plugins this app relied on:\n\n- `tinymce.editors` is gone; the problem editor now uses `tinymce.get()`\n  to collect answer/hint/feedback content and check dirty state.\n- The `hr` and `imagetools` plugins were removed (the `hr` button is now\n  core). The \"Edit Image Settings\" context toolbar that imagetools used to\n  provide is re-registered as a plain context toolbar.\n- The `formatselect` toolbar item was renamed to `blocks`.\n- The `dom` model and each core plugin must now be imported explicitly.\n- TinyMCE 7 is GPL-2.0-or-later; `licenseKey=\"gpl\"` silences its\n  evaluation-mode warning.\n\n`frontend-components-tinymce-advanced-plugins` is removed as a dependency.\nIt pinned TinyMCE 5 (pulling a second core into the bundle that clobbered\n`window.tinymce`) and only shipped no-op stubs for the paid a11ychecker and\npowerpaste plugins. Operators who have licensed those plugins can now load\nthem via `TINYMCE_EXTERNAL_PLUGINS`, `TINYMCE_LICENSE_KEY` and\n`TINYMCE_PLUGIN_OPTIONS` in env.config.jsx (see README).\n\nThe jest setup now stubs `tinymce/themes/silver` so the editor never\nfinishes initializing under JSDOM, which the test suite has always\nimplicitly relied on (previously the stubbed plugins hung initialization).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ae17b9120be417f9355a3f9ea4a938e4454e0052","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/ae17b9120be417f9355a3f9ea4a938e4454e0052"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/49082683986c395eb343378235cc7e4aa8f6430b","verification":{"payload":"tree ae17b9120be417f9355a3f9ea4a938e4454e0052\nparent 994fa2824b192d8a1736934028b7d406c21eda7e\nauthor Braden MacDonald <braden@opencraft.com> 1790182275 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790182275 -0700\n\nfix: upgrade TinyMCE to v7 and remove the premium plugin stub package (#3245)\n\n* fix(deps): update dependency tinymce to v7 [security]\n* fix: adapt to TinyMCE 7 and drop the premium plugin stub package\n\nTinyMCE 5 -> 7 removed several APIs and plugins this app relied on:\n\n- `tinymce.editors` is gone; the problem editor now uses `tinymce.get()`\n  to collect answer/hint/feedback content and check dirty state.\n- The `hr` and `imagetools` plugins were removed (the `hr` button is now\n  core). The \"Edit Image Settings\" context toolbar that imagetools used to\n  provide is re-registered as a plain context toolbar.\n- The `formatselect` toolbar item was renamed to `blocks`.\n- The `dom` model and each core plugin must now be imported explicitly.\n- TinyMCE 7 is GPL-2.0-or-later; `licenseKey=\"gpl\"` silences its\n  evaluation-mode warning.\n\n`frontend-components-tinymce-advanced-plugins` is removed as a dependency.\nIt pinned TinyMCE 5 (pulling a second core into the bundle that clobbered\n`window.tinymce`) and only shipped no-op stubs for the paid a11ychecker and\npowerpaste plugins. Operators who have licensed those plugins can now load\nthem via `TINYMCE_EXTERNAL_PLUGINS`, `TINYMCE_LICENSE_KEY` and\n`TINYMCE_PLUGIN_OPTIONS` in env.config.jsx (see README).\n\nThe jest setup now stubs `tinymce/themes/silver` so the editor never\nfinishes initializing under JSDOM, which the test suite has always\nimplicitly relied on (previously the stubbed plugins hung initialization).\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtAODCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkyIQAA48eaKRmmcvC1FImdoa+B4X\nShw+DLO8iAb9H+PGZpwsoLxOfYcyF33hoyidZHMVTEhgLF27kG+41mvOtZlOZETN\nehYTgiHWNYoYs5eIxpYLzJ/RIWHcWWapi/o+dJT2StnMjP+6csQ2SkLmb0mQVwSK\n1FgnZ5W1/Lmf+zP29zKmZlj+jMXpWmG9t5yxqy8fXSlzBZVc6EZ9+4P2WtMJuC4c\nMwpvujNAD9JNs8PKGfsLZOTmCAjQiBLIp+mb3K6BGMXJM/0j0I+TUvLfs6/L0yIM\n7zPATHai8oZKZIW9IyZtJdzrji5N8Q9VGV9L+XAZENg/LApzTInu6SQcrRuL2DvJ\n6EkZytoOzKe6fTPVfRAIGfiCB9/u/EgyawHCPOBLCN5Jfw++dwm5CXttIp24QE35\ns0xZvoWTdF4CsYO8KOkCV3ZmuOZ7DL5/naH5kMHiigHyGAjj8qHpdwqLSYbSMDIW\nusFRutW34CzDg1AoHpy9Sk/+PyYwxNGiyOWwJiGwVHbJ57YS5eFjeO4X6t8xBzvJ\nJO8Uabs1fuiSoYLEj7AoSIDU3YLu6+o6OBhA+M4I/NjfoBvViLbJ5Y7nMpBrbbt5\n6pZnyJeeKJi86RMFOlNWVyqmDrvpKJ+rclRa/fLr+n20HvM5uqJrU+CrWYyPhGQp\nDkhdz74sK1Wfqv10mPbE\n=RI4F\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T16:51:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"htt