p-authoring/commit/eda8c92f65bab948e4ea65e1b9599ed576eae468","sha":"eda8c92f65bab948e4ea65e1b9599ed576eae468","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/eda8c92f65bab948e4ea65e1b9599ed576eae468"}],"sha":"feb53522bd4967d721e4a2f4a9b06dc4e91bc021","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/feb53522bd4967d721e4a2f4a9b06dc4e91bc021"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17108583?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ihor-romaniuk","id":17108583,"login":"ihor-romaniuk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTA4NTgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/eda8c92f65bab948e4ea65e1b9599ed576eae468/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:37:08Z","email":"ihor.romaniuk@raccoongang.com","name":"Ihor Romaniuk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:37:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: bugs with the label of the image gallery sort control (#3219)\n\n* fix: restore the space between \"By\" and the sort option in galleries\n\nThe gallery sort control reads \"Bynewest\" instead of \"By newest\". The space\nlived in a literal JSX text node, and dprint stripped it in #2997 when it\nreplaced eslint. An expression container survives formatting.\n\nThe existing tests match on the accessible name, which the accname algorithm\nspace-joins across elements, so they never saw the missing space.\n\n* fix: keep the gallery sort menu inside the modal\n\nSelectMenu hard-codes a bottom-start placement and its menu is 19rem wide,\nso in the image gallery the open menu hung 138px past the modal''s right edge\nand gave the modal a horizontal scrollbar. Anchor it to the toggle''s other\nedge instead.\n\n* fix: stop the gallery sort control from repeating \"By\"\n\nThe image gallery spelled \"By\" inside its own sort labels while SearchSort adds\nthe word itself, so the control read \"By By date added (newest)\". Drop the\nprefix from those four labels. The shared one stays, and so does the rule that\nkeeps it off the options.","tree":{"sha":"715e47541a009d1277b664c8d515d15e670e4f6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/715e47541a009d1277b664c8d515d15e670e4f6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/eda8c92f65bab948e4ea65e1b9599ed576eae468","verification":{"payload":"tree 715e47541a009d1277b664c8d515d15e670e4f6f\nparent fd46d53e481637d9d542ceb889c94f2f519fc1b3\nauthor Ihor Romaniuk <ihor.romaniuk@raccoongang.com> 1789756628 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789756628 -0700\n\nfix: bugs with the label of the image gallery sort control (#3219)\n\n* fix: restore the space between \"By\" and the sort option in galleries\n\nThe gallery sort control reads \"Bynewest\" instead of \"By newest\". The space\nlived in a literal JSX text node, and dprint stripped it in #2997 when it\nreplaced eslint. An expression container survives formatting.\n\nThe existing tests match on the accessible name, which the accname algorithm\nspace-joins across elements, so they never saw the missing space.\n\n* fix: keep the gallery sort menu inside the modal\n\nSelectMenu hard-codes a bottom-start placement and its menu is 19rem wide,\nso in the image gallery the open menu hung 138px past the modal''s right edge\nand gave the modal a horizontal scrollbar. Anchor it to the toggle''s other\nedge instead.\n\n* fix: stop the gallery sort control from repeating \"By\"\n\nThe image gallery spelled \"By\" inside its own sort labels while SearchSort adds\nthe word itself, so the control read \"By By date added (newest)\". Drop the\nprefix from those four labels. The shared one stays, and so does the rule that\nkeeps it off the options.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrYTUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjSYQABz6UyjCJyexyJc6JRJdAbAI\nRQxCB0zk3TIvCKgTigNxSDYxXyEvRy4Wj4PomvHIu1un17oWZkjoT+k2SlGolmti\nCn84hG9XV0kWCspoEZnAKzzVw81QQkzpWNSoXZ9APFE8Xst+UqsHa0z9ZygUOSxF\neAisQxli5DGzpiX0b6GXoZRXFdzVvnKJyQ8yP0rctKFVWvaaN4GYYHzjiw3+mBfG\n3aLhVVR2A0iAtJcMmq04FMYC8nnTy1GYkM7gbRkfgH7994VDjMpAi8mSH5B2GWwA\nEVlOS+zCNTnmgmHIkmKRzFHF4dP1RsOKiQsTWiq/Z4U+1x/M7eX3otV/nTSelkfg\nDvyil6LvcKBFB1evxiXuK/g1huO7zAQ8q2DKCRXXk3i2grt0sA9G8GiI1X5Celf7\nCFe+ZcG6vVX6Nlbw6IBNQX/DjXWwaIk+6orWmMb1nixbge7Vd/VLCpdGY9q2eHnb\nqv+zZEDIE+QtopC/PJ635gm2yurIBC7q5zZb94R0eFAFO5SMXk+aOQMoDT6+ts2J\n4jsHgHf/ElluD6zEUKy03aJaiRwcLH9R9dek94+nUrrv2yGOkNZU5cmW7jckv2Cp\nICh8YAuQBuEIrOX0V0+bn3auCaO/zUxONs6hKuuZgeyiTFSFi/24eW8oIjxtTcJH\n/JaEbMmyd8v3XuV78dmd\n=sXUI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T18:37:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ