ranscripts directly, and the row menu label becomes\n\"Info and transcripts\" for videos.","tree":{"sha":"3f147170810dbb9271f80eefa24a6a7baed053f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/3f147170810dbb9271f80eefa24a6a7baed053f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/44c0d579bbcb0ec98f658a343cd0313a77744874","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f147170810dbb9271f80eefa24a6a7baed053f6\nparent c12c9a51ca7f05e24d979c4a7bc34cb31040d871\nauthor Aditya Bhalsod <abhalsod-sonata@2u.com> 1788888022 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788888022 +0000\n\nfeat: add in-platform transcript editor to the videos page (#3215)\n\nCourse authors can now edit video transcripts directly in Studio:\n\"Edit transcript\" in a transcript row''s action menu opens an editor\nwith per-cue text editing, SRT validation, debounced auto-save, and\nclick-to-seek playback with active-cue highlighting against the video\npreview. The video''s Info content moves below the preview (InfoTab),\nthe sidebar lists transcripts directly, and the row menu label becomes\n\"Info and transcripts\" for videos.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoEPWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApkkQAAbNOtyaCCKdA5nSK/IwFGCq\ngk9z/gFqak0stPrXi8dHAmBKDrMgkYv0V+UUFI09V4pqUFklsipYlyx6TqmzHAHs\n7FnOhRVI11YhFNKkd6L9992VpoX35O+PSB05wzu30DE+ZBuQ5wqdUSw/l/t67QsB\nf0maBeTfldtZ6F/WBZt+KyzFH7oNFXu87eA+B8rb/+DgkGorHCNAmhlygGAveJEp\nZ6t+Tyf9mn5OLg7YdX+OyNbCiRul/ZZtn7sl51IXbM2YIX/tJDVuXHVklMCR7684\nRgsqVCVs3rB+hxiayEBsxYx7KpFk6JvvmBMWx7dFm3gaLbdDQsWjliwn9M2pnTaG\njRt6pq8pW1RNYZ3ElCtMUo5y6oQanqz7XC8q7eMNUMNjbCsWn8dgS7sw/aF/U4oV\n5CFNaYEwcgpppxEikCkKn9sjiUDMZM0ApnwP/L0ZIwDQPDL9iBxZTLMiXs0UX/VY\nnRu7IyAx3Gqaa9LHj0XXbR1JXKKbXmq+v4US3koHToI9sk0CA6knO4Movgvh7aKr\n1gjUug0LEQ2XHVwunSfUTfgc+ZzflClCYi3oC6i26KJyGi7PEbmeXlQKhWI10TGX\nLuPlixMX6R6Psca2swcxCNbpBlUgxhNpZeHTUB/hQilbl+z/wqifEnOIYpEhybse\nwwP1A+UzgxDcBe8i64JN\n=U+ot\n-----END PGP SIGN