tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commit/f5041a70f2b3d08a61d68626d938b87413b914da","node_id":"C_kwDOD5t4N9oAKGY1MDQxYTcwZjJiM2QwOGE2MWQ2ODYyNmQ5MzhiODc0MTNiOTE0ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commit/2c14cef0d650f750bed87913c1def05abc02dfe9","sha":"2c14cef0d650f750bed87913c1def05abc02dfe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/2c14cef0d650f750bed87913c1def05abc02dfe9"}],"sha":"f5041a70f2b3d08a61d68626d938b87413b914da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/f5041a70f2b3d08a61d68626d938b87413b914da"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17108583?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ihor-romaniuk","id":17108583,"login":"ihor-romaniuk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTA4NTgz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ihor-romaniuk","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/2c14cef0d650f750bed87913c1def05abc02dfe9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-31T23:55:15Z","email":"ihor.romaniuk@raccoongang.com","name":"Ihor Romaniuk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-31T23:55:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: leave new dropdown answers empty instead of \"undefined\" (#3216)\n\nAdding a dropdown problem in Studio filled all three answers with the word\n\"undefined\" instead of leaving them empty behind their \"Enter an answer\"\nplaceholder, so an author had to clear each field before typing.\n\nThe blank template writes empty option tags, and the parser turned a missing\ntext node into a string with String(). Single select and multi-select escape it\nbecause they are rich text and their titles are rebuilt right after; dropdown\nanswers are plain text, so the string survived into the field.","tree":{"sha":"cd732fba2fae01a047e25a9a642e4e9f8c5de790","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/cd732fba2fae01a047e25a9a642e4e9f8c5de790"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/2c14cef0d650f750bed87913c1def05abc02dfe9","verification":{"payload":"tree cd732fba2fae01a047e25a9a642e4e9f8c5de790\nparent a5be74da2faba9e8a513aad04f3d6a6f0dd20c61\nauthor Ihor Romaniuk <ihor.romaniuk@raccoongang.com> 1788220515 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788220515 -0700\n\nfix: leave new dropdown answers empty instead of \"undefined\" (#3216)\n\nAdding a dropdown problem in Studio filled all three answers with the word\n\"undefined\" instead of leaving them empty behind their \"Enter an answer\"\nplaceholder, so an author had to clear each field before typing.\n\nThe blank template writes empty option tags, and the parser turned a missing\ntext node into a string with String(). Single select and multi-select escape it\nbecause they are rich text and their titles are rebuilt right after; dropdown\nanswers are plain text, so the string survived into the field.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIG