"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: pb-message boilerplate templates ignored by generic container (#3157)\n\n* fix: pass boilerplate to generic container add-component buttons\n\nButtons for blocks declared via StudioContainerWithNestedXBlocksMixin\n(e.g. pb-message complete/incomplete/max-attempts) were ignoring the\nboilerplate_name from their template spec, so every variant always\ncreated the default block.\n\nTwo fixes in AddComponent.tsx:\n- Pass firstTemplate?.boilerplateName from the button onClick to\n  handleCreateNewXBlock so the selected variant is forwarded.\n- Forward it as boilerplate in the handleCreateNewCourseXBlock call\n  inside the default handler branch so the backend applies the\n  correct template.\n\nCloses https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/issues/3156\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style: fix dprint formatting in AddComponent files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: fix type info for ''boilerplate_name''\n\n* chore: fix formatting\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Braden MacDonald <braden@opencraft.com>","tree":{"sha":"181f37b84247974e0c3d7f2b5614c3bace28f6a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/181f37b84247974e0c3d7f2b5614c3bace28f6a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/e4b4f32a34011e529ff86cb4461aa670fdc185fa","verification":{"payload":"tree 181f37b84247974e0c3d7f2b5614c3bace28f6a8\nparent deb510bddf192d9aa74cd5fb5295f3f89453d463\nauthor salmannawaz <salman.nawaz@arbisoft.com> 1786059946 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786059946 +0000\n\nfix: pb-message boilerplate templates ignored by generic container (#3157)\n\n* fix: pass boilerplate to generic container add-component buttons\n\nButtons for blocks declared via StudioContainerWithNestedXBlocksMixin\n(e.g. pb-message complete/incomplete/max-attempts) were ignoring the\nboilerplate_name from their template spec, so every variant always\ncreated the default block.\n\nTwo fixes in AddComponent.tsx:\n- Pass firstTemplate?.boilerplateName from the button onClick to\n  handleCreateNewXBlock so the selected variant is forwarded.\n- Forward it as boilerplate in the handleCreateNewCourseXBlock call\n  inside the default handler branch so the backend applies the\n  correct template.\n\nCloses https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/issues/3156\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style: fix dprint formatting in AddComponent files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* chore: fix type info for ''boilerplate_name''\n\n* chore: fix formatting\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Braden MacDonald <braden@opencraft.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdRyqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWOMQAFzugFVmdOGTnI6N9UmuzULe\nBjF4oTu7Yb5ny7+W+jgHnRnKqd8U00nKZp0uGdIgJAcOB1ihHmfHsVBm8OUkaJR1\nInJLULHuVeOoH+p6pqhn/TtzkTFv8KJg2437pKaCnVg6OcmfuumSNWiicHS9zpzi\ndFvFzugJBchqWOvTNiTLD9eA7c8AQkW/ak57KzcBq5Uj4Li8cLPlTKbLwW0uo8M8\n6z0jYvhBSTWsa0d/ezFgsYxEY605v6wK+f6jO0gTj5H+JWDjsOOJE8aYimEwbT3Z\nOoexmPAB93qVal/kFyCj86efG4US6RfULQXd3n1zbejrFaykMrvS/YWx89L0uU3/\nxBxKCIXHaIzX+sYk9338Svqmls2emZsUlbmJWJQNavXkDyZt286MrKeoZKPV0zdA\n7NGBA9w3Cgo40GtYzH+Irfy+covQa9PRd3M+srfhhvr/nIzIvzAD9YqMivWYUvG1\nhuO1Q4vGJs0IOxbp2vqaeZrARrwq2WP/q/WfeW1Idiq+vT1dDIbHTZ4xBDZ42Y4/\nypYvbm/bcP7S0gg8PlcH7FVwtgOK3KSR/UkaTz5o91XVinc8lM9RwfBlWETedTeN\nOXI2IboOFIZs6CKFDEKvzu+HFoRQRtoR1USFi7lFTKqGczm5qLXy/GiaxbbJgE6m\n9PecbvCPZRQxtUaDJfYU\n=hqFu\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-06T23:45:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.g