 editor, and ''View all'' navigation are unaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nCloses: https://github.com/openedx/openedx-platform/issues/38058","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqczbjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGBIQABXWW/pphY4PkepuuYCHIE3w\n5WKYCNhD5gLE/y8g8pRHD0K92QQHS/arqyxrzbkaeveuA5t8t9kj/T4t+VEb/bXR\nn8/yXl9x47UfLoqnzVQh3Q7R5S6WZZ3UGpkFeJVbAyYHD7/dZ8BYh5vfFlOe6oyK\nCyxS6aRrJ7ZfXgREMtEZMAnK5vsSfgDZ3n0kCtZu3PI4XXrYIcdvutAYsZO8/e78\nY70aHswxdcNsyIDvEvLqsjhwAsq2UCGg8A3ZMyrP1vtyWAzBhmTDPA0wWQt6FNDH\nSV/XfjNJImY6lyG0bFsr88OtpdeZ60WISg2avc3inhjjusQ+TOAyDMllWD7tJ4JY\nsPGrE1onQSUjN57h21W9eMqoBtwCtKhs0s3ncvpYr5hCDFKIy/BGMT1mr+nILM29\nA9xX9BnXFqa/iWy/zmCOnrmHKAtYvtZAk0NN8JqinFchauk9yMOVPfLTHpfdSIFO\nOyYQxpc/QfP/O5JAohr9RqXPxngcXzVOeb/YNTTn098vN6a/h56hNAMGcZ9DK1hq\nXMch8G9tSEyLmJZqcHXvG48BFxrdI4P+EdcFfoy13NIz4ivUt6bW1sH+/SBMzvx5\nTF61Da8YaYUzrJXL46aWrXU206RvwwBHqJ/yT5N2IwCfrq4GWPNy/87j6vXm1O8q\neG18Ygg/a0EFuzR5/CQ1\n=pvWX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T13:13:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commit/20903b455cb6f1fcfd479fa7ca6d7bad9f8e89ba","node_id":"C_kwDOD5t4N9oAKDIwOTAzYjQ1NWNiNmYxZmNmZDQ3OWZhN2NhNmQ3YmFkOWY4ZTg5YmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commit/27f1218139be855794000915d4b84488b7de271c","sha":"27f1218139be855794000915d4b84488b7de271c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/27f1218139be855794000915d4b84488b7de271c"}],"sha":"20903b455cb6f1fcfd479fa7ca6d7bad9f8e89ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/20903b455cb6f1fcfd479fa7ca6d7bad9f8e89ba"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/27f1218139be855794000915d4b84488b7de271c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T18:22:04Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T18:22:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): update pins to fix lockfile regen, then regen it with version bumps (#3179)\n\n* fix(deps): tighten oxlint pin, pin types/node, regenerate package-lock.json\n\nnew minor versions of oxlint have peer deps on new zero-version minor versions of oxlint-tsgolint. ^ pins the leftmost non-zero version number, so a lockfileless npm install was failing.\n\nnode types were pulled in as 26.x before pinning leading to npm run types failing. pinned to ^25 to match the pre-regen lockfile..\n\n* fix(deps): pin fast-xml-parser to 5.3.7\n\nfast-xml-parser 5.3.8+ ships breaking XMLBuilder behavior changes in\npatch/minor releases (5.3.8 serializes empty preserveOrder nodes as\n\"[object Object]\"; 5.7.3 escapes apostrophes in attribute values),\nwhich break the ProblemEditor OLX builder/parser on a lockfile regen.\n\nPin to 5.3.7, the last release before either regression, so the lockfile\ncan be regenerated safely. Moving to latest (and the security bump in\n#3175) is tracked in #3178.\n\nRefs #3178\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"791c1a044e675e7731304b74591ed56872f6e2f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/791c1a044e675e7731304b74591ed56872f6e2f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/27f1218139be855794000915d4b84488b7de271c","verification":{"payload":"tree 791c1a044e675e7731304b74591ed56872f6e2f5\nparent 5244ec57c12b63cc973e9eabdbc7b37a1b90b369\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1785262924 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785262924 -0700\n\nfix(deps): update pins to fix lockfile regen, then regen it with version bumps (#3179)\n\n* fix(deps): tighten oxlint pin, pin types/node, regenerate package-lock.json\n\nnew minor versions of oxlint have peer deps on new zero-version minor versions of oxlint-tsgolint. ^ pins the leftmost non-zero version number, so a lockfileless npm install was failing.\n\nnode types were pulled in as 26.x before pinning leading to npm run types failing. pinned to ^25 to match the pre-regen lockfile..\n\n* fix(deps): pin fast-xml-parser to 5.3.7\n\nfast-xml-parser 5.3.8+ ships breaking XMLBuilder behavior changes in\npatch/minor releases (5.3.8 serializes empty preserveOrder nodes as\n\"[object Object]\"; 5.7.3 escapes apostrophes in attribute values),\nwhich break the ProblemEditor OLX builder/parser on a lockfile regen.\n\nPin to 5.3.7, the last release before either regression, so the lockfile\ncan be regenerated safely. Moving to latest (and the security bump in\n#3175) is tracked in #3178.\n\nRefs #3178\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqaPNMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS1YQAGqryADHRjiPqDeP+mqy001l\nsX/L76xQ7BDvjlF2sxWeYWqVyNVF9fhkfofZIV3i9NRdFAWMnC1GzT4h5sg2HWZs\nbG4YJZCOdkejnGOjUDV87gMb007mseyIx91jG7es+2te+LygAXoNOdcOcLeVsi2E\nFrkSh2ecwSbKHeiloAvrw2Xsn/pdep9/FjuNZhOoCyUOVj3CRsIe2fwKJ3yzkACJ\nlQ0otfq3PeNMg1t0asv4YhJPKPvw9xUWmHveqTANr8XluMfFapL7yjusTQMIHJYL\nEBBDSrIA3YfdS0Tj9u/tW0rBTWw2bUbRDfhS7TwBh99nPku5bejKW4ZtABPaCRWQ\n1ZFLdS9euhewACcLi48OMAdwCKnyOXb1JR7NF5YmWT5heV68V0JWNvvMhbaQMG9g\ndU8gxZITGRGPVHGc4JVI8lxHPwN9epBtQ0cdMAL/f5+zoOTmpsdkPARHj9aOigFI\n/kg95CkvBjx3ZuAKeECtNVSEo7KhJxpy8DqJdHFFvj6IBBg4GJuzZLZKcpV7Zlzm\nhjhk9BPb0+wFNaEtQ1D1K4ou9Af2z7hkcjNyPWtlWW0SrIOOEaOqFHcYPMhzBliB\nWtpw6VkQTOqfnI00p3YDovyq6/2j2u2qwhWVgI/18nvNxug5yohoQqsIX0pC/QPQ\np5Ziqm8Sh8XUmtgvM/jk\n=Z6jx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-28T18:22:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198644