date":"2026-07-03T17:06:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: handle boolean flag from MFE Config API in CourseImportHomePage (#3121)\n\n* fix: handle boolean flag from MFE Config API in CourseImportHomePage\n\nThe ENABLE_COURSE_IMPORT_IN_LIBRARY flag check used strict string\ncomparison (=== ''true''), which fails when the value comes from the\nMFE Config API at runtime (JSON boolean true instead of string ''true'').\nUse the same [true, ''true''].includes() pattern already in other library\ncomponents for this case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e75c52ec5421d73cf60aa35a6d6fb38288088b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/0e75c52ec5421d73cf60aa35a6d6fb38288088b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/e0c9b34dff7b3c320a61c5a57f9be6e9274f5b42","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e75c52ec5421d73cf60aa35a6d6fb38288088b1\nparent 4c654e58866cc04e108aa2cc30ef4f8d0ebe7f77\nauthor Maria Grimaldi (Majo) <maria.grimaldi@edunext.co> 1783098361 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783098361 -0700\n\nfix: handle boolean flag from MFE Config API in CourseImportHomePage (#3121)\n\n* fix: handle boolean flag from MFE Config API in CourseImportHomePage\n\nThe ENABLE_COURSE_IMPORT_IN_LIBRARY flag check used strict string\ncomparison (=== ''true''), which fails when the value comes from the\nMFE Config API at runtime (JSON boolean true instead of string ''true'').\nUse the same [true, ''true''].includes() pattern already in other library\ncomponents for this case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqR+v6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAjR4QAIHK4eQGjCpO6fYLTUU0bucc\ntQAGB55cY+list/KJ55X27SlFe9bFh0KY9m33W9YeMWaicLxzSzEBwsm9PccNy+J\nIHcSNhi+ho4El8EwjbdhX2meTma9aXkFT3KfMPuo7otl971byhlVngdV7B8KLG3Z\n9+OsDQlu0v4At4YMYF01IKfhS6DFtxWY/B8xhqfSU