"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bradenmacdonald","id":945577,"login":"bradenmacdonald","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk0NTU3Nw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradenmacdonald","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/8d5842b71b622825e251fc1ffe68eebebeb979ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T01:53:31Z","email":"braden@opencraft.com","name":"Braden MacDonald"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T01:53:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Add \"Move Up\" / \"Move Down\" menu items to lib unit components (#3111)\n\nThis is a workaround for https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/issues/1994 \"Cannot drag a component past a really long component on a unit page\" (Since \"autoscroll\" is disabled in our usage of dnd-kit due to conflicts with our custom collision detection algorithm.)\n\nThis implements the workaround proposed in https://github.com/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/issues/3110.\n\nI also re-organized the menu to put the destructive remove/delete menu options last, below a divider, for better consistency with course authoring.","tree":{"sha":"7055378eba655ed784829bfe0766fa52e844edc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/7055378eba655ed784829bfe0766fa52e844edc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/8d5842b71b622825e251fc1ffe68eebebeb979ec","ver