.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/f9b02af01319f9d8d75eff993fd92bc76d693922","verification":{"payload":"tree 05dafa86ec1750f7fdcc9bf837df84845d89c254\nparent d4833dca40ad2bf24ad6a25aa5c9d4083ab7a00c\nauthor KEVYN SUAREZ <91025555+efortish@users.noreply.github.com> 1782419409 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782419409 -0700\n\nfix: bugs with the library selector in the \"Add Existing\" content flow (#3108)\n\nOn the unit page Add Existing sidebar, users could open the library dropdown and select a library, but the content list did not update. Search filters were being written to the course URL while the picker ran inside the unit sidebar, which interfered with Meilisearch queries. The library dropdown also stayed on “All libraries” when only one library existed, so it looked like the selection had no effect.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqPY/RCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAW1kQADyvGuF6og6vOlZ5gtITUpOq\n0mS3DbIgmggPXleQBnJlpYUrqf0BSJbk1oL9Y2kGAA//zDxU6W0e/iltGE5YUkgG\nCUl3yXFY6nFNUnvRgpp7d3R2Xgulw+zeumgWO7Po9oyFleDMDuhyrDcJnwvHlmDe\ntxOoTX4Uh4a2qMecco1+lIdhYGrJDmEBpdjOuVb6tZuMrj4/yTAg/sWTcCPist7f\ntBuJhVQuXawaigYQWzk3eCg6l1hW0TK/gwBZshp6QYI42qGkzySMbeiivoflaWh/\njKHNm1ZLtmSiovtCExInVtAWbCYq8TP70m7kAI79Mk6czMyP9IJvoxzNSb+1981k\n9HKB4mxsDrlsX2roIepUiyMVgejBQlozoB50KSUq/dXQMIJXhupGLTIIDY9jFmqa\nVVbXw6n7FwTiIJE6bfnKqQA6uQ14cziqhYOjmECRzBwHdvj1TZwq1xLouGMQKrey\ncea/+5/ZRgj3g5tMyhOGgejlfm6LDKYv3FXeYVS+tVLsS9H+ihgHN/2ERLcHobyj\nAselH6t8M7RJtLiZDSq2WPzm3d0MA7XAZG39kSDBfXkBi6d4nR4nKw4K0CUBJMvP\nRplI5SQs+5xWGBycDQtlXspwa6YxJJLJQ/i10Kz4zK77mQJaZZn7VdPyj3bwY0Gm\n5NznkLNFy1AqDJoaqOta\n=IiGX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-25T20:30:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://ap