tps://api.github.com/users/farhan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farhan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/farhan","id":25842457,"login":"farhan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODQyNDU3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farhan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farhan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farhan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farhan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/farhan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/farhan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/54d4490768c88b5ac61ebb20a2f46f57a123a62a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:53:04Z","email":"mfarhan133@gmail.com","name":"Muhammad Farhan Khan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-22T22:53:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: remove Legacy UI Waffle Flags [DEPR] (#3069)\n\n* refactor: remove legacy waffle flags, use MFE routes exclusively\nRemoves all conditional routing based on deprecated waffle flags\n(useNewCourseOutlinePage, useNewUnitPage, useNewFilesUploadsPage,\nuseNewTextbooksPage, useNewCustomPages, useNewVideoUploadsPage,\nuseNewImportPage, useNewExportPage, useNewUpdatesPage, useNewHomePage,\nuseNewPdfEditor). MFE paths are now always used.\n\n* refactor: remove legacy waffle flag definitions from waffleFlagDefaults\n\nRemoves the 11 flags that were cleaned from all consumers in Phase 1:\nuseNewHomePage, useNewCourseOutlinePage, useNewUnitPage, useNewUpdatesPage,\nuseNewFilesUploadsPage, useNewVideoUploadsPage, useNewTextbooksPage,\nuseNewCustomPages, useNewImportPage, useNewExportPage, useNewPdfEditor.\n\nWaffleFlagName type is auto-updated via keyof typeof waffleFlagDefaults.\n\n* test: remove references to deleted legacy waffle flags from test files\n\nUpdates apiHooks.test.tsx to use useReactMarkdownEditor as the example\nflag (still present, default true). Removes useNewCourseOutlinePage and\nuseNewVideoUploadsPage from all test mocks and HTTP response fixtures.\n\n* revert: revert some unnecessary changes\n\n* refactor: address Copilot change requests for waffle flag removal\n\nMakes isNewHomePage prop explicit (isNewHomePage={true}) in Header.tsx\nsince the shorthand was ambiguous after removing the waffle flag toggle.\nRestores studioBaseUrl local variable in useToolsMenuItems to avoid\nthe repeated inline getConfig() call that appeared after cleanup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* revert: restore useNewPdfEditor waffle flag\n\nThe legacy_studio.pdf_editor flag (useNewPdfEditor: false) was added\nrecently to force the legacy iframe PDF editor and is still required;\nsee openedx/openedx-platform#38148. Restores the flag default, the\nAddComponent gate, and the legacy-iframe-editor test removed in this PR.\n\n* revert: restore useNewVideoUploadsPage waffle flag\n\nThe new Videos uploads page is an edX/MIT-specific feature (default\nFalse for the community), not an MFE-vs-legacy routing flag, so it is\nout of scope for this cleanup. Restores the flag default, the\nVideoSettingsModal \"Replace video\" gate, and the content-dropdown\nVideos link condition. Its removal will be handled in a separate PR\nafter grooming with the community.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd94872c507230018b72ac37d29bb01f7df91497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/fd94872c507230018b72ac37d29bb01f7df91497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/54d4490768c88b5ac61ebb20a2f46f57a123a62a","verification":{"payload":"tree fd94872c507230018b72ac37d29bb01f7df91497\nparent 6b03394d57104007a31bda5909254657c7403644\nauthor Muhammad Farhan Khan <mfarhan133@gmail.com> 1782168784 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782168784 -0700\n\nfeat: remove Legacy UI Waffle Flags [DEPR] (#3069)\n\n* refactor: remove legacy waffle flags, use MFE routes exclusively\nRemoves all conditional routing based on deprecated waffle flags\n(useNewCourseOutlinePage, useNewUnitPage, useNewFilesUploadsPage,\nuseNewTextbooksPage, useNewCustomPages, useNewVideoUploadsPage,\nuseNewImportPage, useNewExportPage, useNewUpdatesPage, useNewHomePage,\nuseNewPdfEditor). MFE paths are now always used.\n\n* refactor: remove legacy waffle flag definitions from waffleFlagDefaults\n\nRemoves the 11 flags that were cleaned from all consumers in Phase 1:\nuseNewHomePage, useNewCourseOutlinePage, useNewUnitPage, useNewUpdatesPage,\nuseNewFilesUploadsPage, useNewVideoUploadsPage, useNewTextbooksPage,\nuseNewCustomPages, useNewImportPage, useNewExportPage, useNewPdfEditor.\n\nWaffleFlagName type is auto-updated via keyof typeof waffleFlagDefaults.\n\n* test: remove references to deleted legacy waffle flags from test files\n\nUpdates apiHooks.test.tsx to use useReactMarkdownEditor as the example\nflag (still present, default true). Removes useNewCourseOutlinePage and\nuseNewVideoUploadsPage from all test mocks and HTTP response fixtures.\n\n* revert: revert some unnecessary changes\n\n* refactor: address Copilot change requests for waffle flag removal\n\nMakes isNewHomePage prop explicit (isNewHomePage={true}) in Header.tsx\nsince the shorthand was ambiguous after removing the waffle flag toggle.\nRestores studioBaseUrl local variable in useToolsMenuItems to avoid\nthe repeated inline getConfig() call that appeared after cleanup.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* revert: restore useNewPdfEditor waffle flag\n\nThe legacy_studio.pdf_editor flag (useNewPdfEditor: false) was added\nrecently to force the legacy iframe PDF editor and is still required;\nsee openedx/openedx-platform#38148. Restores the flag default, the\nAddComponent gate, and the legacy-iframe-editor test removed in this PR.\n\n* revert: restore useNewVideoUploadsPage waffle flag\n\nThe new Videos uploads page is an edX/MIT-specific feature (default\nFalse for the community), not an MFE-vs-legacy routing flag, so it is\nout of scope for this cleanup. Restores the flag default, the\nVideoSettingsModal \"Replace video\" gate, and the content-dropdown\nVideos link condition. Its removal will be handled in a separate PR\nafter grooming with the community.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqObzQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFjcQAJqxCz3+9NmiGA6ryicQTOxd\nHcPTm3LPJmyx/aUptXIGivnzkqKc6HLcrRxtmQrBLeTbI/ZsThSRsixdYjbwJBSw\n8v74B/hKtwc1nTCu/jj9SDZrlObdcGJCNO2uJv7O2T4R/7Z78Tvev+uHynKDlDiD\n7Fr3/WrSXmnOmPkwAn8NdCPL64+8vtgn2IbPhaK7ekJiyGJbH/tUyLiS/t3aWoBs\nUpVRlipjpIhvz2aoOcVuClxiJKI8GOJc7ZfeGBW2EE06rSq0Lvc5qh4CDOGd5mNN\nK5QKPlxgObo7ukQgIQ0RtPEOOSQctxMwy1n7lbTCEd4gBpk3+4PLkIHsnV12ixYg\nY1x+bd9H76kf1dUGEiUMYZ4JRgDf94XK2U7/hN3ayF608/h7RRVNchV4rh6npMyR\nT2ZgeH9Snn/E//bhHX2Ydgf2TVLUUCx1+X+//qI58zAe/n6L7slrqKbbwZ3F+YDf\njRaYXTblUllJWMs3HFC/Sr1sHWa7lbcMjLmfFO/xxNmp8JdskKLw/wV3vC9n3dEr\ncv2MS7k5v9hLh+5GKCPhEkU0+OSl+9D5ZOrnvnYysvBswA56yZnQYvETOP0YRhHk\nGU27yqZgzLEnaAz6w4J3sR7dNC2yk+LAEbph7hJcL5bx1KzBrgz8b63F6tjPElOP\nfDB1uNZAN4f2U207cZ9t\n=k1Eh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-22T22:53:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://ap