inkarkera/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/navinkarkera","id":10894099,"login":"navinkarkera","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwODk0MDk5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/navinkarkera","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/commits/27be8b3138ac32d73ab66896cc2f16e96f86b620/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T21:08:21Z","email":"navin@opencraft.com","name":"Navin Karkera"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T21:08:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(course-outline): migrate to React Query and consolidate outline architecture (#3073)\n\nLarge architectural refactor of the course outline module. Migrated from Redux to React Query for outline data and mutation flows, consolidated context management, and unified component rendering.\n\n**1. Redux to React Query Migration**\n\n- Removed Redux outline slice, thunks, selectors, and all Redux-based state management\n- All outline data fetching now uses React Query hooks\n- Mutations (reorder, delete, configure, publish, duplicate) centralized in `apiHooks.ts`\n- Cache invalidation handled via dedicated utilities in `cacheInvalidation.ts`\n\n**2. Context Consolidation**\n\n- Outline state consolidated into `CourseOutlineContext`; sidebar/drag contexts remain separate\n- Extracted state management into focused hooks: `useOutlineReorderState`, `useOutlineStatusState`, `useConfigureModal`, `useDeleteModal`, `useHighlightsModal`, `useUnlinkModal`, `useCreateBlockSidebar`, `useModalState`\n- Sidebar modal state simplified with `OutlineModals` component\n\n**3. Component Unification**\n\n- Card components (SectionCard, SubsectionCard, UnitCard) replaced by single recursive `OutlineNode` component; legacy style/message modules remain where still imported\n- Introduced `OutlineTree` for recursive outline rendering with depth-based logic\n\n**4. Test Infrastructure Modernization**\n\n- Old fixture usage replaced by shared builders/utilities in `__mocks__/testSetup.tsx` and `__mocks__/helpers.ts`\n- Added comprehensive hook tests (apiHooks, useOutlineReorderState, etc.)\n- Migrated all outline tests to use new fixture builders and shared setup\n\n**5. Bug fixes**\n\n- **Title Edit Escape Fix**: Pressing Escape while editing a title now correctly cancels the edit instead of saving. Previously the blur handler fired on Escape, persisting unintended changes.\n- **?show Scroll Fix**: Repeated scroll to item based on `?show=` is prevented. It will only scroll to the item once.","tree":{"sha":"a9d16f1163acad7439418283019a682cf781437a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/trees/a9d16f1163acad7439418283019a682cf781437a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openedx/frontend-app-authoring/git/commits/27be8b3138ac32d73ab66896cc2f16e96f86b620","verification":{"payload":"tree a9d16f1163acad7439418283019a682cf781437a\nparent de79c0c3b6bc3549a7fb16a1cbd198f2c1649593\nauthor Navin Karkera <navin@opencraft.com> 1781557701 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781557701 -0500\n\nrefactor(course-outline): migrate to React Query and consolidate outline architecture (#3073)\n\nLarge architectural refactor of the course outline module. Migrated from Redux to React Query for outline data and mutation flows, consolidated context management, and unified component rendering.\n\n**1. Redux to React Query Migration**\n\n- Removed Redux outline slice, thunks, selectors, and all Redux-based state management\n- All outline data fetching now uses React Query hooks\n- Mutations (reorder, delete, configure, publish, duplicate) centralized in `apiHooks.ts`\n- Cache invalidation handled via dedicated utilities in `cacheInvalidation.ts`\n\n**2. Context Consolidation**\n\n- Outline state consolidated into `CourseOutlineContext`; sidebar/drag contexts remain separate\n- Extracted state management into focused hooks: `useOutlineReorderState`, `useOutlineStatusState`, `useConfigureModal`, `useDeleteModal`, `useHighlightsModal`, `useUnlinkModal`, `useCreateBlockSidebar`, `useModalState`\n- Sidebar modal state simplified with `OutlineModals` component\n\n**3. Component Unification**\n\n- Card components (SectionCard, SubsectionCard, UnitCard) replaced by single recursive `OutlineNode` component; legacy style/message modules remain where still imported\n- Introduced `OutlineTree` for recursive outline rendering with depth-based logic\n\n**4. Test Infrastructure Modernization**\n\n- Old fixture usage replaced by shared builders/utilities in `__mocks__/testSetup.tsx` and `__mocks__/helpers.ts`\n- Added comprehensive hook tests (apiHooks, useOutlineReorderState, etc.)\n- Migrated all outline tests to use new fixture builders and shared setup\n\n**5. Bug fixes**\n\n- **Title Edit Escape Fix**: Pressing Escape while editing a title now correctly cancels the edit instead of saving. Previously the blur handler fired on Escape, persisting unintended changes.\n- **?show Scroll Fix**: Repeated scroll to item based on `?show=` is prevented. It will only scroll to the item once.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqMGnFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvJUQAGsaVpc4/kgIqhpRcFXPVzbQ\n/AAiRUb2RtJI1AUiO4/96A5ymM7BTOWbuuyVIdu38QEyQY8pA9F6lZQqs4951IzZ\n8I0mPM53taOgG4muzja6/5MDZ18B+/kj9SH