ley/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mturley/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mturley/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mturley/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mturley","id":811963,"login":"mturley","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMTk2Mw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mturley/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mturley/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mturley/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mturley/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mturley/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mturley","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/bc4ad73d066a314a8157ad055731a0bba44b8e7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:20:05Z","email":"mike@turley.me","name":"Mike Turley"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:20:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"RHOAIENG-99503: Port legacy NIM credential hardening to 3.6 (#10142)\n\n* RHOAIENG-93068: Harden legacy NIM credential access [stable-2.x] (#10050)\n\n* RHOAIENG-93068: Harden legacy NIM credential access\n\nRequire an editable NIM-enabled project before returning global legacy NIM\ncredentials, and enforce the server-side legacy NIM feature flag for project\npromotion and credential reads.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-sol)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Addressing feedback\n\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Fix tests\n\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n(cherry picked from commit bac7d7e55182b65fcef98d60d63480d79d1ab509)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n(cherry picked from commit e6538aa723272fe92f206313fe7c2e3f5162590f)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Use passThrough instead of fastify.kube.coreV1Api.readNamespace (#10061)\n\n(cherry picked from commit d8bf1aecbd32019fe2b2029b688a7099a4b75548)\n(cherry picked from commit d4244ea4c90ff4e35c3a0e959eeb12ee7acf15f8)\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-6-luna)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* RHOAIENG-93068: Adapt pass-through import for 3.4\n\nUse the v3.4 shared pass-through utility location for the user-authenticated\nNamespace lookup introduced by the follow-up fix.\n\n(cherry picked from commit b87d1a1e3b485864e5b4080552ea98e2501d086e)\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-6-luna)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\nCo-authored-by: Emily Samoylov <93456589+emilys314@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8ba36bc921a4e2dd3dfaa25249c60084c8a5a69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/f8ba36bc921a4e2dd3dfaa25249c60084c8a5a69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/commits/bc4ad73d066a314a8157ad055731a0bba44b8e7e","verification":{"payload":"tree f8ba36bc921a4e2dd3dfaa25249c60084c8a5a69\nparent 6a8ce03e1cc735bed5918ab8fc4410575a4415bd\nauthor Mike Turley <mike@turley.me> 1791472805 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791472805 +0000\n\nRHOAIENG-99503: Port legacy NIM credential hardening to 3.6 (#10142)\n\n* RHOAIENG-93068: Harden legacy NIM credential access [stable-2.x] (#10050)\n\n* RHOAIENG-93068: Harden legacy NIM credential access\n\nRequire an editable NIM-enabled project before returning global legacy NIM\ncredentials, and enforce the server-side legacy NIM feature flag for project\npromotion and credential reads.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-sol)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Addressing feedback\n\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Fix tests\n\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me