hub.com/christianvogt","id":14068621,"login":"christianvogt","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDY4NjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianvogt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianvogt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianvogt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianvogt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianvogt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/christianvogt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/6a8ce03e1cc735bed5918ab8fc4410575a4415bd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:43:46Z","email":"cvogt@redhat.com","name":"Christian Vogt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:43:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(fullsend): stop attaching findings-output to the challenger (#10137)\n\nThe challenger spawn told the sub-agent to read findings-output.md,\nwhich requires a flat findings array and conflicts with challenger.md''s\nadjudication object. Runs then failed consume and fell back to the\npre-challenger set. Keep common-review.md only; clarify wrong-shape\nfallback and de-dupe sticky failure prose.","tree":{"sha":"dc1d082c87c17d2c47c207745564b8f227e1eea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/dc1d082c87c17d2c47c207745564b8f227e1eea6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/commits/6a8ce03e1cc735bed5918ab8fc4410575a4415bd","verification":{"payload":"tree dc1d082c87c17d2c47c207745564b8f227e1eea6\nparent 59fa83f15ed3b9b71931f308e82f23a456fcf026\nauthor Christian Vogt <cvogt@redhat.com> 1791470626 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791470626 +0000\n\nfix(fullsend): stop attaching findings-output to the challenger (#10137)\n\nThe challenger spawn told the sub-agent to read finding