bscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpanshug/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpanshug","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/ce0a262825f2b342127ed9b09af63cf0193c71cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:18:48Z","email":"97534722+dpanshug@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Dipanshu Gupta"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:18:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"RHOAIENG-97411: Replace generic pnpm prefetch with npm bootstrap (#10038)\n\n* RHOAIENG-97411: Use typed pnpm prefetch for hermetic builds\n\n* RHOAIENG-97411: Allow pnpm bootstrap lockfile in CI\n\n* ci: keep workflow lines within style limit\n\n* fix: avoid network-dependent curl install\n\n* fix: copy hermeto npm config into workspace builds\n\n* fix: keep notebooks npm install offline\n\n* revert: restore notebooks npm CI install mode\n\n* fix(notebooks): qualify rimraf override exceptions\n\nRHOAIENG-97411\n\nRestrict the nyc and istanbul-lib-processinfo exceptions to rimraf 3 requests. Preserve locked dependency versions while avoiding npm dependency-tree re-resolution and registry metadata requests during hermetic installation.\n\n* fix(build): address pnpm prefetch review feedback\n\n* docs(build): explain the prefetch/pnpm hermetic bootstrap\n\nAdd a README describing why the locked pnpm bootstrap package exists, how\nKonflux PipelineRuns and Dockerfiles consume it, and the steps required when\nupgrading pnpm.\n\nRHOAIENG-97411","tree":{"sha":"f38d7c433b34c4c1c99dcbb5a80f4375f1bda945","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/f38d7c433b34c4c1c99dcbb5a80f4375f1bda945"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/commits/ce0a262825f2b342127ed9b09af63cf0193c71cb","verification":{"payload":"tree f38d7c433b34c4c1c99dcbb5a80f4375f1bda945\nparent 965adfc3f12b2b5362f43763ad913f0747ab0159\nauthor Dipanshu Gupta <97534722+dpanshug@users.noreply.github.com> 1791465528 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791465528 +0000\n\nRHOAIENG-97411: Replace generic pnpm prefetch with npm bootstrap (#10038)\n\n* RHOAIENG-97411: Use typed pnpm prefetch for hermetic builds\n\n* RHOAIENG-97411: Allow pnpm bootstrap lockfile in CI\n\n* ci: keep workflow lines within style limit\n\n* fix: avoid network-dependent curl install\n\n* fix: copy hermeto npm config into workspace builds\n\n* fix: keep notebooks npm install offline\n\n* revert: restore notebooks npm CI install mode\n\n* fix(notebooks): qualify rimraf override exceptions\n\nRHOAIENG-97411\n\nRestrict the nyc and istanbul-lib-processinfo exceptions to rimraf 3 requests. Preserve locked dependency versions while avoiding npm dependency-tree re-resolution and registry metadata requests during hermetic installation.\n\n* fix(build): address pnpm prefetch review feedback\n\n* docs(build): explain the prefetch/pnpm hermetic bootstrap\n\nAdd a README describing why the locked pnpm bootstrap package exists, how\nKonflux PipelineRuns and Dockerfiles consume it, and the steps required when\nupgrading pnpm.\n\nRHOAIENG-97411","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqx5g4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOPQQAF1f6EO4NvRj0qiVkKpKK1X6\n2o7awprClqQ/hHxMQECVcRbK67iNLkReejUcyDRSzr4HuvHykPXOoFw7wZyaVbB8\nY1zu3+WE7NIDt1hUQBIo3djuJ7OFnEb9HIIAKi5SHuCQ2Ceh+I5UPk7SuteDVt3+\nR6MBuyTPDrcrjQ04XxkQPEMK+7/Tk5mDxdd9bwDQFbkzxhh3hBDlTBxhFA4B1LjM\nIHFn4oz3H0JJv2B3ZDirFKV5Okn8OiuOpCz3YYAK5PXEZ6EK5imt5Nbzfx624rkH\naPPDTjddq5CqYOQt8iK+NiPvAY3tceDHmryKs6OoY+F3r0bTUYcgJK/EmxM3FsQw\nuZ1W0lGmNxdLpAuQCkYj/nN2vNDszx6uRwnBdJTj5Zbah99y+DmjFxQhpLDF1iac\nZ81shUERCCBLbQQq9394lhYKd7YypCQvsUq0g+SJWjLeOvGRR7vrpRlh9gWlkfYQ\nw5FRx+F0ujiBzwTUFn2aXS5StznR5PKNuhhVbKIcOgUfzT75RHmScFLEPqoVc9O1\nE9XlZBkVSeJi/DFenJ7/j4hSQeNq3Yvql1fxzODyaYToFlNRLvTVeB8Jan9jeNdV\ntNl7udHNjoBd6CyUL7AXKXgITHCr6tF0LVRZWCzpje9eN8RD+8P5n3NyLVhRh/Hg\nnt3hzE