received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toklumpp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toklumpp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toklumpp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/toklumpp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/toklumpp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/cb8b6c88c644e50a81f229bc0f2f5c0675df9bd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:08:50Z","email":"tobias.klumpp@redhat.com","name":"Tobias Klumpp"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:08:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Allow media attachments and unify transcription model selection (#9973)\n\n* Allow playground media actions without capability tags\n\n* Show transcription model guidance when no models are tagged\n\n* Explain transcription model choices in selection dialog\n\n* Show selected transcription model with edit and remove controls\n\n* Place transcription model edit control before remove\n\n* Remove transcription model help tooltip\n\n* Show add action until a transcription model is selected\n\n* Add audio-capable models to the local mock namespace\n\n* Align transcription model details and modal actions\n\n* Indent transcription model descriptions without underlining links\n\n* Keep transcription model heading the same size\n\n* Clarify audio transcription model selection heading\n\n* Keep transcription model heading consistent in settings\n\n* Restore outline around transcription model add section\n\n* Place transcription model heading above add section\n\n* Point audio uploads to transcription model settings\n\n* Explain missing vision capability after image upload\n\n* Put image alert dismissal on its own paragraph\n\n* Unify audio transcription model selection\n\n* Restore original empty transcription model states\n\n* Improve selected transcription model layout\n\n* Keep empty transcription dropdown available\n\n* Cover vision capability message in mock playground\n\n* Cover every vision notice condition and dismissal state\n\n* Cover additional model selection and audio flows\n\n* Make audio phase formatting pass CI lint\n\n* Keep pending audio and vision notice usable when settings are unavailable\n\n* Remove mock audio namespace backend test\n\n* Restore backend coverage for mock audio models\n\n* Space Playground notices above the message input\n\n* Match transcription model list spacing to the design\n\n* Use described menu items for transcription model selection\n\n* Guide users when no transcription models are available\n\n* Align Playground attachments and compact recommended labels\n\n* Cover Playground attachment alignment and compact labels\n\n* Align pending audio attachments and cover Playground decisions\n\n* Align audio attachment with message text field\n\n* Align audio attachment with message bar frame\n\n* Enable transcription only after selecting an available model\n\n* Size transcription selector to its model label\n\n* Keep transcription selector full width while sizing its menu to content\n\n* Match transcription menu width to its selector\n\n* Restore transcription enabled variable name and position\n\n* Allow transcription with manually selected models\n\n* Update chatbot audio transcription test for modal-based model selection\n\nThe transcription model picker redesign replaced the inline ASR selector\nwith an all-models modal opened by the add button. Retarget the page\nobject selectors and drop the obsolete intermediate toggle click.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8c1408400e90475c16204298c74f2348ecef8dd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/8c1408400e90475c16204298c74f2348ecef8dd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/