lumn width assertion.\n\n* Disable Verify for connection types that cannot be verified\n\nConnection testing only supports S3, URI, and OCI types. For any other\ntype, disable the Verify kebab action and the Verify connection button\nin the modal, with a tooltip explaining why, instead of letting the user\nclick through to an \"unsupported type\" error.","tree":{"sha":"8b69903d753008c4ae1b6438fec05abe59f4fa4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/8b69903d753008c4ae1b6438fec05abe59f4fa4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/commits/e4eb79df4f73deb623d85e162449180af9d78cb7","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b69903d753008c4ae1b6438fec05abe59f4fa4b\nparent f7b629f0a182c78fb32d57359fb448b5e8ac0423\nauthor Juntao Wang <37624318+DaoDaoNoCode@users.noreply.github.com> 1791410750 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791410750 +0000\n\nRemove connectionTest feature flag and make connection test feature always on (#9917)\n\n* Remove connectionTest feature flag and make connection test feature always on\n\n* fix types\n\n* fix types in tests\n\n* remove deprecated tests\n\n* address review nits\n\nRemove the duplicate connection-test UI test and the leftover status column width assertion.\n\n* Disable Verify for connection types that cannot be verified\n\nConnection testing only supports S3, URI, and OCI types. For any other\ntype, disable the Verify kebab action and the Verify connection button\nin the modal, with a tooltip explaining why, instead of letting the user\nclick through to an \"unsupported type\" error.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxsI+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADWsQAICR/+w+CHJZx88FOeN8L6iQ\na87/Ri8/RbfzdXTe+8pqln77aFjRLs40QemyaoczCEPAO1p/Y8BjgryQ/WSjii8w\niILFY7e4bdrECZcUdBpiPNcn8WwUWyNqHQP69JANFE1AYGBnI6vdnxtwmFi0ormk\nSP4csowX1oYKxqCbAgL78ZBy4qHx/xsaSVS8cAecKGd6ol7GdSHDQLbQQ/aEslpv\nUNMmeRN8xcPg+IN846AJ3jck19L6MsEClt4r6DDD/s4+YOKTpd8uyoT6KyU4N5