63d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:32:14Z","email":"lucasfernandezaragon@gmail.com","name":"Lucas Ferrnandez Aragon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T16:32:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(dch): honor cluster TLS security profile in data-connect-hub BFF (#10122)\n\nIntegrate the data-connect-hub BFF with the shared cluster-wide TLS\nsecurity profile package, bringing it to parity with the other dashboard\nBFFs. data-connect-hub was scaffolded after RHOAIENG-61069 (#9396) landed,\nso it still hardcoded tls.Config{MinVersion: tls.VersionTLS13}.\n\n- Replace the hardcoded TLS config in bff/cmd/main.go with\n  tlsprofile.ServerTLSConfig, resolved before the server goroutine and\n  failing closed on error\n- Add the pkg/tls require + local replace to bff/go.mod (go mod tidy\n  aligns k8s deps to v0.34.3)\n- Grant RBAC get on config.openshift.io/apiservers (cluster) in the\n  module ClusterRole\n- COPY pkg/tls into Dockerfile and Dockerfile.workspace build contexts\n\nRHOAIENG-95250","tree":{"sha":"ea6beb5fdff6f8ec32a7f8407a243db017688f6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/ea6beb5fdff6f8ec32a7f8407a243db017688f6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/commits/4bbf95f8f4cc860b2a2c67e67e59c9b44f6063d8","verification":{"payload":"tree ea6beb5fdff6f8ec32a7f8407a243db017688f6f\nparent 1c04b420c749dd2d196a836b6708ee3713c538f6\nauthor Lucas Ferrnandez Aragon <lucasfernandezaragon@gmail.com> 1791390734 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791390734 +0000\n\nfeat(dch): honor cluster TLS security profile in data-connect-hub BFF (#10122)\n\nIntegrate the data-connect-hub BFF with the shared cluster-wide TLS\nsecurity profile package, bringing it to parity with the other dashboard\nBFFs. data-connect-hub was scaffolded after RHOAIENG-61069 (#9396) landed,\nso it still hardcoded tls.Config{MinVersion: tls.VersionTLS13}.\n\n- Replace the hardcoded TLS config in bff/cmd/main.go with\n  tlsprofile.ServerTLSConfig, resolved before the server goroutine and\n  failing closed on error\n- Add the pkg/tls require + local replace to bff/go.mod (go mod tidy\n  aligns k8s deps to v0.34.3)\n- Grant RBAC get on config.openshift.io/apiservers (cluster) in the\n  module ClusterRole\n- COPY pkg/tls into Dockerfile and Dockerfile.workspace build contexts\n\nRHOAIENG-95250","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxnQOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANrEQAJDPvtePXIlDK4pmJWa2w1B5\n5KNySGKBXpzIeesmOuw7qKV20LHsOPLvrUz86bUUdjCRniqaEvt+wskqZeaSoZRW\nAfPywM2O/f79ULSInReGJN9EkthpUiQ3LqMR3CdK7GL8aODXxVFDQ8rNAEff/mxM\nvgftrk4eHIE7Gt+KdRUPAVNq/FD0SmwpZMmGcyPIjZ6cpYuc/gOhvMGkbRWzam+7\nVdF8LnLsaTWc7WUclhqY/89ImWKBLCCL5H8EW6GanoT7nUXKrFUH46FJfSQAJ4TG\nTlhoOpu42MXb8IWGfRArs2R9oeAEIT1cENP15jQ/6AOui7dj0DHx9AsU80o4tbsM\nqEWOjYSIIC48pVFALvnURT/TIfTYrg+G5/YWDt4aHnKkGnHro7um0vywtcQunfDf\n+YCPIVi1XmykZbNgr28liGdB4KmDPFy5mfEYJo720anu43A4FGe6d+bCk92yozZI\neOfUKj6IDCHcUBOSSxCAmG4wzSAjDaAuSAUyW/RaKc0gUlApZJVVzLswmpt+NtIL\nc1QTrhYOCq07wtdEhAFtA2cAcViv/1BH9E+KW/G5riO5USFUxJPomBgyo8N7Scpp\nXLfuCFqF8CgOjlzhXtnqA+r36Ece3KVVk2jRIJkVjgzTqgymPdZFupG4hTn+xulE\ntJcDaO1QCZG/4wrWh0pc\n=bG7Y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T16:32:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.