mit/5cd74a71fc1d49c5b5fb820dc1c947b8390fc854","node_id":"C_kwDOEAWiEdoAKDVjZDc0YTcxZmMxZDQ5YzViNWZiODIwZGMxYzk0N2I4MzkwZmM4NTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commit/6d947e6cad1cbf52addc54ee7a024b0367d3ae8a","sha":"6d947e6cad1cbf52addc54ee7a024b0367d3ae8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/6d947e6cad1cbf52addc54ee7a024b0367d3ae8a"}],"sha":"5cd74a71fc1d49c5b5fb820dc1c947b8390fc854","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/5cd74a71fc1d49c5b5fb820dc1c947b8390fc854"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12587674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Gkrumbach07","id":12587674,"login":"Gkrumbach07","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTg3Njc0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Gkrumbach07","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/6d947e6cad1cbf52addc54ee7a024b0367d3ae8a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:31:22Z","email":"gkrumbac@redhat.com","name":"Gage Krumbach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:31:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(fullsend): GPT-6.1 Sol reviews, Fullsend v0.45.0, enable fix agent (#10118)\n\n* feat(fullsend): GPT-6.1 Sol reviews, Fullsend v0.45.0, enable fix agent\n\nMove the Sol review tier (and the opus alias) from openai/gpt-6-sol to\nopenai/gpt-6.1-sol; the Luna tier is unchanged. Pin the review sandbox\nimage to the v0.45.0 digest, which bundles Pi 0.99.2, the first Pi\nrelease whose catalog carries gpt-6.1-sol, and pin reusable-dispatch to\nthe same release instead of the post-v0.43.0 commit.\n\nEnable the fix stage by adding the coder role, keeping issue-driven\n/fs-code off with an explicit disabled code entry. The shim admits\n/fs-fix [instruction] comments to dispatch (/fs-fix-stop stays with the\nstop-fix job). A changes_requested review routes to fix, which never\nreads host-adapter context, so adapter-plan no longer buys a CodeRabbit\nreview and Jira fetch for it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TKc5BKLjS7vXT64NXr3Jg5\n\n* feat(fullsend): rate PR risk on GPT-6.1 Sol\n\nThe rating persona''s risk/confidence decides whether a review may\napprove (rating-policy.json refuses on high/critical risk). Its output\nis tiny, so route it to the Sol tier explicitly instead of letting its\nsonnet frontmatter alias fall to Luna.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TKc5BKLjS7vXT64NXr3Jg5\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20377550fa8583c9e21bb0143d7dbddbbc703a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/20377550fa8583c9e21bb0143d7dbddbbc703a5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/commits/6d947e6cad1cbf52addc54ee7a024b0367d3ae8a","verification":{"payload":"tree 20377550fa8583c9e21bb0143d7dbddbbc703a5f\nparent cbcc7ef18cb2478acdabdbb8b9395fe5c08fefba\nauthor Gage Krumbach <gkrumbac@redhat.com> 1791387082 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791387082 +0000\n\nfeat(fullsend): GPT-6.1 Sol reviews, Fullsend v0.45.0, enable fix agent (#10118)\n\n* feat(fullsend): GPT-6.1 Sol reviews, Fullsend v0.45.0, enable fix agent\n\nMove the Sol review tier (and the opus alias) from openai/gpt-6-sol to\nopenai/gpt-6.1-sol; the Luna tier is unchanged. Pin the review sandbox\nimage to the v0.45.0 digest, which bundles Pi 0.99.2, the first Pi\nrelease whose catalog carries gpt-6.1-sol, and pin reusable-dispatch to\nthe same release instead of the post-v0.43.0 commit.\n\nEnable the fix stage by adding the coder role, keeping issue-driven\n/fs-code off with an explicit disabled code entry. The shim admits\n/fs-fix [instruction] comments to dispatch (/fs-fix-stop stays with the\nstop-fix job). A changes_requested review routes to fix, which never\nreads host-adapter context, so adapter-plan no longer buys a CodeRabbit\nreview and Jira fetch for it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TKc5BKLjS7vXT64NXr3Jg5\n\n* feat(fullsend): rate PR risk on GPT-6.1 Sol\n\nThe rating persona''s risk/confidence decides whether a review may\napprove (rating-policy.json refuses on high/critical risk). Its output\nis tiny, so route it to the Sol tier explicitly instead of letting its\nsonnet frontmatter alias fall to Luna.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TKc5BKLjS7vXT64NXr3Jg5\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxmXLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQCoQABIVg1ByLGQ59je913WFecZc\nmAG+AtQ0/HClehG2WwfpxZHzUA90JncgcZgbmYpgjIhzZ9TqhyS9L4i56dEWueAh\nTe+8bVjtW0F0zQMnWs7ETMDoExEMfS5J9XLDmk1+qSl/2gZb8LJqlAZQiz3Ac8Sl\nWWq/XfA54Y30PwXZqGfkLiUu98u0q9AAPiYVmcw3L4pBWhFjeJMMgIIxqdkC68/n\nFVRqv/UZ97TpI2IlSG51ySCndREy+B0MNYUDzIUrnw4Qzir556JCBjkfWvigsEOM\nco3Fzv2ac3BpCHMPThBK0sbxPybJdvu6U9z0tjtBnVqlI60cgebAKW9mahO0Tdqp\noXErybG8BP+FfI+3pTKgCuE87CJei9ArxIxSXdnigIgsJ0qyXOSBMgHSMC