ed-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-terra)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Fix runtime image install wizard layout\n\nUse the standard ApplicationsPage breadcrumb and wizard structure, and render\nselected target details through the Radio body for proper spacing.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-sol)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Strengthen runtime image route access test\n\nAssert that non-admin navigation reaches the shared not-found page rather than\nonly checking that runtime image content is absent.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-sol)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>","tree":{"sha":"c9e591a9f207764d500fb34d24cafb9b03eb1433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/c9e591a9f207764d500fb34d24cafb9b03eb1433"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/commits/880a28587f4955023f90bf9ddec0947348ff9c73","verification":{"payload":"tree c9e591a9f207764d500fb34d24cafb9b03eb1433\nparent d141549f398e41cc03d2b2138d61aa38bc74234d\nauthor Mike Turley <mike@turley.me> 1791297574 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791297574 +0000\n\nAdd runtime image install wizard foundation (#9995)\n\n* Add runtime image install wizard foundation\n\nAdd the temporary Runtime image Install action, route, wizard host, and\ninstall-target extension contract for RHOAIENG-96638.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-sol)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Use shared lazy extension component helper\n\nRender the selected runtime image install target through the standard\nLazyCodeRefComponent and retain focused loading-state coverage.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-sol)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Add runtime image install target placeholders\n\nRegister KServe and LLMD Serving install targets with temporary JSON content\nso the runtime image Install wizard can exercise both extension paths.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-sol)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Select first matching runtime image install target\n\nDeduplicate available install targets by ID and use the first matching active\nextension for each target while retaining both available target types.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-terra)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Fix runtime image install wizard layout\n\nUse the standard ApplicationsPage breadcrumb and wizard structure, and render\nselected target details through the Radio body for proper spacing.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-sol)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n* Strengthen runtime image route access test\n\nAssert that non-admin navigation reaches the shared not-found page rather than\nonly checking that runtime image content is absent.\n\nAssisted-by: Pi Agent (openai gpt-5.6-sol)\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Mike Turley <mike@turley.me>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxQgmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcmMQAKvHNJoTtXehTp6ilM5mtP+O\nHAc2rMKY8AZw2ax8+fuNoR5XksperP7azRKE4rESVWw9pbQSQ4g8jbuCJF7EVk9g\nsQ8J2FJI6bKZwXcOUjO6p9m6CDReOeU6OPAi1J3Bs3ptn4CO63cwbhCZYUUBTujS\nKLIjg0BcE3zIpiC9W7Zxw+XECw0Qex+fv9Y3mgSVfNEyysNl1OR5Ox/EfXQbnWyl\nK/2V/rXvGeOqfYoliScIbGUeck/jKhHl4nR6Q49rosIBvqNCerxrp192iGLWZLCG\neom+4ZYFJjC9pwpUTLyuFutScwlMsrcrNoMAioE8QdXcbNX2shKKEqhxZDXcwDzN\nVICNvlXN5iFUvCj9YeaF1hSluRVAkftSPPgO1AIR3Vyb3pvVGKN6S0niUvGbkq+a\nMyomQsRw2NSEca+sEG3z5kuQbVY3lRtyozfPpMa1n+EOY+v5cNJCdFd1VniDSH5w\nQ2ZhGOqWnzTGXiKPIOsfLntm1JdIiYmTn2WA1WUJYj5Km1H8CvKw0Z1DAgcV6z5T\nPkVvsTMbYDjPaJ5aHrgUJUMt709DyDBlb7LpJPQTnxFCUgnd6sLsOv6+tmTIAQg6\noapLd/xZ6OrZM5xSNe2JJnPT0Hs0+D7eq5tO00Vo0WdQNMmKGBYG4giy5jVp2vaY\ny/6LvU4GKQmYAtdRHukV\n=XYJA\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-06T14:39:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu