l":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commit/ec046d9a4225123107ed0d881358d16d115de416","node_id":"C_kwDOEAWiEdoAKGVjMDQ2ZDlhNDIyNTEyMzEwN2VkMGQ4ODEzNThkMTZkMTE1ZGU0MTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commit/42ed066b92f16cd02e90c1b3def537581b31df18","sha":"42ed066b92f16cd02e90c1b3def537581b31df18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/42ed066b92f16cd02e90c1b3def537581b31df18"}],"sha":"ec046d9a4225123107ed0d881358d16d115de416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/ec046d9a4225123107ed0d881358d16d115de416"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274008925?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/diwakarsharma2","id":274008925,"login":"diwakarsharma2","node_id":"U_kgDOEFULXQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/diwakarsharma2","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/42ed066b92f16cd02e90c1b3def537581b31df18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:26:22Z","email":"diwakar.sharma2@ibm.com","name":"diwakarsharma2"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T18:26:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"code modified for check inference service (#9675)\n\n* code modified for check inference service\n\n* code updated\n\n* code updated\n\n* code updated\n\n* fix: correct stale maxAttempts comment (30 s wait × 96 = ~48 min, not 8 min)\n\n* fix(modelServing): use targetModelState/transitionStatus as authoritative terminal-failure signals\n\nKServe does not reliably set activeModelState=''Failed'' on a load failure:\n- Standard mode never writes activeModelState (stays empty)\n- RawDeployment first-load: activeModelState stays '''' until the controller catches up\n- Redeployment failure: activeModelState still shows ''Loaded'' for the old revision\n\nThe authoritative KServe terminal-failure signals are:\n  targetModelState === ''FailedToLoad''\n  transitionStatus === ''BlockedByFailedLoad''\n\nChanges:\n- Hoist buildConditionDetails before all early-exit blocks so it is available\n  to every error message (was previously defined after the success return)\n- Add isTerminalLoadFailure guard that checks targetModelState and\n  transitionStatus, includes lastFailureInfo.reason/.message and full\n  condition details in the thrown error\n- Retain legacy activeModelState===''Failed'' guard for older KServe controllers,\n  clearly labelled and positioned after the primary guard\n- Fix success/failure check ordering: terminal guards run before success check\n- Normalise all multi-line error strings to template-literal concatenation style\n  so Prettier does not reformat them on commit\n- Update timeout message from ''8 minutes'' to ''~48 minutes'' to match\n  the actual 30 s × 96 attempts budget\n\n* code updated\n\n* code updated\n\n* added wait time as per cluster arch\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: diwakarsharma160 <diwakarsharma160@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"60407a305686ab1ba18b7d90845642f13a12bcdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/60407a305686ab1ba18b7d90845642f13a12bcdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/commits/42ed066b92f16cd02e90c1b3def537581b31df18","verification":{"payload":"tree 60407a305686ab1ba18b7d90845642f13a12bcdb\nparent 3c6750136543242d62f2f8e12ea25b32ac12acfe\nauthor diwakarsharma2 <diwakar.sharma2@ibm.com> 1791224782 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791224782 +0000\n\ncode modified for check inference service (#9675)\n\n* code modified for check inference service\n\n* code updated\n\n* code updated\n\n* code updated\n\n* fix: correct stale maxAttempts comment (30 s wait × 96 = ~48 min, not 8 min)\n\n* fix(modelServing): use targetModelState/transitionStatus as authoritative terminal-failure signals\n\nKServe does not reliably set activeModelState=''Failed'' on a load failure:\n- Standard mode never writes activeModelState (stays empty)\n- RawDeployment first-load: activeModelState stays '''' until the controller catches up\n- Redeployment failure: activeModelState still shows ''Loaded'' for the old revision\n\nThe authoritative KServe terminal-failure signals are:\n  targetModelState === ''FailedToLoad''\n  transitionStatus === ''BlockedByFailedLoad''\n\nChanges:\n- Hoist buildConditionDetails before all early-exit blocks so it is available\n  to every error message (was previously defined after the success return)\n- Add isTerminalLoadFailure guard that checks targetModelState and\n  transitionStatus, includes lastFailureInfo.reason/.message and full\n  condition details in the thrown error\n- Retain legacy activeModelState===''Failed'' guard for older KServe controllers,\n  clearly labelled and positioned after the primary guard\n- Fix success/failure check ordering: terminal guards run before success check\n- Normalise all multi-line error strings to template-literal concatenation style\n  so Prettier does not reformat them on commit\n- Update timeout message from ''8 minutes'' to ''~48 minutes'' to match\n  the actual 30 s × 96 attempts budget\n\n* code updated\n\n* code updated\n\n* added wait time as per cluster arch\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: diwakarsharma160 <diwakarsharma160@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw+vOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAok4QABW3dZxLH2m/cLL9mM4VSkmj\ncEzcu5lZRpvFgbi+RmxTFZrFMCWjFieGX09aeeRqrOeM+T9o16pUu8LydzJqFaDx\njTrL2suv330LOE95UvZKjzLSIRyXKngqs7XT8Et72sBzubJ//k6rBn21HJ2EAwOm\nTsOiYaUnPkxSQ3KMd86ixOZj6qaCJm3/ZCWgYi0EpOq0CLEEtp1XAdP/Py4kCqx0\nP7OIWeHJr+HWXNLIrQowWy27wtPWAISKGTlaoF8tQIqsFULcuxUAilndCsrA5A/3\n8FXZ58u5zBWLRyEwddNGs1YYKPjFWyOn4kPhIaJIKaRkuw+L6Te/NAHNLjIfkgn8\nvvZYZIHCPWgOsZiLi5FKM6RU4W7Ir4g5h35jDOpOvn5uFbXvpZVbPajK7Px03B7u\nv095qSNfQc1un8JYPYXWaD8QhorCBX5MPBcSzcW2qn/Xnfnpocen3a9CXGrnOC9N\nPtowbn4Ulnb4FWX5SVmMbXodHYWYDO3vZytfbC02urxpNk9up57pqnIAMo/k33Y4\nSrR+aQ9K3rlWBlcLH+Obbp/FZp/yjYb7zpzsLY/WTMbkUNeWJ5g9CD4eESkXTGt7\ny5+k/tks3WDlSq8liyxmpCxLGcy5TJv+el2tXsMtnJrUldMPmwrDSrZgI/9jvSdi\ns1O+9IJgwQcAbymvTbzm\n=Ul0k\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T18:26:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","f