ithub.com/users/jkyaw/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkyaw/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkyaw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkyaw/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jkyaw","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/commits/3c6750136543242d62f2f8e12ea25b32ac12acfe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:54:34Z","email":"jkyaw@redhat.com","name":"Julia Kyaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T17:54:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"AutoML/AutoRAG UI - Improve pipeline visualization (#9895)\n\n* RHOAIENG-88699: Align AutoRAG run pipeline topology with UX design\n\nMatch collapsed and expanded tree chrome—status badges, winner ranks, running corridor pulse, and pattern table layout—without changing AutoML.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* RHOAIENG-88699: Port AutoRAG pipeline topology UX to AutoML\n\nMatch AutoML''s expanded stage map to the AutoRAG design, and tighten row-label and expand-toggle spacing so fan-out lines, Pattern/Model names, and the first branch nodes align.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* RHOAIENG-88699: Match corridor dots and stage rings to design\n\nShrink branch-step nodes on the spine, draw them as thin donuts, and thicken completed stage rings so AutoRAG and AutoML match the UX spec.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix AutoML and AutoRAG review findings\n\n* Address AutoML and AutoRAG review comments\n\n* Fix AutoML and AutoRAG topology review findings\n\n* Fix AutoRAG resolved winner styling\n\n* test(autorag): verify unreached winner state\n\n* fix(autorag): color ranked pattern nodes\n\n* fix(automl): harden tree view data handling\n\n* fix(autorag): preserve winner rank semantics\n\n* fix(autorag): restore ranked node colors\n\n* Fix AutoML and AutoRAG frontend test failures\n\n* Address AutoML and AutoRAG review feedback\n\n* fix(topology): pulse running status badge\n\n* fix(topology): limit pulse to corridor dots\n\n* Reduce pipeline visualization height\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"198a6b6a8ca9d487eaeb149ccaa544897d13f1ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/trees/198a6b6a8ca9d487eaeb149ccaa544897d13f1ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/opendatahub-io/odh-dashboard/git/commits/3c6750136543242d62f2f8e12ea25b32ac12acfe","verification":{"payload":"tree 198a6b6a8ca9d487eaeb149ccaa544897d13f1ee\nparent f534010b67c9b1ab93cff728d3bb42068740eb98\nauthor Julia Kyaw <jkyaw@redhat.com> 1791222874 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791222874 +0000\n\nAutoML/AutoRAG UI - Improve pipeline visualization (#9895)\n\n* RHOAIENG-88699: Align AutoRAG run pipeline topology with UX design\n\nMatch collapsed and expanded tree chrome—status badges, winner ranks, running corridor pulse, and pattern table layout—without changing AutoML.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* RHOAIENG-88699: Port AutoRAG pipeline topology UX to AutoML\n\nMatch AutoML''s expanded stage map to the AutoRAG design, and tighten row-label and expand-toggle spacing so fan-out lines, Pattern/Model names, and the first branch nodes align.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* RHOAIENG-88699: Match corridor dots and stage rings to design\n\nShrink branch-step nodes on the spine, draw them as thin donuts, and thicken completed stage rings so AutoRAG and AutoML match the UX spec.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>\n\n* Fix AutoML and AutoRAG review findings\n\n* Address AutoML and AutoRAG review comments\n\n* Fix AutoML and AutoRAG topology review findings\n\n* Fix AutoRAG resolved winner styling\n\n* test(autorag): verify unreached winner state\n\n* fix(autorag): color ranked pattern nodes\n\n* fix(automl): harden tree view data handling\n\n* fix(autorag): preserve winner rank semantics\n\n* fix(autorag): restore ranked node colors\n\n* Fix AutoML and AutoRAG frontend test failures\n\n* Address AutoML and AutoRAG review feedback\n\n* fix(topology): pulse running status badge\n\n* fix(topology): limit pulse to corridor dots\n\n* Reduce pipeline visualization height\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw+RaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhbYQAKBg2zRifWPi5XNzuFBCw9d8\n+f4Rqz1Da42ACkXYbKGhH5iuJrAkXe9GQf/giZjl/FnN9VmrdNon2PrbPY2mnm9h\n6aYqZ+x3AeJKzmcDG0yrbEfOd0uMJjcHnFETZ8UPqplKYtS6+Nj2kt62TEK+iBVG\nqWdg2Btnvvfn5iKQlMV9QZGUQD0lTgWsycX4tl79TgdMdvz/Y68bj0Edb92z3ni2\ntXckT4G8d52Wz6v6XwYAPabAgWZwhA4TP7XNL32KLmp9c/wwstERc2eSEnfsatEk\ndMfttluKW+f3WvlcmVmDqQuOqe6NIYGf1VYB63sbc32YrhF/VSWXiz3g9yyjywxF\nq8jqnkJT+nSlVUpIZqz2wHyPyr0ubM/g33GW1d8z2vL8EmkKUvjYG7X1EoU3glYr\nD0gVQaALww7JhtIx9HcmcBWUbZjQurusGk3gV5sVPsRwbsBOQ1wNDZtzTJCfZPtN\nN11mvO6yN/nxa9L6dojJofdut5EtBC3TZRkqk4l2ZNUjbXe4XO4XTNe02dXrrIY6\nJ9suU0cP0xPAgiil1Jeu3dYN3oms4fHZKgPzUEXGtVQ0P3esGdOuIIn6BhM+nBaE\nfyrPA5Ttya1UJnmPUE3WsoJNtipUwO+8hDfb9Ssrvb27ToAbUP5gknb1ph7GcnVs\nwZc0B2Hcih8LNPkb+N7D\n=3/Vf\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T17:54:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url